Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:36.94,*ENG,1,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:41.98,*ENG,2,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.70,*ENG,3,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.91,*ENG,4,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.74,*ENG,5,0,0,0,,Lumos Maxima!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:42.77,*ENG,7,0,0,0,,Harry. Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:44.91,*ENG,8,0,0,0,,Harry, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.12,*ENG,9,0,0,0,,Marge. How lovely to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:57.66,*ENG,10,0,0,0,,Uncle Vernon, I need you to sign this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.16,*ENG,11,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.45,*ENG,12,0,0,0,,Nothing. School stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.63,0:02:04.29,*ENG,13,0,0,0,,Later perhaps, if you behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.66,*ENG,14,0,0,0,,I will if she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:10.00,*ENG,15,0,0,0,,- Oh, you're still here, are you? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:13.00,*ENG,16,0,0,0,,Don't say yes in that ungrateful way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:15.18,*ENG,17,0,0,0,,Damn good of my brother to keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:19.64,*ENG,18,0,0,0,,He'd have been straight to an orphanage if he'd been dumped on my doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:24.18,*ENG,19,0,0,0,,Is that my Dudders? Is that my little neffy-pooh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:26.15,*ENG,20,0,0,0,,Give us a kiss. Come on. Up, up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.32,0:02:28.59,*ENG,21,0,0,0,,Take Marge's suitcase upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:30.78,*ENG,22,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:37.03,*ENG,23,0,0,0,,Finish that off for Mommy. Good boy, Rippy-pooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:41.04,*ENG,24,0,0,0,,- Can I tempt you, Marge? - Just a small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.14,*ENG,25,0,0,0,,Excellent nosh, Petunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.71,*ENG,26,0,0,0,,A bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:50.61,*ENG,27,0,0,0,,Usually just a fry-up for me, what with 12 dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.37,*ENG,28,0,0,0,,Just a bit more. That's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:58.44,*ENG,29,0,0,0,,You wanna try a little drop of brandy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.65,*ENG,30,0,0,0,,A little drop of brandy-brandy windy-wandy for Rippy-pippy-pooh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.96,*ENG,31,0,0,0,,What are you smirking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:07.99,*ENG,32,0,0,0,,Where did you send the boy, Vernon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:11.50,*ENG,33,0,0,0,,St. Brutus'. It's a fine institution for hopeless cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.66,*ENG,34,0,0,0,,Do they use a cane at St. Brutus', boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.37,*ENG,35,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:22.34,*ENG,36,0,0,0,,Yeah. I've been beaten loads of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:25.07,*ENG,37,0,0,0,,Excellent. I won't have this namby-pamby...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:28.41,*ENG,38,0,0,0,,...wishy-washy nonsense about not beating people who deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.68,*ENG,39,0,0,0,,You mustn't blame yourself about how this one turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:35.79,*ENG,40,0,0,0,,It's all to do with blood. Bad blood will out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:38.12,*ENG,41,0,0,0,,What is it the boy's father did, Petunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:41.29,*ENG,42,0,0,0,,Nothing. He didn't work. He was unemployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:44.29,*ENG,43,0,0,0,,- And a drunk too, no doubt? - That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:47.02,*ENG,44,0,0,0,,- What did you say? - My dad wasn't a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:54.10,*ENG,45,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Don't fuss, Petunia. I have a very firm grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:56.14,*ENG,46,0,0,0,,I think it's time you went to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:03:59.51,*ENG,47,0,0,0,,Quiet, Vernon. You, clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:03.71,*ENG,48,0,0,0,,Actually, it's nothing to do with the father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:07.84,*ENG,49,0,0,0,,It's all to do with the mother. You see it all the time with dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:12.08,*ENG,50,0,0,0,,If something's wrong with the bitch, then something's wrong with the pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.96,*ENG,51,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:20.70,*ENG,52,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:23.00,*ENG,53,0,0,0,,Let me tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.59,*ENG,54,0,0,0,,Vernon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.43,*ENG,55,0,0,0,,Vernon! Vernon, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.87,*ENG,56,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:42.01,*ENG,57,0,0,0,,I've got you, Marge. I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:47.45,*ENG,58,0,0,0,,- Hold on, hold on. - Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:50.52,*ENG,59,0,0,0,,- Don't you dare! - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.52,*ENG,60,0,0,0,,Oh, Vernon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.42,*ENG,61,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.39,*ENG,62,0,0,0,,Marge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.74,*ENG,63,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:09.54,*ENG,64,0,0,0,,Marge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:13.77,*ENG,65,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:40.21,*ENG,66,0,0,0,,You bring her back! You bring her back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:43.61,*ENG,67,0,0,0,,- You put her right! - No. She deserved what she got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:47.17,*ENG,68,0,0,0,,- Keep away from me. - You can't do magic outside school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.37,*ENG,69,0,0,0,,- Yeah? Try me. - They won't let you back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.88,*ENG,70,0,0,0,,You've nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.39,*ENG,71,0,0,0,,I don't care. Anywhere is better than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:32.38,*ENG,72,0,0,0,,"Welcome to the Knight Bus...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:35.92,*ENG,73,0,0,0,,...emergency transport for the stranded witch or wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:41.05,*ENG,74,0,0,0,,My name is Stan Shunpike, and I will be your conductor for this evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.27,*ENG,75,0,0,0,,What you doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.13,*ENG,76,0,0,0,,- I fell over. - What you fell over for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:52.00,*ENG,77,0,0,0,,- I didn't do it on purpose. - Well, come on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:54.40,*ENG,78,0,0,0,,Let's not wait for the grass to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:04.54,*ENG,79,0,0,0,,- What you looking at? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.45,*ENG,80,0,0,0,,Well, come on, then. In.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.45,*ENG,81,0,0,0,,No, no, no. I'll get this. You get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:16.62,*ENG,82,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:29.31,*ENG,83,0,0,0,,Come on. Move on, move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:47.29,*ENG,84,0,0,0,,- Take her away, Ern. - Yeah, take it away, Ernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:49.69,*ENG,85,0,0,0,,It's going to be a bumpy ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:03.67,*ENG,86,0,0,0,,- What did you say your name was? - I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:08.34,*ENG,87,0,0,0,,- Whereabouts are you headed? - The Leaky Cauldron. That's in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:11.52,*ENG,88,0,0,0,,You hear that? "The Leaky Cauldron. That's in London."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:15.02,*ENG,89,0,0,0,,The Leaky Cauldron. If you have pea soup...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:17.99,*ENG,90,0,0,0,,...make sure you eat it before it eats you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:23.02,*ENG,91,0,0,0,,- But the Muggles. Can't they see us? - Muggles?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:24.93,*ENG,92,0,0,0,,They don't see nothing, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.66,*ENG,93,0,0,0,,No, but if you jab them with a fork, they feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.50,*ENG,94,0,0,0,,Ernie, little old lady at 12 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.71,*ENG,95,0,0,0,,Ten, nine, eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:46.65,*ENG,96,0,0,0,,...seven, six, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:49.08,*ENG,97,0,0,0,,...four, three, three and a half...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:51.09,*ENG,98,0,0,0,,...two, one and three quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.25,*ENG,99,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.00,*ENG,100,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.60,*ENG,101,0,0,0,,That man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:05.07,*ENG,102,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.74,*ENG,103,0,0,0,,Who is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:09.37,*ENG,104,0,0,0,,That is Sirius Black, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:13.18,*ENG,105,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've never been hearing of Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.75,*ENG,106,0,0,0,,He's a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:19.55,*ENG,107,0,0,0,,Got himself locked up in Azkaban for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.62,*ENG,108,0,0,0,,- How did he escape? - Well, that's the question, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:25.76,*ENG,109,0,0,0,,He's the first one that done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.73,0:11:29.36,*ENG,110,0,0,0,,He was a big supporter of...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:31.36,*ENG,111,0,0,0,,...You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:33.93,*ENG,112,0,0,0,,I reckon you've heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.69,*ENG,113,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.20,*ENG,114,0,0,0,,Him I've heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:42.60,*ENG,115,0,0,0,,Ernie, two double-deckers at 12 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.74,*ENG,116,0,0,0,,They're getting closer, Ernie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:47.78,*ENG,117,0,0,0,,Ernie, they're right on top of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:57.59,*ENG,118,0,0,0,,Mind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.43,*ENG,119,0,0,0,,Hey, guys? Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:06.79,*ENG,120,0,0,0,,Why the long faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:15.11,*ENG,121,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Nearly there. Nearly there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:23.88,*ENG,122,0,0,0,,- The Leaky Cauldron. - Next stop, Knockturn Alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.88,*ENG,123,0,0,0,,Mr. Potter, at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:33.62,*ENG,124,0,0,0,,- Take it away, Ern. - Yeah, take it away, Ernie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:58.65,*ENG,125,0,0,0,,Room 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.55,*ENG,126,0,0,0,,Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:05.56,*ENG,127,0,0,0,,Right smart bird you got there, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:09.42,*ENG,128,0,0,0,,He arrived here just five minutes before yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:14.96,*ENG,129,0,0,0,,As Minister for Magic, it is my duty to inform you, Mr. Potter...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:18.37,*ENG,130,0,0,0,,...earlier this evening your uncle's sister was located...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:22.50,*ENG,131,0,0,0,,...a little south of Sheffield, circling a chimney stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:26.37,*ENG,132,0,0,0,,The Accidental Magic Reversal Department was dispatched immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:31.35,*ENG,133,0,0,0,,She has been properly punctured and her memory modified.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:36.25,*ENG,134,0,0,0,,She will have no recollection of the incident whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:39.02,*ENG,135,0,0,0,,So that's that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:42.06,*ENG,136,0,0,0,,...and no harm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:44.06,*ENG,137,0,0,0,,Pea soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.36,*ENG,138,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:48.73,*ENG,139,0,0,0,,- Minister? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.70,*ENG,140,0,0,0,,- I don't understand. - Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:54.40,*ENG,141,0,0,0,,I broke the law. Underage wizards can't use magic at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:57.58,*ENG,142,0,0,0,,Come now. The Ministry doesn't send people to Azkaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:14:00.30,*ENG,143,0,0,0,,...for blowing up their aunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:08.81,*ENG,144,0,0,0,,On the other hand, running away like that, given the state of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:11.46,*ENG,145,0,0,0,,...was very, very irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:15.43,*ENG,146,0,0,0,,- "The state of things," sir? - We have a killer on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:17.43,*ENG,147,0,0,0,,Sirius Black, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.36,*ENG,148,0,0,0,,But what's he got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:26.50,*ENG,149,0,0,0,,Nothing, of course. You're safe. And that's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:29.83,*ENG,150,0,0,0,,And tomorrow you'll be on your way back to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.95,*ENG,151,0,0,0,,These are your new schoolbooks. I took the liberty...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:37.11,*ENG,152,0,0,0,,...of having them brought here. Now Tom will show you to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.32,*ENG,153,0,0,0,,Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:48.49,*ENG,154,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, Harry. Whilst you're here, it would be best if you didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:51.29,*ENG,155,0,0,0,,...wander.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:55.77,*ENG,156,0,0,0,,Right! You gonna move that bus or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:15.15,*ENG,157,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.54,*ENG,158,0,0,0,,Housekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:22.22,*ENG,159,0,0,0,,I'll come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:31.23,*ENG,160,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:35.10,*ENG,161,0,0,0,,Keep that beast away from Scabbers, or I'll turn it into a tea cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:37.40,*ENG,162,0,0,0,,It's a cat, Ronald. What do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:40.54,*ENG,163,0,0,0,,- It's in his nature. - A cat? Is that what they told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:43.23,*ENG,164,0,0,0,,- Looks like a pig with hair. - That's rich...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:45.94,*ENG,165,0,0,0,,...coming from the owner of that smelly old shoe brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:48.60,*ENG,166,0,0,0,,Crookshanks, just ignore the mean little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.34,*ENG,167,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.85,*ENG,168,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:57.08,*ENG,169,0,0,0,,- Egypt. What's it like? - Brilliant. Loads of old stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:17:00.62,*ENG,170,0,0,0,,...like mummies, tombs, even Scabbers enjoyed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:04.02,*ENG,171,0,0,0,,- Egyptians used to worship cats. - Along with the dung beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:07.36,*ENG,172,0,0,0,,- Not flashing that clipping again? - I haven't shown anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:09.97,*ENG,173,0,0,0,,No, not a soul. Not unless you count Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:11.57,*ENG,174,0,0,0,,- The day maid. - Night maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.80,*ENG,175,0,0,0,,- Cook. - The bloke who fixed the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.44,*ENG,176,0,0,0,,- Harry. - Mrs. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.74,*ENG,177,0,0,0,,- Good to see you, dear. - Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.24,*ENG,178,0,0,0,,- Got everything? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.57,*ENG,179,0,0,0,,- Yes? All your books? - It's all upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:23.15,*ENG,180,0,0,0,,- Your clothes? - Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:24.58,*ENG,181,0,0,0,,- Good boy. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.78,*ENG,182,0,0,0,,- Harry Potter. - Mr. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:30.45,*ENG,183,0,0,0,,- Harry, wonder if I might have a word? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:33.29,*ENG,184,0,0,0,,- Hermione. - Good morning, Mr. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:37.09,*ENG,185,0,0,0,,- Looking forward to a new term? - Yeah. It should be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:44.00,*ENG,186,0,0,0,,Harry, some within the Ministry would strongly discourage me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.87,*ENG,187,0,0,0,,...from divulging what I'm about to reveal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:50.34,*ENG,188,0,0,0,,But I think that you need to know the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:53.11,*ENG,189,0,0,0,,You are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:56.25,*ENG,190,0,0,0,,Grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:59.38,*ENG,191,0,0,0,,Has this anything to do with Sirius Black, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:02.59,*ENG,192,0,0,0,,What do you know about Sirius Black, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:06.45,*ENG,193,0,0,0,,- Only that he's escaped from Azkaban. - Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:09.96,*ENG,194,0,0,0,,Thirteen years ago, when you stopped...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:12.00,*ENG,195,0,0,0,,- Voldemort. - Don't say his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.50,*ENG,196,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:16.57,*ENG,197,0,0,0,,When you stopped You-Know-Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.33,*ENG,198,0,0,0,,...Black lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:22.84,*ENG,199,0,0,0,,But to this day, he still remains a faithful servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:25.14,*ENG,200,0,0,0,,And in his mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.31,0:18:28.30,*ENG,201,0,0,0,,...you are the only thing that stands in the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:32.21,*ENG,202,0,0,0,,...of You-Know-Who returning to power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.55,*ENG,203,0,0,0,,And that is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:37.28,*ENG,204,0,0,0,,...he has escaped from Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:39.32,*ENG,205,0,0,0,,To find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:42.42,*ENG,206,0,0,0,,And kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:46.03,*ENG,207,0,0,0,,Harry, swear to me that whatever you might hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.73,*ENG,208,0,0,0,,...you won't go looking for Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.50,*ENG,209,0,0,0,,Mr. Weasley...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:54.63,*ENG,210,0,0,0,,...why would I go looking for someone who wants to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:57.17,*ENG,211,0,0,0,,Quick. Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:18:59.18,*ENG,212,0,0,0,,Ron, Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.97,*ENG,213,0,0,0,,Oh, for goodness' sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:04.65,*ENG,214,0,0,0,,Don't lose him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:07.75,*ENG,215,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to blow her up. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.39,*ENG,216,0,0,0,,- I lost control. - Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:14.15,*ENG,217,0,0,0,,Honestly, Ron, it's not funny. Harry was lucky not to be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:16.06,*ENG,218,0,0,0,,I was lucky not to be arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.26,*ENG,219,0,0,0,,I still think it was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.20,*ENG,220,0,0,0,,Come on. Everywhere else is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:25.44,*ENG,221,0,0,0,,Who do you think that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.61,0:19:28.47,*ENG,222,0,0,0,,225 - Professor R.J. Lupin. - Do you know everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:30.74,*ENG,223,0,0,0,,How is it she knows everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:34.04,*ENG,224,0,0,0,,- It's on his suitcase, Ronald. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.35,0:19:37.61,*ENG,225,0,0,0,,- Do you think he's really asleep? - Seems to be. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:41.48,*ENG,226,0,0,0,,I gotta tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:58.20,*ENG,227,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight. Sirius Black escaped from Azkaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:00.31,*ENG,228,0,0,0,,- ...to come after you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.37,*ENG,229,0,0,0,,But they'll catch Black, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:05.31,*ENG,230,0,0,0,,- I mean, everyone's looking for him. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:08.81,*ENG,231,0,0,0,,Except no one's ever broken out of Azkaban before...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:12.82,*ENG,232,0,0,0,,- ...and he's a murderous, raving lunatic. - Thanks, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:15.88,*ENG,233,0,0,0,,Why are we stopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.69,*ENG,234,0,0,0,,We can't be there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:25.16,*ENG,235,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:28.03,*ENG,236,0,0,0,,I don't know. Maybe we've broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.34,*ENG,237,0,0,0,,Ouch, Ron. That was my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.14,*ENG,238,0,0,0,,There's something moving out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:51.72,*ENG,239,0,0,0,,I think someone's coming aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.78,*ENG,240,0,0,0,,Bloody hell! What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:33.32,*ENG,241,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.26,*ENG,242,0,0,0,,Harry, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.10,*ENG,243,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:47.74,*ENG,244,0,0,0,,Here, eat this. It'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:50.33,*ENG,245,0,0,0,,It's all right. It's chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.65,0:22:58.71,*ENG,246,0,0,0,,What was that thing that came?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.89,0:23:02.32,*ENG,247,0,0,0,,It was a dementor. One of the guards of Azkaban. It's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:05.19,*ENG,248,0,0,0,,It was searching the train for Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:08.99,*ENG,249,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me, I need to have a little word with the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:16.54,*ENG,250,0,0,0,,Eat. You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.64,*ENG,251,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.81,0:23:25.54,*ENG,252,0,0,0,,Well, you sort of went rigid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.71,0:23:28.88,*ENG,253,0,0,0,,We thought maybe you were having a fit or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.65,0:23:32.41,*ENG,254,0,0,0,,And did either of you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:33.92,*ENG,255,0,0,0,,...you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:37.18,*ENG,256,0,0,0,,- ...pass out? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.36,0:23:39.05,*ENG,257,0,0,0,,I felt weird, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:41.06,*ENG,258,0,0,0,,Like I'd never be cheerful again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:44.52,*ENG,259,0,0,0,,But someone was screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:46.10,*ENG,260,0,0,0,,A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:49.04,*ENG,261,0,0,0,,No one was screaming, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:16.75,*ENG,262,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.23,0:24:52.13,*ENG,263,0,0,0,,Welcome! Welcome to another year at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:54.32,*ENG,264,0,0,0,,267 Now, I'd like to say a few words...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:58.87,*ENG,265,0,0,0,,...before we all become too befuddled by our excellent feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:02.34,*ENG,266,0,0,0,,First, I'm pleased to welcome Professor R.J. Lupin...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.51,0:25:04.91,*ENG,267,0,0,0,,...who's kindly consented to fill the post...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.11,0:25:07.58,*ENG,268,0,0,0,,...of Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.75,0:25:10.27,*ENG,269,0,0,0,,Good luck, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.89,0:25:18.22,*ENG,270,0,0,0,,Of course. That's why he knew to give you the chocolate, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.39,0:25:21.05,*ENG,271,0,0,0,,Potter. Is it true you fainted?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:24.89,*ENG,272,0,0,0,,- I mean, you actually fainted? - Shove off, Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.10,0:25:27.07,*ENG,273,0,0,0,,- How did he find out? - Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:29.60,*ENG,274,0,0,0,,Our Care of Magical Creatures teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.84,0:25:31.70,*ENG,275,0,0,0,,...has decided to retire...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.91,0:25:35.64,*ENG,276,0,0,0,,...in order to spend more time with his remaining limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:38.50,*ENG,277,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I'm delighted to announce...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.68,0:25:41.51,*ENG,278,0,0,0,,...that his place will be taken by none other...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:46.02,*ENG,279,0,0,0,,...than our own Rubeus Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.30,0:26:00.10,*ENG,280,0,0,0,,Finally, on a more disquieting note...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:02.79,*ENG,281,0,0,0,,...at the request of the Ministry of Magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.04,0:26:08.20,*ENG,282,0,0,0,,...Hogwarts will, until further notice, play host to the dementors of Azkaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.88,0:26:12.28,*ENG,283,0,0,0,,...until such a time as Sirius Black is captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:16.94,*ENG,284,0,0,0,,The dementors will be stationed at every entrance to the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:18.78,*ENG,285,0,0,0,,Now whilst I've been assured...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:22.62,*ENG,286,0,0,0,,...that their presence will not disrupt our day-to-day activities...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.79,0:26:24.12,*ENG,287,0,0,0,,...a word of caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.32,0:26:27.49,*ENG,288,0,0,0,,Dementors are vicious creatures. They'll not distinguish...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.66,0:26:31.10,*ENG,289,0,0,0,,...between the one they hunt and the one who gets in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.23,0:26:34.86,*ENG,290,0,0,0,,Therefore, I must warn each and every one of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.07,0:26:38.70,*ENG,291,0,0,0,,...to give them no reason to harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.47,0:26:44.54,*ENG,292,0,0,0,,It is not in the nature of a dementor to be forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:49.98,*ENG,293,0,0,0,,But you know, happiness can be found...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:53.75,*ENG,294,0,0,0,,...even in the darkest of times...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.99,0:26:58.86,*ENG,295,0,0,0,,...if one only remembers to turn on the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.90,0:27:12.90,*ENG,296,0,0,0,,Fortuna Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.74,0:27:18.37,*ENG,297,0,0,0,,Here, listen. She just won't let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.58,0:27:21.51,*ENG,298,0,0,0,,- Fortuna Major. - No, no. Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:23.51,*ENG,299,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.26,0:27:39.22,*ENG,300,0,0,0,,- Amazing. Just with my voice. - Fortuna Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:42.99,*ENG,301,0,0,0,,- Yes, all right. Go in. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.04,0:27:47.01,*ENG,302,0,0,0,,Still doing that after three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.17,0:27:49.30,*ENG,303,0,0,0,,- She can't even sing. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:52.70,*ENG,304,0,0,0,,- Hey, man. - Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.75,0:27:55.11,*ENG,305,0,0,0,,- Oh, God. - That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:58.24,*ENG,306,0,0,0,,Green. That's a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:02.72,*ENG,307,0,0,0,,- What is that? - You call that a monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.89,0:28:05.08,*ENG,308,0,0,0,,Do not give him one again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.26,0:28:07.89,*ENG,309,0,0,0,,Hey, Neville, try an elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:16.73,*ENG,310,0,0,0,,- Ron, catch. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.44,0:28:24.03,*ENG,311,0,0,0,,I think we have a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.98,0:28:27.31,*ENG,312,0,0,0,,- Oh, don't try one of them. - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:30.44,*ENG,313,0,0,0,,Look at him. His face.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.09,0:29:16.32,*ENG,314,0,0,0,,Welcome, my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.53,0:29:21.63,*ENG,315,0,0,0,,In this room, you shall explore the noble art of Divination.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.84,0:29:27.14,*ENG,316,0,0,0,,In this room, you shall discover if you possess the Sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.54,0:29:32.48,*ENG,317,0,0,0,,Hello. I am Professor Trelawney.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:37.24,*ENG,318,0,0,0,,Together we shall cast ourselves into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:41.32,*ENG,319,0,0,0,,This term, we'll focus on Tasseomancy, the art of reading tea leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.49,0:29:45.05,*ENG,320,0,0,0,,So please, take the cup of the person sitting opposite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.56,0:29:46.92,*ENG,321,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.13,0:29:52.76,*ENG,322,0,0,0,,The truth lies buried like a sentence deep within a book, waiting to be read.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:55.40,*ENG,323,0,0,0,,But first, you must broaden your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:30:00.10,*ENG,324,0,0,0,,- First, you must look beyond. - What a load of rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.31,0:30:02.24,*ENG,325,0,0,0,,- Where did you come from? - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:05.04,*ENG,326,0,0,0,,- I've been here all this time. - You, boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.21,0:30:07.51,*ENG,327,0,0,0,,Is your grandmother quite well?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.18,0:30:09.61,*ENG,328,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:12.58,*ENG,329,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure of that. Give me the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.59,0:30:16.95,*ENG,330,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:19.78,*ENG,331,0,0,0,,Broaden your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.40,0:30:26.73,*ENG,332,0,0,0,,Your aura is pulsing, dear. Are you in the beyond?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.80,*ENG,333,0,0,0,,- I think you are. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:31.23,*ENG,334,0,0,0,,Look at the cup. Tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.44,0:30:33.10,*ENG,335,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.97,0:30:38.38,*ENG,336,0,0,0,,Harry's got sort of a wonky cross. That's trials and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.81,0:30:42.44,*ENG,337,0,0,0,,And that there could be the sun and that's happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:43.98,*ENG,338,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.18,0:30:48.21,*ENG,339,0,0,0,,...you're gonna suffer, but you're gonna be happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.42,0:30:49.75,*ENG,340,0,0,0,,Give me the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.33,0:30:54.23,*ENG,341,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.30,0:30:57.96,*ENG,342,0,0,0,,My dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.67,0:31:02.73,*ENG,343,0,0,0,,...you have the Grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.60,0:31:05.30,*ENG,344,0,0,0,,The Grin? What's the Grin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.51,0:31:08.37,*ENG,345,0,0,0,,Not the Grin, you idiot. The Grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.54,0:31:10.70,*ENG,346,0,0,0,,"Taking form of a giant spectral dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:13.34,*ENG,347,0,0,0,,It's among the darkest omens in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.91,0:31:15.57,*ENG,348,0,0,0,,It's an omen...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.75,0:31:17.58,*ENG,349,0,0,0,,...of death."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.22,0:31:25.95,*ENG,350,0,0,0,,You don't think that Grim thing's got anything to do with Sirius Black?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.13,0:31:30.03,*ENG,351,0,0,0,,Oh, honestly, Ron. If you ask me, Divination's a woolly discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.23,0:31:33.86,*ENG,352,0,0,0,,Now, Ancient Runes, that's a fascinating subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:37.20,*ENG,353,0,0,0,,Ancient Runes? Exactly how many classes are you taking?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.37,0:31:39.00,*ENG,354,0,0,0,,A fair few.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.21,0:31:41.30,*ENG,355,0,0,0,,Hang on. That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.47,0:31:44.20,*ENG,356,0,0,0,,Ancient Runes is in the same time as Divination.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.38,0:31:46.37,*ENG,357,0,0,0,,You have to be in two classes at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.55,0:31:49.95,*ENG,358,0,0,0,,Don't be silly. How could anyone be in two classes at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.12,0:31:54.35,*ENG,359,0,0,0,,"Broaden your minds. Use your Inner Eye to see the future."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.52,0:31:59.48,*ENG,360,0,0,0,,That's it. Come on, now. Come closer. Less talking, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.66,0:32:01.49,*ENG,361,0,0,0,,I got a real treat for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.66,0:32:03.65,*ENG,362,0,0,0,,A great lesson. So follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.94,0:32:18.00,*ENG,363,0,0,0,,Right, you lot. Less chattering. Form a group over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.18,0:32:20.67,*ENG,364,0,0,0,,And open your books to page 49.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.85,0:32:22.47,*ENG,365,0,0,0,,Exactly how do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.68,0:32:26.55,*ENG,366,0,0,0,,Just stroke the spine, of course. Goodness me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.93,0:32:39.73,*ENG,367,0,0,0,,- Don't be such a wimp, Longbottom. - I'm okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.44,0:32:46.60,*ENG,368,0,0,0,,- I think they're funny. - Oh, yeah. Terribly funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.87,0:32:49.34,*ENG,369,0,0,0,,Witty. God, this place has gone to the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.54,0:32:53.17,*ENG,370,0,0,0,,Wait until Father hears Dumbledore's got this oaf teaching classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:55.44,*ENG,371,0,0,0,,Shut up, Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.00,0:33:12.02,*ENG,372,0,0,0,,Dementor! Dementor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:23.10,*ENG,373,0,0,0,,- Just ignore him. - You're supposed to stroke it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:24.74,*ENG,374,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.95,0:33:37.95,*ENG,375,0,0,0,,Isn't he beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.12,0:33:40.75,*ENG,376,0,0,0,,Say hello to Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.36,0:33:43.59,*ENG,377,0,0,0,,Hagrid, exactly what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:45.82,*ENG,378,0,0,0,,That, Ron, is a hippogriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.00,0:33:49.49,*ENG,379,0,0,0,,First thing you wanna know is they're very proud creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:53.64,*ENG,380,0,0,0,,Very easily offended. You do not want to insult a hippogriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.81,0:33:56.50,*ENG,381,0,0,0,,It may be the last thing you ever do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.68,0:34:00.08,*ENG,382,0,0,0,,Now, who'd like to come and say hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.62,0:34:04.67,*ENG,383,0,0,0,,Well done, Harry. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:08.89,*ENG,384,0,0,0,,Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:10.75,*ENG,385,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:14.65,*ENG,386,0,0,0,,...you have to let him make the first move. It's only polite. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.83,0:34:16.69,*ENG,387,0,0,0,,...step up. Give him a nice bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.93,0:34:19.33,*ENG,388,0,0,0,,Then you wait and see if he bows back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.50,0:34:21.63,*ENG,389,0,0,0,,If he does, you can go and touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:25.00,*ENG,390,0,0,0,,If not... Well, we'll get to that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.71,0:34:29.70,*ENG,391,0,0,0,,Just make your bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.31,0:34:32.97,*ENG,392,0,0,0,,Nice and low.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.32,0:34:39.98,*ENG,393,0,0,0,,Back off, Harry. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.85,0:34:43.34,*ENG,394,0,0,0,,Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.02,0:34:47.02,*ENG,395,0,0,0,,Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:59.66,*ENG,396,0,0,0,,Well done, Harry. Well done. Here, you big brute, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.18,0:35:04.67,*ENG,397,0,0,0,,Right. I think you can go and pat him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:06.71,*ENG,398,0,0,0,,Go on. Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.15,0:35:17.59,*ENG,399,0,0,0,,Nice and slow, now. Nice and slow. Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.96,0:35:22.36,*ENG,400,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.50,0:35:30.70,*ENG,401,0,0,0,,Slow down, Harry. That's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.94,0:35:34.10,*ENG,402,0,0,0,,Nice and slow. Now let him come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:38.27,*ENG,403,0,0,0,,Slowly, now, slowly, slowly...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.51,0:35:40.27,*ENG,404,0,0,0,,That's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.91,0:35:42.24,*ENG,405,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.85,0:35:46.25,*ENG,406,0,0,0,,Well done! Well done, Harry, well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.42,0:35:48.41,*ENG,407,0,0,0,,Does he get to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.62,0:35:51.02,*ENG,408,0,0,0,,- I think he may let you ride him now. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.22,0:35:52.75,*ENG,409,0,0,0,,- Come on. - Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.93,0:35:56.09,*ENG,410,0,0,0,,Put you over here, just behind the wing joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:36:01.17,*ENG,411,0,0,0,,Don't pull out any of his feathers, because he won't thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:45.59,*ENG,412,0,0,0,,Well done, Harry, and well done, Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:47.74,*ENG,413,0,0,0,,That was wicked, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.94,0:37:49.34,*ENG,414,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.11,0:37:52.41,*ENG,415,0,0,0,,Well done, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.11,0:37:56.31,*ENG,416,0,0,0,,- How am I doing me first day? - Brilliant, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.72,0:38:03.92,*ENG,417,0,0,0,,You're not dangerous at all, are you, you great ugly brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.16,0:38:05.52,*ENG,418,0,0,0,,Malfoy, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.43,0:38:07.89,*ENG,419,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.63,0:38:10.22,*ENG,420,0,0,0,,Buckbeak!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.43,0:38:12.56,*ENG,421,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.77,0:38:15.53,*ENG,422,0,0,0,,Whoa! Buckbeak!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.70,0:38:19.00,*ENG,423,0,0,0,,Away, you silly creature...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.24,0:38:22.30,*ENG,424,0,0,0,,- It's killed me! - Calm down. It's just a scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.54,0:38:23.70,*ENG,425,0,0,0,,Hagrid!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.88,0:38:29.08,*ENG,426,0,0,0,,- He has to be taken to the hospital. - I'm the teacher. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.15,0:38:35.02,*ENG,427,0,0,0,,- You're gonna regret this. - Class dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.19,0:38:37.45,*ENG,428,0,0,0,,You and your bloody chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.95,0:39:02.97,*ENG,429,0,0,0,,Does it hurt terribly, Draco?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:07.05,*ENG,430,0,0,0,,It comes and it goes. Still, I consider myself lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.22,0:39:10.55,*ENG,431,0,0,0,,Madam Pomfrey said another minute and I could've lost my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.89,0:39:13.76,*ENG,432,0,0,0,,- I can't do homework for weeks. - Listen to the idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:18.26,*ENG,433,0,0,0,,- He's really laying it on thick, isn't he? - At least Hagrid didn't get fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:22.19,*ENG,434,0,0,0,,I hear Draco's father's furious. We haven't heard the end of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.44,0:39:24.27,*ENG,435,0,0,0,,- He's been sighted! - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.47,0:39:26.17,*ENG,436,0,0,0,,Sirius Black!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.24,0:39:30.17,*ENG,437,0,0,0,,Dufftown? That's not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.61,0:39:33.24,*ENG,438,0,0,0,,You don't think he'd come to Hogwarts, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.41,0:39:35.90,*ENG,439,0,0,0,,- With dementors at every entrance? - Dementors?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.08,0:39:39.42,*ENG,440,0,0,0,,He slipped past them once. Who's to say he won't do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.62,0:39:44.15,*ENG,441,0,0,0,,That's right. Black could be anywhere. It's like trying to catch smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:48.12,*ENG,442,0,0,0,,Like trying to catch smoke with your bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.25,0:40:16.31,*ENG,443,0,0,0,,Intriguing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.56,0:40:22.32,*ENG,444,0,0,0,,Would anyone like to venture a guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.50,0:40:24.29,*ENG,445,0,0,0,,...as to what is inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.50,0:40:28.49,*ENG,446,0,0,0,,- That's a boggart, that is. - Very good, Mr. Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.30,0:40:32.20,*ENG,447,0,0,0,,Now, can anybody tell me what a boggart looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.41,0:40:34.40,*ENG,448,0,0,0,,- No one knows. - When did she get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.67,0:40:36.14,*ENG,449,0,0,0,,Boggarts are shape-shifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.38,0:40:39.54,*ENG,450,0,0,0,,They take the shape of whatever a person fears the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.78,0:40:44.18,*ENG,451,0,0,0,,- That's what makes them so... - So terrifying, yes, yes, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.38,0:40:49.84,*ENG,452,0,0,0,,Luckily, a very simple charm exists to repel a boggart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.22,0:40:54.99,*ENG,453,0,0,0,,Let's practice it now. Without wands, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.29,0:40:57.79,*ENG,454,0,0,0,,After me. Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.00,0:41:00.09,*ENG,455,0,0,0,,- Riddikulus! - Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:02.83,*ENG,456,0,0,0,,A little louder and very clear. Listen:
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.07,0:41:05.23,*ENG,457,0,0,0,,- Riddikulus! - Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.47,0:41:07.53,*ENG,458,0,0,0,,- This class is ridiculous. - Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.77,0:41:11.73,*ENG,459,0,0,0,,So much for the easy part. You see, the incantation alone is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.94,0:41:15.68,*ENG,460,0,0,0,,What really finishes a boggart is laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.88,0:41:20.28,*ENG,461,0,0,0,,You need to force it to assume a shape you find truly amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.45,0:41:24.58,*ENG,462,0,0,0,,Let me explain. Neville, would you join me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.82,0:41:27.12,*ENG,463,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be shy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.13,0:41:29.82,*ENG,464,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.30,0:41:33.75,*ENG,465,0,0,0,,Hello. Neville, what frightens you most of all?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.00,0:41:35.63,*ENG,466,0,0,0,,Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.90,0:41:37.70,*ENG,467,0,0,0,,- Sorry? - Professor Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.90,0:41:41.30,*ENG,468,0,0,0,,Professor Snape. Yes, frightens all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.47,0:41:45.93,*ENG,469,0,0,0,,- You live with your grandmother. - I don't want it to turn into her, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.45,0:41:48.04,*ENG,470,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.88,0:41:51.65,*ENG,471,0,0,0,,...it won't. I want you to picture her clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.92,0:41:55.11,*ENG,472,0,0,0,,Only her clothes, very clearly, in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.35,0:41:58.41,*ENG,473,0,0,0,,- She carries a red handbag... - We don't need to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.59,0:42:02.46,*ENG,474,0,0,0,,As long as you see it, we'll see it. Now, when I open that wardrobe...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.70,0:42:05.96,*ENG,475,0,0,0,,...here's what I want you to do. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.47,0:42:09.40,*ENG,476,0,0,0,,Imagine Professor Snape in your grandmother's clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.60,0:42:11.30,*ENG,477,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.90,0:42:14.60,*ENG,478,0,0,0,,Yes. Wand at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:18.38,*ENG,479,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.19,0:42:30.09,*ENG,480,0,0,0,,Think, Neville, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.83,0:42:34.88,*ENG,481,0,0,0,,Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.47,0:42:42.09,*ENG,482,0,0,0,,Wonderful, Neville, wonderful! Incredible! Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.30,0:42:45.24,*ENG,483,0,0,0,,...to the back, Neville. Everyone, form a line...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.44,0:42:52.77,*ENG,484,0,0,0,,Form a line!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.95,0:42:56.35,*ENG,485,0,0,0,,I want everyone to picture the thing they fear the very most...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.55,0:42:59.64,*ENG,486,0,0,0,,...and turn it into something funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.85,0:43:01.55,*ENG,487,0,0,0,,Next! Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.79,0:43:08.32,*ENG,488,0,0,0,,Concentrate. Face your fear. Be brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.84,0:43:21.33,*ENG,489,0,0,0,,Wand at the ready, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.11,0:43:23.90,*ENG,490,0,0,0,,Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.08,0:43:25.44,*ENG,491,0,0,0,,Yes!You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.05,0:43:28.95,*ENG,492,0,0,0,,Very good, very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.45,0:43:35.25,*ENG,493,0,0,0,,Marvelous! Absolutely, very, very enjoyable! Parvati! Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:39.25,*ENG,494,0,0,0,,Show us what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.57,0:43:51.97,*ENG,495,0,0,0,,Keep your nerve. Steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.14,0:43:54.11,*ENG,496,0,0,0,,Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.07,*ENG,497,0,0,0,,And next! Step up, step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.18,0:44:00.01,*ENG,498,0,0,0,,Wonderful, wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.03,0:44:16.12,*ENG,499,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.00,0:44:23.80,*ENG,500,0,0,0,,Riddikulus!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.31,0:44:35.25,*ENG,501,0,0,0,,Right. Sorry about that. That's enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.41,0:44:37.41,*ENG,502,0,0,0,,Collect your books from the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.58,0:44:40.21,*ENG,503,0,0,0,,That's the end of the lesson. Thank you! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.39,0:44:43.41,*ENG,504,0,0,0,,Sorry, you can have too much of a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.42,0:44:50.02,*ENG,505,0,0,0,,Remember, these visits to Hogsmeade village are a privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.30,0:44:53.13,*ENG,506,0,0,0,,Should your behavior reflect poorly on the school...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.30,0:44:56.27,*ENG,507,0,0,0,,...that privilege shall not be extended again.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.70,0:45:00.00,*ENG,508,0,0,0,,No permission form signed, no visiting the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.17,0:45:01.70,*ENG,509,0,0,0,,That's the rule, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.94,0:45:05.10,*ENG,510,0,0,0,,Those with permission, follow me. Those without, stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.28,0:45:07.77,*ENG,511,0,0,0,,I thought if you signed it, then I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.95,0:45:10.44,*ENG,512,0,0,0,,I can't. Only a parent or a guardian can sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.62,0:45:13.81,*ENG,513,0,0,0,,Since I am neither, it would be inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:20.68,*ENG,514,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Potter. That's my final word.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.93,0:45:25.16,*ENG,515,0,0,0,,Forget about it, guys. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.98,0:45:41.00,*ENG,516,0,0,0,,Professor, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.21,0:45:45.08,*ENG,517,0,0,0,,You want to know why I stopped you facing that boggart, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.28,0:45:46.68,*ENG,518,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.85,0:45:49.69,*ENG,519,0,0,0,,I assumed it would take the shape of Lord Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.86,0:45:53.35,*ENG,520,0,0,0,,I did think of Voldemort at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.59,0:45:56.19,*ENG,521,0,0,0,,But then I remembered that night on the train...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.40,0:45:58.89,*ENG,522,0,0,0,,- ...and the dementor. - I'm very impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.10,0:46:02.00,*ENG,523,0,0,0,,That suggests what you fear the most is fear itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.17,0:46:03.63,*ENG,524,0,0,0,,This is very wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.84,0:46:05.90,*ENG,525,0,0,0,,Before I fainted...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.17,0:46:08.14,*ENG,526,0,0,0,,...I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.71,0:46:10.27,*ENG,527,0,0,0,,A woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.74,0:46:12.11,*ENG,528,0,0,0,,...screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.31,0:46:15.54,*ENG,529,0,0,0,,Dementors force us to relive our very worst memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.75,0:46:18.68,*ENG,530,0,0,0,,Our pain becomes their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.52,0:46:21.71,*ENG,531,0,0,0,,I think it was my mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.89,0:46:24.12,*ENG,532,0,0,0,,...the night she was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.72,0:46:30.18,*ENG,533,0,0,0,,The very first time I saw you, Harry, I recognized you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.80,0:46:33.63,*ENG,534,0,0,0,,Not by your scar, by your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.07,0:46:36.19,*ENG,535,0,0,0,,They're your mother, Lily's.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.17,0:46:38.60,*ENG,536,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.94,0:46:41.91,*ENG,537,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. I knew her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.24,0:46:48.08,*ENG,538,0,0,0,,Your mother was there for me at a time when no one else was.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.28,0:46:51.51,*ENG,539,0,0,0,,Not only was she a singularly gifted witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.68,0:46:55.02,*ENG,540,0,0,0,,...she was also an uncommonly kind woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.52,0:46:58.58,*ENG,541,0,0,0,,She had a way of seeing the beauty in others...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.76,0:47:04.92,*ENG,542,0,0,0,,...even, and most especially, when that person could not see it in themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.40,0:47:09.09,*ENG,543,0,0,0,,And your father, James, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.30,0:47:10.79,*ENG,544,0,0,0,,...he...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.34,0:47:14.70,*ENG,545,0,0,0,,He had a certain, shall we say, talent for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.94,0:47:22.44,*ENG,546,0,0,0,,A talent, rumor has it, he passed on to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.45,0:47:29.42,*ENG,547,0,0,0,,You're more like them than you know, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.26,0:47:33.38,*ENG,548,0,0,0,,In time, you'll come to see just how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.83,0:47:41.27,*ENG,549,0,0,0,,Honeyduke's Sweetshop is brilliant, but nothing beats Zonko's Joke Shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.47,0:47:43.96,*ENG,550,0,0,0,,We never got to go to the Shrieking Shack.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:48.20,*ENG,551,0,0,0,,- You heard it's the most... - Haunted building in Britain. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.61,0:47:51.08,*ENG,552,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:53.68,*ENG,553,0,0,0,,Probably Neville forgot the password again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.85,0:47:56.28,*ENG,554,0,0,0,,- Hey. - Oh, you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.45,0:48:00.75,*ENG,555,0,0,0,,Let me through, please. Excuse me! I'm Head Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.35,0:48:03.02,*ENG,556,0,0,0,,Get back, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.22,0:48:06.35,*ENG,557,0,0,0,,No one is to enter this dormitory until it's been searched.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.53,0:48:08.86,*ENG,558,0,0,0,,The Fat Lady! She's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.00,0:48:13.43,*ENG,559,0,0,0,,Serves her right. She was a terrible singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.60,0:48:15.50,*ENG,560,0,0,0,,- It's not funny, Ron. - Keep calm, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.54,0:48:22.60,*ENG,561,0,0,0,,- Break into fours.Back to your common room. - Be quiet.The headmaster's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.95,0:48:28.94,*ENG,562,0,0,0,,Make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.11,0:48:31.17,*ENG,563,0,0,0,,Come on, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.35,0:48:33.25,*ENG,564,0,0,0,,You heard. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.50,0:48:50.37,*ENG,565,0,0,0,,Mr. Filch? Round up the ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.70,0:48:54.80,*ENG,566,0,0,0,,Tell them to search every painting in the castle to find the Fat Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.01,0:48:58.03,*ENG,567,0,0,0,,There's no need for ghosts, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.88,0:49:01.00,*ENG,568,0,0,0,,The Fat Lady's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.85,0:49:04.84,*ENG,569,0,0,0,,Mind where you're going! Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.90,0:49:07.08,*ENG,570,0,0,0,,You listen! I'm Head Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.29,0:49:09.69,*ENG,571,0,0,0,,- Come back here! - Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.29,0:49:16.16,*ENG,572,0,0,0,,Dear lady, who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.10,0:49:23.09,*ENG,573,0,0,0,,Eyes like the devil, he's got, and a soul as dark as his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.07,0:49:27.04,*ENG,574,0,0,0,,It's him, headmaster. The one they all talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.24,0:49:29.71,*ENG,575,0,0,0,,He's here, somewhere in the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.91,0:49:32.07,*ENG,576,0,0,0,,Sirius Black!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.31,0:49:37.41,*ENG,577,0,0,0,,Secure the castle, Mr. Filch. The rest of you, to the Great Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.48,0:50:10.41,*ENG,578,0,0,0,,I've searched the Astronomy Tower and the Owlery. There's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.58,0:50:13.14,*ENG,579,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - The third floor's clear too, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.18,0:50:15.29,*ENG,580,0,0,0,,- Very good. - I've done the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.45,0:50:18.12,*ENG,581,0,0,0,,No sign of Black, nor anywhere else in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.36,0:50:20.85,*ENG,582,0,0,0,,I didn't really expect him to linger.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.09,0:50:24.43,*ENG,583,0,0,0,,Remarkable feat, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.60,0:50:26.89,*ENG,584,0,0,0,,To enter Hogwarts Castle on one's own...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.10,0:50:29.73,*ENG,585,0,0,0,,- ...completely undetected? - Quite remarkable, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.97,0:50:31.80,*ENG,586,0,0,0,,Any theories on how he managed it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.00,0:50:34.97,*ENG,587,0,0,0,,Many. Each as unlikely as the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.21,0:50:36.73,*ENG,588,0,0,0,,You may recall...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.91,0:50:39.74,*ENG,589,0,0,0,,...prior to the start of term I expressed concerns...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.91,0:50:41.97,*ENG,590,0,0,0,,...about your appointment of Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:46.24,*ENG,591,0,0,0,,Not a single professor inside this castle would help Sirius Black enter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.42,0:50:48.82,*ENG,592,0,0,0,,I'm quite convinced the castle is safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.99,0:50:52.62,*ENG,593,0,0,0,,...and I'm more than willing to send the students to their houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.79,0:50:55.12,*ENG,594,0,0,0,,What about Potter? Should he be warned?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.33,0:50:57.96,*ENG,595,0,0,0,,Perhaps. But for now, let him sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.83,0:51:03.53,*ENG,596,0,0,0,,For in dreams, we enter a world that's entirely our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.87,0:51:10.33,*ENG,597,0,0,0,,Let them swim in the deepest ocean or glide over the highest cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.68,0:51:51.01,*ENG,598,0,0,0,,Turn to page 394.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.46,0:52:04.02,*ENG,599,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir. Where's Professor Lupin?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.73,0:52:08.19,*ENG,600,0,0,0,,That's not really your concern, is it, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.37,0:52:12.44,*ENG,601,0,0,0,,Suffice it to say your professor finds himself incapable of teaching...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.44,0:52:17.47,*ENG,602,0,0,0,,...at the present time. Turn to page 394.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.28,0:52:23.98,*ENG,603,0,0,0,,"Werewolves"?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.28,0:52:27.05,*ENG,604,0,0,0,,Sir, we just learned about red caps and hinkypunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.29,0:52:30.41,*ENG,605,0,0,0,,- We're not meant to start that for weeks. - Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.62,0:52:33.79,*ENG,606,0,0,0,,When did she come in? Did you see her come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.43,0:52:37.92,*ENG,607,0,0,0,,Now, which one of you can tell me the difference...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.13,0:52:40.60,*ENG,608,0,0,0,,...between an Animagus and a werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.30,0:52:43.20,*ENG,609,0,0,0,,No one?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.74,0:52:46.64,*ENG,610,0,0,0,,- How disappointing. - Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.84,0:52:49.97,*ENG,611,0,0,0,,An Animagus is a wizard who elects to turn into an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.14,0:52:51.67,*ENG,612,0,0,0,,A werewolf has no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.11,0:52:53.81,*ENG,613,0,0,0,,With each full moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.01,0:52:57.88,*ENG,614,0,0,0,,...he no longer remembers who he is. He'd kill his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.08,0:53:01.64,*ENG,615,0,0,0,,The werewolf only responds to the call of its own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.82,0:53:05.59,*ENG,616,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Malfoy. That's the second time...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.76,0:53:08.09,*ENG,617,0,0,0,,...you've spoken out of turn, Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.26,0:53:10.25,*ENG,618,0,0,0,,Are you incapable of restraining yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.43,0:53:13.80,*ENG,619,0,0,0,,...or do you take pride in being an insufferable know-it-all?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.10,0:53:17.50,*ENG,620,0,0,0,,- He's got a point, you know. - Five points from Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.70,0:53:22.30,*ENG,621,0,0,0,,As an antidote to your ignorance, and on my desk, by Monday morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.51,0:53:26.17,*ENG,622,0,0,0,,...two rolls of parchment on the werewolf, with emphasis...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.34,0:53:28.94,*ENG,623,0,0,0,,- ...on recognizing it. - It's Quidditch tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.05,0:53:33.35,*ENG,624,0,0,0,,Then I suggest you take extra care, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.59,0:53:37.61,*ENG,625,0,0,0,,Loss of limb will not excuse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.82,0:53:41.59,*ENG,626,0,0,0,,Page 394.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.60,0:53:45.09,*ENG,627,0,0,0,,The term "werewolf"...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.00,0:53:51.49,*ENG,628,0,0,0,,...is a contraction of the Anglo-Saxon word "wer"...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.50,0:53:56.67,*ENG,629,0,0,0,,...which means "man," and "wolf."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.70,0:53:58.64,*ENG,630,0,0,0,,Werewolf, man-wolf.There are several ways to become a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.84,0:54:01.84,*ENG,631,0,0,0,,They include being given the power of shape-shifting...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.90,0:54:05.01,*ENG,632,0,0,0,,...being bitten by a werewolf...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.87,0:54:26.50,*ENG,633,0,0,0,,- Go, Harry! - Go, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.26,0:56:29.09,*ENG,634,0,0,0,,Aresto momentum!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.33,0:56:34.46,*ENG,635,0,0,0,,- He looks a bit peaky, doesn't he? - Peaky?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.67,0:56:36.93,*ENG,636,0,0,0,,- What do you expect? He fell over 100 feet. - Come on, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:40.00,*ENG,637,0,0,0,,Let's walk you off a tower and see what you look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.21,0:56:43.23,*ENG,638,0,0,0,,Probably a right sight better than he normally does.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.88,0:56:49.85,*ENG,639,0,0,0,,- How are you feeling? - Oh, brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.05,0:56:52.02,*ENG,640,0,0,0,,You gave us a right good scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.28,0:56:56.78,*ENG,641,0,0,0,,- What happened? - Well, you fell off your broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.05,0:56:59.39,*ENG,642,0,0,0,,Really? I meant the match. Who won?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.83,0:57:04.52,*ENG,643,0,0,0,,No one blames you, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.80,0:57:08.60,*ENG,644,0,0,0,,Dementors aren't supposed to be on the grounds. Dumbledore's furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.80,0:57:10.86,*ENG,645,0,0,0,,After he saved you, he sent them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.07,0:57:14.70,*ENG,646,0,0,0,,There's something else you should know too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.31,0:57:21.58,*ENG,647,0,0,0,,When you fell, your broom sort of blew into the Whomping Willow, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.60,0:57:23.57,*ENG,648,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.85,0:57:28.15,*ENG,649,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to hear about your broomstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.45,0:57:30.08,*ENG,650,0,0,0,,Is there no chance of fixing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.29,0:57:31.65,*ENG,651,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.82,0:57:35.16,*ENG,652,0,0,0,,Professor, why do the dementors affect me so?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.56,0:57:38.65,*ENG,653,0,0,0,,- I mean, more than everyone else? - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.83,0:57:41.99,*ENG,654,0,0,0,,Dementors are the foulest creatures to walk this earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.20,0:57:46.47,*ENG,655,0,0,0,,They feed on every good feeling, every happy memory...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.04,0:57:51.57,*ENG,656,0,0,0,,...until a person is left with absolutely nothing but his worst experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.81,0:57:56.01,*ENG,657,0,0,0,,You are not weak, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.18,0:58:00.24,*ENG,658,0,0,0,,Dementors affect you most because there are true horrors in your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.45,0:58:03.55,*ENG,659,0,0,0,,Horrors your classmates can scarcely imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.02,0:58:06.32,*ENG,660,0,0,0,,You have nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.52,0:58:10.55,*ENG,661,0,0,0,,- I'm scared, professor. - I'd consider you a fool if you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.73,0:58:14.22,*ENG,662,0,0,0,,I need to know how to fight them. You could teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.40,0:58:16.39,*ENG,663,0,0,0,,You made the one on the train go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.60,0:58:18.40,*ENG,664,0,0,0,,There was only one that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.67,0:58:23.23,*ENG,665,0,0,0,,- But you made it go away. - I don't pretend to be an expert, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.58,0:58:28.54,*ENG,666,0,0,0,,But as the dementors seem to have developed an interest in you...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.71,0:58:32.38,*ENG,667,0,0,0,,...perhaps I should teach you. But after the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:34.45,*ENG,668,0,0,0,,For now, I need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.01,0:59:05.18,*ENG,669,0,0,0,,Last call for Hogsmeade! Come on, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.80,0:59:21.79,*ENG,670,0,0,0,,- Guys, let me go. - Clever, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.80,0:59:24.90,*ENG,671,0,0,0,,- But not clever enough. - We've got a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.07,0:59:27.90,*ENG,672,0,0,0,,- I'm trying to get to Hogsmeade. - We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.07,0:59:29.44,*ENG,673,0,0,0,,- Don't worry - We'll get you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.61,0:59:32.13,*ENG,674,0,0,0,,- We'll show you a quicker way. - lf you pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.31,0:59:36.30,*ENG,675,0,0,0,,- Bless him. - Let me go! Come on, guys. Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.51,0:59:39.11,*ENG,676,0,0,0,,Now, Harry. Come and join the big boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.52,0:59:42.65,*ENG,677,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.92,0:59:45.72,*ENG,678,0,0,0,,- What's this rubbish? - "What's this rubbish?" he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:49.22,*ENG,679,0,0,0,,- It's the secret to our success. - It's a wrench giving it to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.43,0:59:52.33,*ENG,680,0,0,0,,But we've decided your needs are greater than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.50,0:59:54.23,*ENG,681,0,0,0,,George, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.47,0:59:57.70,*ENG,682,0,0,0,,I solemnly swear that I am up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.37,1:00:04.93,*ENG,683,0,0,0,,"Messrs. Moony, Wormtail, Padfoot and Prongs...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.34,1:00:08.31,*ENG,684,0,0,0,,...are proud to present the Marauder's Map."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.55,1:00:10.81,*ENG,685,0,0,0,,We owe them so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.35,1:00:18.19,*ENG,686,0,0,0,,Hang on. This is Hogwarts. And that...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.36,1:00:21.09,*ENG,687,0,0,0,,- No. Is that really... - Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.26,1:00:22.25,*ENG,688,0,0,0,,- In his study. - Pacing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.43,1:00:24.45,*ENG,689,0,0,0,,Does that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.70,1:00:26.49,*ENG,690,0,0,0,,- So this map shows... - Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.70,1:00:28.69,*ENG,691,0,0,0,,- Where they are. - What they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.90,1:00:29.99,*ENG,692,0,0,0,,- Every minute. - Every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:33.17,*ENG,693,0,0,0,,- Brilliant! Where did you get it? - From Filch's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.37,1:00:37.17,*ENG,694,0,0,0,,- First year. - There are seven secret passageways...out of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.34,1:00:38.87,*ENG,695,0,0,0,,We'd recommend this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.08,1:00:42.24,*ENG,696,0,0,0,,- The One-Eyed Witch passageway. - Leads you to Honeyduke's.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.41,1:00:44.24,*ENG,697,0,0,0,,Hurry. Filch is heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.42,1:00:47.85,*ENG,698,0,0,0,,And don't forget. When you're done, just give it a tap and say:
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.02,1:00:52.35,*ENG,699,0,0,0,,"Mischief managed." Otherwise, anyone can read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.64,1:01:29.87,*ENG,700,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.20,1:01:32.14,*ENG,701,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.15,1:01:39.09,*ENG,702,0,0,0,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.11,1:01:51.17,*ENG,703,0,0,0,,It's meant to be the most haunted building in Britain. Did I mention that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.35,1:01:53.04,*ENG,704,0,0,0,,- Twice. - Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.75,1:01:56.08,*ENG,705,0,0,0,,Do you want to move a bit closer?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.29,1:01:57.98,*ENG,706,0,0,0,,To the Shrieking Shack?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.29,1:02:01.16,*ENG,707,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm fine here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.33,1:02:03.16,*ENG,708,0,0,0,,Well, well. Look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.59,1:02:05.82,*ENG,709,0,0,0,,You two shopping for your new dream home?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.90,1:02:10.33,*ENG,710,0,0,0,,Bit grand for you, isn't it, Weasle-Bee? Don't your family sleep in one room?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.60,1:02:13.80,*ENG,711,0,0,0,,- Shut your mouth, Malfoy. - Not very friendly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.11,1:02:19.17,*ENG,712,0,0,0,,Boys, I think it's time we teach Weasle-Bee how to respect his superiors.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.38,1:02:22.81,*ENG,713,0,0,0,,- Hope you don't mean yourself. - How dare you talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.98,1:02:24.97,*ENG,714,0,0,0,,You filthy little mudblood!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.19,1:02:30.71,*ENG,715,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.99,1:02:39.33,*ENG,716,0,0,0,,- Don't stand there! Do something! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.15,1:03:01.41,*ENG,717,0,0,0,,What's up, Malfoy? Lost your skis?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.39,1:03:06.82,*ENG,718,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.29,1:03:08.88,*ENG,719,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.06,1:03:12.05,*ENG,720,0,0,0,,Malfoy! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.87,1:03:17.80,*ENG,721,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.97,1:03:22.00,*ENG,722,0,0,0,,Bloody hell, Harry. That was not funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.17,1:03:26.41,*ENG,723,0,0,0,,Those weasels! Never told me about any Marauder's Map.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.64,1:03:30.05,*ENG,724,0,0,0,,He won't keep it. He'll turn it over to Professor McGonagall.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.28,1:03:34.24,*ENG,725,0,0,0,,- Aren't you? - Sure. Along with his Invisibility Cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.42,1:03:36.91,*ENG,726,0,0,0,,Look who it is. Madam Rosmerta.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.16,1:03:39.42,*ENG,727,0,0,0,,- Ron fancies her. - That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.59,1:03:41.46,*ENG,728,0,0,0,,- Professor McGonagall! - Cornelius!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.66,1:03:43.02,*ENG,729,0,0,0,,Allow me, minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.23,1:03:45.06,*ENG,730,0,0,0,,- Oh, Hagrid... - Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.30,1:03:48.20,*ENG,731,0,0,0,,Rosmerta, my dear. I hope business is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.40,1:03:52.30,*ENG,732,0,0,0,,It'd be a lot better if the Ministry wasn't sending dementors...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.47,1:03:56.85,*ENG,733,0,0,0,,- ...into my pub every other night! - We have...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.91,1:04:00.11,*ENG,734,0,0,0,,- We have a killer on the loose. - Sirius Black in Hogsmeade!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.44,1:04:02.91,*ENG,735,0,0,0,,And what would bring him here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.08,1:04:06.20,*ENG,736,0,0,0,,- Harry Potter. - Harry Potter?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.72,1:04:13.71,*ENG,737,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.47,1:04:25.90,*ENG,738,0,0,0,,- No underage wizards allowed in today! - Shut the damn door!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.14,1:04:28.11,*ENG,739,0,0,0,,- So rude. - Thick heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.37,1:04:29.90,*ENG,740,0,0,0,,- Thick heads?! - How dare they!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.14,1:04:33.30,*ENG,741,0,0,0,,- Who are they calling thick heads? - Young whippersnappers!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.08,1:04:37.98,*ENG,742,0,0,0,,Nobody will come to a pub where they'll get scared out of their wits.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.15,1:04:42.09,*ENG,743,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbledore doesn't want dementors around the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.86,1:04:46.65,*ENG,744,0,0,0,,Tell me what this is all about.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.82,1:04:51.28,*ENG,745,0,0,0,,Years ago, when Harry Potter's parents realized they were marked for death...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.50,1:04:54.12,*ENG,746,0,0,0,,Remember? They hid. Few knew where they were.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.37,1:04:58.20,*ENG,747,0,0,0,,One who did was Sirius Black. And he told You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.40,1:05:01.60,*ENG,748,0,0,0,,Not only did Black lead him to the Potters that night...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.81,1:05:05.14,*ENG,749,0,0,0,,...he also killed Peter Pettigrew!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.38,1:05:07.54,*ENG,750,0,0,0,,- Peter Pettigrew? - Little lump of a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.75,1:05:09.98,*ENG,751,0,0,0,,- Always trailing after Black. - I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.15,1:05:11.98,*ENG,752,0,0,0,,Never let James and Sirius out of his sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.15,1:05:14.88,*ENG,753,0,0,0,,- What happened? - Peter tried to warn the Potters...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.05,1:05:19.25,*ENG,754,0,0,0,,...and might have, had he not run into an old friend, Sirius Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.46,1:05:23.29,*ENG,755,0,0,0,,Black was vicious. He didn't kill Pettigrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.49,1:05:25.66,*ENG,756,0,0,0,,He destroyed him!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.30,1:05:31.03,*ENG,757,0,0,0,,A finger. That's all that was left. A finger. Nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.24,1:05:33.23,*ENG,758,0,0,0,,Sirius Black may not have put his hands to the Potters...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.23,1:05:37.64,*ENG,759,0,0,0,,- ...but he's the reason they're dead. - He wants to finish things.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.84,1:05:39.68,*ENG,760,0,0,0,,- I don't believe it. - That's not the worst of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.88,1:05:44.64,*ENG,761,0,0,0,,- What could be worse? - This: Sirius Black was...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.85,1:05:46.98,*ENG,762,0,0,0,,...and remains to this day...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.42,1:05:49.05,*ENG,763,0,0,0,,...Harry Potter's godfather!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.70,1:05:59.99,*ENG,764,0,0,0,,Ron, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.74,1:06:08.30,*ENG,765,0,0,0,,- Sorry. Excuse me, excuse me. - Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.74,1:06:48.58,*ENG,766,0,0,0,,Harry, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.08,1:06:53.21,*ENG,767,0,0,0,,He was their friend...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.72,1:06:55.95,*ENG,768,0,0,0,,...and he betrayed them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.75,1:06:58.72,*ENG,769,0,0,0,,He was their friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.96,1:07:02.93,*ENG,770,0,0,0,,I hope he finds me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.56,1:07:05.89,*ENG,771,0,0,0,,Because when he does, I'm gonna be ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.40,1:07:08.96,*ENG,772,0,0,0,,When he does, I'm gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.25,1:07:24.87,*ENG,773,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.38,1:07:27.01,*ENG,774,0,0,0,,There you are. You came.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.42,1:07:31.29,*ENG,775,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, Harry? This is very advanced magic...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.46,1:07:33.92,*ENG,776,0,0,0,,...well beyond the Ordinary Wizarding Level.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.09,1:07:35.62,*ENG,777,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.19,1:07:38.68,*ENG,778,0,0,0,,Well, everything's prepared.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.93,1:07:42.30,*ENG,779,0,0,0,,The spell I'm going to teach you is called the Patronus Charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.50,1:07:43.99,*ENG,780,0,0,0,,Did you ever hear of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.00,1:07:49.53,*ENG,781,0,0,0,,A Patronus is a positive force. For the wizard who conjures one...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.74,1:07:54.37,*ENG,782,0,0,0,,...it works like a shield, with the dementor feeding on it rather than him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.55,1:07:58.38,*ENG,783,0,0,0,,But in order for it to work, you need to think of a memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.55,1:08:02.51,*ENG,784,0,0,0,,Not just any memory, a very happy memory, a very powerful memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.72,1:08:06.52,*ENG,785,0,0,0,,Can you do this? Yes. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.73,1:08:09.96,*ENG,786,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.73,1:08:13.63,*ENG,787,0,0,0,,Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.90,1:08:16.96,*ENG,788,0,0,0,,Explore your past.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.50,1:08:19.37,*ENG,789,0,0,0,,Do you have a memory?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.97,1:08:23.17,*ENG,790,0,0,0,,Allow it to fill you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.84,1:08:25.93,*ENG,791,0,0,0,,Lose yourself within it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.24,1:08:31.58,*ENG,792,0,0,0,,Then speak the incantation, Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.02,1:08:34.85,*ENG,793,0,0,0,,- Expecto Patronum. - Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.66,1:08:41.99,*ENG,794,0,0,0,,Shall we? Wand at the ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.81,1:09:02.40,*ENG,795,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.18,1:09:06.55,*ENG,796,0,0,0,,Expecto... Expecto...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.78,1:09:08.51,*ENG,797,0,0,0,,Expect...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.52,1:09:14.58,*ENG,798,0,0,0,,Here we go. Come on. Sit up. Deep breaths.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.89,1:09:18.69,*ENG,799,0,0,0,,It's all right. I didn't expect you to do it the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.10,1:09:24.23,*ENG,800,0,0,0,,That would have been remarkable. Here, eat this. You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:27.97,*ENG,801,0,0,0,,- That's one nasty dementor. - Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.17,1:09:30.90,*ENG,802,0,0,0,,That was a boggart, Harry. A boggart.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.08,1:09:34.24,*ENG,803,0,0,0,,The real thing would be worse. Much, much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.41,1:09:37.04,*ENG,804,0,0,0,,As a matter of interest, what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.21,1:09:40.91,*ENG,805,0,0,0,,- Which memory did you choose? - The first time I rode a broom.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.12,1:09:45.45,*ENG,806,0,0,0,,That's not good enough. Not nearly good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.33,1:09:57.60,*ENG,807,0,0,0,,There's another. It's not happy, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.57,1:10:01.63,*ENG,808,0,0,0,,Well, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.84,1:10:04.36,*ENG,809,0,0,0,,It's the happiest I've ever felt...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.58,1:10:08.53,*ENG,810,0,0,0,,- ...but it's complicated. - Is it strong?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.92,1:10:15.75,*ENG,811,0,0,0,,Then let's give it a try. You feel ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.56,1:10:19.28,*ENG,812,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.37,1:10:32.60,*ENG,813,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:37.77,*ENG,814,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.40,1:11:00.49,*ENG,815,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.50,1:11:05.90,*ENG,816,0,0,0,,Well done, Harry. Well done!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.44,1:11:10.53,*ENG,817,0,0,0,,- I think I've had enough for today. - Yes. Sit down. Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.71,1:11:13.14,*ENG,818,0,0,0,,Eat this, it helps. It really helps.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.31,1:11:15.07,*ENG,819,0,0,0,,And just so you know, Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.25,1:11:19.24,*ENG,820,0,0,0,,...I think you'd have given your father a run for his money. And that...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.42,1:11:21.48,*ENG,821,0,0,0,,...is saying something.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.65,1:11:25.65,*ENG,822,0,0,0,,I was thinking of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.82,1:11:27.98,*ENG,823,0,0,0,,And Mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.16,1:11:30.39,*ENG,824,0,0,0,,Seeing their faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.03,1:11:33.72,*ENG,825,0,0,0,,They were talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.90,1:11:36.20,*ENG,826,0,0,0,,Just talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.37,1:11:38.70,*ENG,827,0,0,0,,That's the memory I chose.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.30,1:11:42.77,*ENG,828,0,0,0,,I don't even know if it's real.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.24,1:11:45.40,*ENG,829,0,0,0,,But it's the best I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.65,1:11:56.95,*ENG,830,0,0,0,,- Beautiful day. - Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.15,1:11:59.12,*ENG,831,0,0,0,,Unless you've been ripped to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.29,1:12:01.72,*ENG,832,0,0,0,,835 Ripped to pieces? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.89,1:12:05.06,*ENG,833,0,0,0,,- Ronald has lost his rat. - I haven't lost anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.23,1:12:07.36,*ENG,834,0,0,0,,- Your cat killed him! - Rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.56,1:12:10.90,*ENG,835,0,0,0,,Harry, you've seen the way that bloodthirsty beast of hers...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.07,1:12:14.97,*ENG,836,0,0,0,,...is always lurking about. And Scabbers is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.14,1:12:17.97,*ENG,837,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you should take better care of your pets!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.18,1:12:19.23,*ENG,838,0,0,0,,- Your cat killed him! - Did not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.41,1:12:21.88,*ENG,839,0,0,0,,- Did. - Didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.95,1:12:26.58,*ENG,840,0,0,0,,How did it go, Hagrid? The hearing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.75,1:12:30.05,*ENG,841,0,0,0,,Well, first off, the committee members took turns...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.22,1:12:32.88,*ENG,842,0,0,0,,...talking about why we were there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.76,1:12:37.42,*ENG,843,0,0,0,,I got up and did my piece. Said how Buckbeak...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.59,1:12:40.59,*ENG,844,0,0,0,,...was a good hippogriff, always cleaned his feathers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.80,1:12:43.79,*ENG,845,0,0,0,,And then Lucius Malfoy got up. Well, you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.00,1:12:47.20,*ENG,846,0,0,0,,He said Buckbeak was a deadly and dangerous creature...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.37,1:12:50.36,*ENG,847,0,0,0,,...who would kill you as soon as look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.61,1:12:52.40,*ENG,848,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.11,1:12:55.81,*ENG,849,0,0,0,,And then he asked for the worst, did old Lucius.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.98,1:13:00.11,*ENG,850,0,0,0,,- They're not sacking you! - No, I'm not sacked.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.22,1:13:05.21,*ENG,851,0,0,0,,Buckbeak's been sentenced to death!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.08,1:13:37.61,*ENG,852,0,0,0,,Spiders! There's... There's spiders. Spiders. They want me to tap-dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.82,1:13:40.35,*ENG,853,0,0,0,,- I don't wanna tap-dance! - You tell those spiders.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.56,1:13:44.52,*ENG,854,0,0,0,,Right, yeah. Tell them. I'll tell them...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.60,1:13:52.00,*ENG,855,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.44,1:13:56.77,*ENG,856,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.68,1:14:04.84,*ENG,857,0,0,0,,- Peter Pettigrew? - Little lump of a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.02,1:14:08.14,*ENG,858,0,0,0,,- Always trailing after Sirius Black. - Black was vicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.35,1:14:10.82,*ENG,859,0,0,0,,He didn't kill Pettigrew, he destroyed him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.90,1:14:22.35,*ENG,860,0,0,0,,- Put that light out! - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.58,1:14:35.17,*ENG,861,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.93,1:14:50.69,*ENG,862,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.27,1:15:04.76,*ENG,863,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.61,1:15:09.74,*ENG,864,0,0,0,,- Watch it there, boy. - We're trying to sleep here!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.78,1:15:16.15,*ENG,865,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.96,1:15:20.55,*ENG,866,0,0,0,,Mischief managed. Nox.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.76,1:15:24.09,*ENG,867,0,0,0,,Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.26,1:15:27.75,*ENG,868,0,0,0,,What are you doing wandering the corridors at night?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.97,1:15:28.99,*ENG,869,0,0,0,,I was sleepwalking.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.20,1:15:31.76,*ENG,870,0,0,0,,How extraordinarily like your father you are, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.00,1:15:36.74,*ENG,871,0,0,0,,He, too, was exceedingly arrogant, strutting about the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.94,1:15:41.27,*ENG,872,0,0,0,,My dad didn't strut. And nor do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.01,1:15:44.91,*ENG,873,0,0,0,,Now, if you don't mind, I would appreciate it if you could lower your wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.65,1:15:50.48,*ENG,874,0,0,0,,Turn out your pockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.16,1:15:54.78,*ENG,875,0,0,0,,Turn out your pockets!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.69,1:15:59.32,*ENG,876,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.50,1:16:02.76,*ENG,877,0,0,0,,- Spare bit of parchment. - Really? Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.37,1:16:12.90,*ENG,878,0,0,0,,Reveal your secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.81,1:16:18.28,*ENG,879,0,0,0,,Read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.72,1:16:26.21,*ENG,880,0,0,0,,"Messrs. Moony, Wormtail, Padfoot, and Prongs...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.42,1:16:30.52,*ENG,881,0,0,0,,...offer their compliments to Professor Snape and..."
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.83,1:16:32.32,*ENG,882,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.50,1:16:36.60,*ENG,883,0,0,0,,"And request he keep his large nose out of other people's business."
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.60,1:16:40.13,*ENG,884,0,0,0,,- You insolent little... - Professor!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.77,1:16:44.47,*ENG,885,0,0,0,,Well, well. Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.64,1:16:49.34,*ENG,886,0,0,0,,Out for a little walk in the moonlight, are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.71,1:16:53.15,*ENG,887,0,0,0,,Harry, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.35,1:16:55.82,*ENG,888,0,0,0,,That remains to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.65,1:17:00.38,*ENG,889,0,0,0,,I have now just confiscated a rather curious artifact.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.56,1:17:04.08,*ENG,890,0,0,0,,Take a look, Lupin. Supposed to be your area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.26,1:17:09.06,*ENG,891,0,0,0,,- Clearly, it's full of dark magic. - I seriously doubt it, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.23,1:17:12.72,*ENG,892,0,0,0,,It looks as though it's a parchment designed to insult anyone...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.80,1:17:16.77,*ENG,893,0,0,0,,...who tries to read it. I suspect it's a Zonko product.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.97,1:17:21.21,*ENG,894,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, I shall investigate any hidden qualities it may possess.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.38,1:17:24.51,*ENG,895,0,0,0,,It is, after all, as you say, my area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.68,1:17:28.01,*ENG,896,0,0,0,,Harry, would you come with me, please? Professor, good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.02,1:17:36.75,*ENG,897,0,0,0,,Are you deaf? Put that light out!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.87,1:17:43.30,*ENG,898,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.10,1:17:50.27,*ENG,899,0,0,0,,I haven't the faintest idea how this map came to be in your possession...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.51,1:17:54.97,*ENG,900,0,0,0,,...but quite frankly, I am astounded that you didn't hand it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.15,1:17:57.81,*ENG,901,0,0,0,,Did it never occur to you that this, in the hands of Sirius Black...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.81,1:18:01.01,*ENG,902,0,0,0,,...is a map to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.82,1:18:04.29,*ENG,903,0,0,0,,- No. - No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.29,1:18:09.32,*ENG,904,0,0,0,,Your father never set much store by the rules either.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.53,1:18:13.83,*ENG,905,0,0,0,,But he and your mother gave their lives to save yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.74,1:18:23.17,*ENG,907,0,0,0,,...with a killer on the loose seems to me a poor way to repay them!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.41,1:18:25.57,*ENG,908,0,0,0,,Now, I will not cover up for you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.74,1:18:28.18,*ENG,909,0,0,0,,- Do you hear me? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.35,1:18:32.01,*ENG,910,0,0,0,,I want you to return to your dormitory and stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.18,1:18:36.95,*ENG,911,0,0,0,,And don't take any detours. If you do, I shall know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.63,1:18:46.06,*ENG,912,0,0,0,,Professor, just so you know, I don't think that map always works.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.93,1:18:51.89,*ENG,913,0,0,0,,Earlier, it showed someone in the castle. Someone I know to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.30,1:18:55.03,*ENG,914,0,0,0,,Oh, really? And who might that be?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.21,1:18:56.73,*ENG,915,0,0,0,,Peter Pettigrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.38,1:19:01.47,*ENG,916,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.68,1:19:04.34,*ENG,917,0,0,0,,It's just what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.18,1:19:08.88,*ENG,918,0,0,0,,Good night, professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.39,1:19:16.55,*ENG,919,0,0,0,,Broaden your minds. You must look beyond.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.73,1:19:22.17,*ENG,920,0,0,0,,The art of crystal gazing is in the clearing of the Inner Eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.33,1:19:25.67,*ENG,921,0,0,0,,Only then can you see. Try again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.20,1:19:28.30,*ENG,922,0,0,0,,Now, what do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.64,1:19:32.80,*ENG,923,0,0,0,,Do you mind me trying?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.25,1:19:38.21,*ENG,924,0,0,0,,The Grim, possibly.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.00,1:19:44.30,*ENG,925,0,0,0,,My dear, from the first moment you stepped foot in my class...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.30,1:19:48.42,*ENG,926,0,0,0,,...I sensed that you did not possess the proper spirit...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.63,1:19:52.53,*ENG,927,0,0,0,,...for the noble art of Divination. No, you see, there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.70,1:19:57.30,*ENG,928,0,0,0,,You may be young in years, but your heart is as shriveled...as an old maid's,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.43,1:20:00.53,*ENG,929,0,0,0,,your soul as dry as the pages of the books...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.70,1:20:03.80,*ENG,930,0,0,0,,...to which you so desperately cleave.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.36,1:20:21.35,*ENG,931,0,0,0,,Have I said something?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.03,1:20:31.02,*ENG,932,0,0,0,,She's gone mental, Hermione has. Not that she wasn't always mental...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.20,1:20:33.76,*ENG,933,0,0,0,,...but now it's in the open for everyone to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.97,1:20:36.10,*ENG,934,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.34,1:20:39.21,*ENG,935,0,0,0,,- We better take this back. - I'm not going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.54,1:20:42.94,*ENG,936,0,0,0,,- Fine. See you later. - See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.72,1:21:25.98,*ENG,937,0,0,0,,Harry Potter...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.86,1:21:37.13,*ENG,938,0,0,0,,- Professor Trelawney... - He will return tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.30,1:21:38.93,*ENG,939,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.14,1:21:43.73,*ENG,940,0,0,0,,Tonight, he who betrayed his friends, whose heart rots with murder...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.94,1:21:45.93,*ENG,941,0,0,0,,...shall break free.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.14,1:21:48.37,*ENG,942,0,0,0,,Innocent blood shall be spilt...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.55,1:21:54.54,*ENG,943,0,0,0,,...and servant and master shall be reunited once more.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.89,1:22:04.16,*ENG,944,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, dear boy. Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.96,1:22:06.76,*ENG,945,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.20,1:22:08.76,*ENG,946,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.35,1:23:05.38,*ENG,947,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're going to kill Buckbeak. It's just too horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.56,1:23:08.30,*ENG,948,0,0,0,,- It just got worse. - What did I say? Father said...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.46,1:23:12.62,*ENG,949,0,0,0,,...I can keep the hippogriff's head. I'll donate it to the Gryffindors' room.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.83,1:23:15.26,*ENG,950,0,0,0,,This is going to be rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.47,1:23:17.63,*ENG,951,0,0,0,,- Look who's here. - Come to see the show?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.83,1:23:20.93,*ENG,952,0,0,0,,You! You foul, loathsome, evil little cockroach!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.10,1:23:22.90,*ENG,953,0,0,0,,Hermione, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.44,1:23:25.67,*ENG,954,0,0,0,,He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.79,1:23:41.85,*ENG,955,0,0,0,,Malfoy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.06,1:23:46.26,*ENG,956,0,0,0,,- Let's go. Quick. - Not a word to anyone, understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.43,1:23:50.89,*ENG,957,0,0,0,,- That felt good. - Not good, brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.29,1:24:14.59,*ENG,958,0,0,0,,Look at him. Loves the smell of the trees when the wind blows through them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.76,1:24:17.02,*ENG,959,0,0,0,,Why don't we just set him free?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.19,1:24:20.63,*ENG,960,0,0,0,,They'd know it was me, and then Dumbledore...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.80,1:24:23.79,*ENG,961,0,0,0,,...would get into trouble. He's coming down, Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.00,1:24:25.33,*ENG,962,0,0,0,,Says he wants to be with me when they...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.37,1:24:28.36,*ENG,963,0,0,0,,When it happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.57,1:24:29.87,*ENG,964,0,0,0,,Great man, Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.91,1:24:32.40,*ENG,965,0,0,0,,A great man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.91,1:24:37.88,*ENG,966,0,0,0,,- We'll stay with you too. - You'll do no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.05,1:24:41.21,*ENG,967,0,0,0,,Think I want you seeing something like that? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.42,1:24:45.05,*ENG,968,0,0,0,,You just drink your tea and be off. Oh. Before you do, Ron...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.50,1:24:54.86,*ENG,969,0,0,0,,Scabbers! You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.03,1:24:58.73,*ENG,970,0,0,0,,- Keep a closer eye on your pet. - I think you owe someone an apology.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.94,1:25:02.70,*ENG,971,0,0,0,,Right. Next time I see Crookshanks, I'll let him know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.87,1:25:03.90,*ENG,972,0,0,0,,I meant me!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.64,1:25:06.84,*ENG,973,0,0,0,,Blimey. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.32,1:25:14.72,*ENG,974,0,0,0,,Hagrid!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.65,1:25:17.98,*ENG,975,0,0,0,,Oh, crikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.46,1:25:22.19,*ENG,976,0,0,0,,No, minister. Over this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.39,1:25:26.49,*ENG,977,0,0,0,,It's late. It's nearly dark. You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.66,1:25:30.43,*ENG,978,0,0,0,,Someone sees you outside this time of night, you'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.60,1:25:34.20,*ENG,979,0,0,0,,Particularly you, Harry. With you in a moment!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.61,1:25:38.04,*ENG,980,0,0,0,,Quick. Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.21,1:25:39.94,*ENG,981,0,0,0,,Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.11,1:25:44.05,*ENG,982,0,0,0,,- It'll be fine. It'll be okay. - Go on, go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.88,1:25:48.68,*ENG,983,0,0,0,,- That's ling you see over there... - On the slope.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.85,1:25:51.51,*ENG,984,0,0,0,,- On the slope... Ah, Hagrid. - Professor Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.69,1:25:54.38,*ENG,985,0,0,0,,- Good evening. - Minister. Make your way through.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.59,1:25:58.43,*ENG,986,0,0,0,,- Have a tea, if you like. - No, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.53,1:26:03.09,*ENG,987,0,0,0,,- Gentlemen. - I'd like a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.30,1:26:06.63,*ENG,988,0,0,0,,Well, I think we should get down to our business, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.80,1:26:11.37,*ENG,989,0,0,0,,Very well. It is the decision of the Committee for the Disposal...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.57,1:26:14.74,*ENG,990,0,0,0,,...of Dangerous Creatures that the hippogriff Buckbeak...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.91,1:26:20.41,*ENG,991,0,0,0,,...hereinafter called "the condemned", shall be executed this day at sundown.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.58,1:26:24.11,*ENG,992,0,0,0,,- Dear, dear... - Now, now, Hagrid. Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.32,1:26:28.72,*ENG,993,0,0,0,,- All right. It'll be all right. - The execution shall dispatch...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.89,1:26:30.62,*ENG,994,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.79,1:26:32.89,*ENG,995,0,0,0,,I thought I just saw...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.06,1:26:35.16,*ENG,996,0,0,0,,- Never mind. - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.30,1:26:42.60,*ENG,997,0,0,0,,Buckbeak didn't mean no harm.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.12,1:27:30.59,*ENG,998,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.50,1:27:43.69,*ENG,999,0,0,0,,He bit me. Scabbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.30,1:27:46.23,*ENG,1000,0,0,0,,Ron. Ron!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.20,1:27:50.70,*ENG,1001,0,0,0,,- Ron! - Scabbers, come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.24,1:27:53.97,*ENG,1002,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.92,1:28:04.22,*ENG,1003,0,0,0,,- Scabbers, you bit me! - Harry, you do realize what tree this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.39,1:28:06.69,*ENG,1004,0,0,0,,That's not good. Ron, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.83,1:28:12.35,*ENG,1005,0,0,0,,Harry, Hermione, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.93,1:28:14.56,*ENG,1006,0,0,0,,It's the Grim!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.60,1:28:24.60,*ENG,1007,0,0,0,,- Harry! - Ron! Ron, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.84,1:28:26.81,*ENG,1008,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.41,1:28:30.78,*ENG,1009,0,0,0,,- Help! - Ron!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.92,1:28:36.18,*ENG,1010,0,0,0,,- Ron. Ron. - Ron!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.03,1:28:53.03,*ENG,1011,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.97,1:28:56.40,*ENG,1012,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.41,1:29:02.17,*ENG,1013,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.01,1:29:40.31,*ENG,1014,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.23,1:29:59.20,*ENG,1015,0,0,0,,- Oh, I'm sorry. - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.40,1:30:03.27,*ENG,1016,0,0,0,,- Where do you suppose this goes? - I have a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.84,1:30:05.31,*ENG,1017,0,0,0,,I just hope I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.03,1:30:28.19,*ENG,1018,0,0,0,,We're in the Shrieking Shack, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.30,1:30:30.89,*ENG,1019,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.28,1:30:42.68,*ENG,1020,0,0,0,,Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.21,1:30:45.84,*ENG,1021,0,0,0,,- Ron. You're okay. - The dog. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.05,1:30:49.28,*ENG,1022,0,0,0,,It's a trap. He's the dog. He's an Animagus.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.20,1:31:05.93,*ENG,1023,0,0,0,,If you want to kill Harry, you have to kill us too!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.10,1:31:07.90,*ENG,1024,0,0,0,,No. Only one will die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.10,1:31:10.04,*ENG,1025,0,0,0,,Then it'll be you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.25,1:31:18.41,*ENG,1026,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill me, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.62,1:31:21.45,*ENG,1027,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.19,1:31:29.35,*ENG,1028,0,0,0,,Well, well, Sirius. Looking rather ragged, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.56,1:31:32.59,*ENG,1029,0,0,0,,Finally, the flesh reflects the madness within.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.20,1:31:36.83,*ENG,1030,0,0,0,,Well, you'd know all about the madness within, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.24,1:31:48.21,*ENG,1031,0,0,0,,- I found him. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.21,1:31:49.74,*ENG,1032,0,0,0,,- He's here. - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.91,1:31:53.11,*ENG,1033,0,0,0,,- Let's kill him! - No! I trusted you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.55,1:31:57.28,*ENG,1034,0,0,0,,And all this time, you've been his friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.99,1:32:01.05,*ENG,1035,0,0,0,,He's a werewolf! That's why he's been missing classes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.86,1:32:05.56,*ENG,1036,0,0,0,,How long have you known?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.06,1:32:09.26,*ENG,1037,0,0,0,,- Since Professor Snape set the essay. - Well, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.47,1:32:12.40,*ENG,1038,0,0,0,,You are the brightest witch of your age I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.60,1:32:15.00,*ENG,1039,0,0,0,,Enough talk, Remus! Come on, let's kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.20,1:32:17.76,*ENG,1040,0,0,0,,- Wait! - I did my waiting!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.97,1:32:20.41,*ENG,1041,0,0,0,,Twelve years of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.01,1:32:23.41,*ENG,1042,0,0,0,,In Azkaban!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.89,1:32:34.62,*ENG,1043,0,0,0,,Very well. Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.19,1:32:38.96,*ENG,1044,0,0,0,,But wait one more minute. Harry has the right to know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.13,1:32:40.69,*ENG,1045,0,0,0,,I know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.93,1:32:43.16,*ENG,1046,0,0,0,,You betrayed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.33,1:32:46.30,*ENG,1047,0,0,0,,- You're the reason they're dead! - No, it wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.44,1:32:48.34,*ENG,1048,0,0,0,,Somebody did betray your parents...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.50,1:32:51.96,*ENG,1049,0,0,0,,...somebody who, until quite recently, I believed to be dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.21,1:32:55.67,*ENG,1050,0,0,0,,- Who was it, then? - Peter Pettigrew!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.85,1:32:58.97,*ENG,1051,0,0,0,,And he's in this room! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.48,1:33:02.45,*ENG,1052,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.62,1:33:05.61,*ENG,1053,0,0,0,,- Come out, come out and play! - Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.56,1:33:11.00,*ENG,1054,0,0,0,,Vengeance is sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.00,1:33:13.49,*ENG,1055,0,0,0,,How I hoped I'd be the one to catch you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.66,1:33:14.10,*ENG,1056,0,0,0,,Severus...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.20,1:33:19.90,*ENG,1057,0,0,0,,I told Dumbledore you were helping a friend into the castle. Here's the proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.10,1:33:21.40,*ENG,1058,0,0,0,,Brilliant, Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.60,1:33:25.97,*ENG,1059,0,0,0,,You put your keen mind to the task and come to the wrong conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.18,1:33:29.40,*ENG,1060,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse us, Remus and I have business...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.01,1:33:34.97,*ENG,1061,0,0,0,,- ...to attend to. - Give me a reason. I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.18,1:33:36.74,*ENG,1062,0,0,0,,- Don't be a fool. - He can't help it. It's habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.99,1:33:38.54,*ENG,1063,0,0,0,,- Be quiet. - Be quiet yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.72,1:33:41.16,*ENG,1064,0,0,0,,You two, quarrelling like an old married couple.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.32,1:33:43.85,*ENG,1065,0,0,0,,Run along and play with your chemistry set!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.39,1:33:46.88,*ENG,1066,0,0,0,,I could do it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.36,1:33:53.00,*ENG,1067,0,0,0,,But why deny the dementors? They're so longing to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.20,1:33:55.86,*ENG,1068,0,0,0,,Do I detect a flicker of fear? Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.07,1:33:59.51,*ENG,1069,0,0,0,,A Dementor's Kiss. One can only imagine what that must be like.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.71,1:34:05.11,*ENG,1070,0,0,0,,It's said to be nearly unbearable to witness, but I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.35,1:34:07.58,*ENG,1071,0,0,0,,Severus, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.62,1:34:10.61,*ENG,1072,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.06,1:34:16.79,*ENG,1073,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.56,1:34:22.12,*ENG,1074,0,0,0,,- Harry! What did you just do? - You attacked a teacher!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.37,1:34:24.93,*ENG,1075,0,0,0,,- Tell me about Peter. - He was at school with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.10,1:34:26.76,*ENG,1076,0,0,0,,We thought he was our friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.97,1:34:29.90,*ENG,1077,0,0,0,,- No. Pettigrew's dead. You killed him! - No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.11,1:34:33.27,*ENG,1078,0,0,0,,I thought so too, until you mentioned Pettigrew on the map!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.54,1:34:36.31,*ENG,1079,0,0,0,,- The map was lying, then. - The map never lies!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.51,1:34:40.47,*ENG,1080,0,0,0,,Pettigrew's alive! And he's right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.95,1:34:45.55,*ENG,1081,0,0,0,,- Me?! He's mental! - Not you! Your rat!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.82,1:34:48.95,*ENG,1082,0,0,0,,- Scabbers has been in my family for... - Twelve years?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.13,1:34:51.62,*ENG,1083,0,0,0,,Curiously long life for a common garden rat!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.79,1:34:54.39,*ENG,1084,0,0,0,,- He's missing a toe, isn't he? - So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.56,1:34:57.53,*ENG,1085,0,0,0,,- All they could find of Pettigrew was his... - Finger!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.73,1:35:00.96,*ENG,1086,0,0,0,,Dirty coward cut it off so everyone would think he was dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.17,1:35:04.14,*ENG,1087,0,0,0,,- And then he transformed into a rat! - Show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.78,1:35:09.84,*ENG,1088,0,0,0,,- Give it to him, Ron. - What are you trying to do to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.05,1:35:11.07,*ENG,1089,0,0,0,,Scabbers!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.28,1:35:14.34,*ENG,1090,0,0,0,,Leave him alone! Get off him! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.84,1:35:38.67,*ENG,1091,0,0,0,,Remus?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.44,1:35:40.91,*ENG,1092,0,0,0,,Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.11,1:35:43.01,*ENG,1093,0,0,0,,My old friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.65,1:35:52.49,*ENG,1094,0,0,0,,Harry! Look at you. You look so much like your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.66,1:35:56.99,*ENG,1095,0,0,0,,- James. We were the best of friends... - How dare you speak to Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.16,1:35:59.79,*ENG,1096,0,0,0,,How dare you talk about James in front of him!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.00,1:36:05.19,*ENG,1097,0,0,0,,- You sold James and Lily to Voldemort! - I didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.40,1:36:08.20,*ENG,1098,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord. You have no idea the weapons he possesses!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.40,1:36:11.00,*ENG,1099,0,0,0,,Ask yourself, Sirius! What would you have done?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.41,1:36:16.97,*ENG,1100,0,0,0,,- What would you have done? - Died, rather than betray my friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.18,1:36:21.55,*ENG,1101,0,0,0,,James wouldn't have wanted me killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.75,1:36:24.42,*ENG,1102,0,0,0,,Your dad would have spared me! He would have shown me mercy!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.92,1:36:32.12,*ENG,1103,0,0,0,,Should have realized if Voldemort didn't kill you, we would. Together!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.33,1:36:34.35,*ENG,1104,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.87,1:36:39.82,*ENG,1105,0,0,0,,- Harry, this man... - I know what he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.00,1:36:41.90,*ENG,1106,0,0,0,,But we'll take him to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.10,1:36:47.10,*ENG,1107,0,0,0,,- Bless you, boy. Bless you! - Get off!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.28,1:36:50.68,*ENG,1108,0,0,0,,I said we'd take you to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.05,1:36:53.24,*ENG,1109,0,0,0,,After that, the dementors can have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.19,1:37:00.92,*ENG,1110,0,0,0,,Sorry about the bite. I reckon that twinges a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.09,1:37:04.62,*ENG,1111,0,0,0,,A bit? A bit? You almost tore my leg off!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.79,1:37:06.35,*ENG,1112,0,0,0,,I was going for the rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.53,1:37:10.36,*ENG,1113,0,0,0,,Normally, I have a very sweet disposition as a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.53,1:37:15.80,*ENG,1114,0,0,0,,More than once, James suggested that I make the change permanent.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.97,1:37:20.81,*ENG,1115,0,0,0,,The tail I could live with. But the fleas, they're murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.39,1:37:34.88,*ENG,1116,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.90,1:37:42.42,*ENG,1117,0,0,0,,- You better go. - No. Don't worry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.60,1:37:44.00,*ENG,1118,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.80,1:37:46.77,*ENG,1119,0,0,0,,You go, I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.10,1:37:50.16,*ENG,1120,0,0,0,,- You okay? - I'm fine. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.77,1:37:54.77,*ENG,1121,0,0,0,,- That looks really painful. - So painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.94,1:37:57.47,*ENG,1122,0,0,0,,They might chop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.98,1:38:00.64,*ENG,1123,0,0,0,,I'm sure Madam Pomfrey will fix it in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.82,1:38:05.01,*ENG,1124,0,0,0,,It's too late. It's ruined. It'll have to be chopped off.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.29,1:38:08.12,*ENG,1125,0,0,0,,It's beautiful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.96,1:38:12.72,*ENG,1126,0,0,0,,I'll never forget the first time I walked through those doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.43,1:38:16.59,*ENG,1127,0,0,0,,It'll be nice to do it again as a free man.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.73,1:38:21.53,*ENG,1128,0,0,0,,That was a noble thing you did back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.37,1:38:24.46,*ENG,1129,0,0,0,,He doesn't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.67,1:38:27.84,*ENG,1130,0,0,0,,I didn't think my dad would have wanted his best friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.01,1:38:29.50,*ENG,1131,0,0,0,,...to become killers.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.75,1:38:33.44,*ENG,1132,0,0,0,,Besides, dead, the truth dies with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.62,1:38:35.98,*ENG,1133,0,0,0,,Alive, you're free.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.15,1:38:39.25,*ENG,1134,0,0,0,,Turn me into a flobberworm. Anything but the dementors!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.46,1:38:42.79,*ENG,1135,0,0,0,,Ron! Haven't I been a good pet? You won't let them give me...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.96,1:38:45.45,*ENG,1136,0,0,0,,...to the dementors, will you? I was your rat!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.63,1:38:49.66,*ENG,1137,0,0,0,,- Sweet, clever girl! Surely you won't... - Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.13,1:38:54.03,*ENG,1138,0,0,0,,I don't know if you know, Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.20,1:38:58.26,*ENG,1139,0,0,0,,...but when you were born, James and Lily made me your godfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.47,1:39:00.41,*ENG,1140,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.58,1:39:05.64,*ENG,1141,0,0,0,,I can understand if you choose to stay with your aunt and uncle...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.81,1:39:08.28,*ENG,1142,0,0,0,,...but if you ever wanted a different home...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.48,1:39:10.98,*ENG,1143,0,0,0,,What? Come and live with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.29,1:39:15.38,*ENG,1144,0,0,0,,It's just a thought. I can understand if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.56,1:39:17.35,*ENG,1145,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.61,1:39:36.27,*ENG,1146,0,0,0,,Remus, my old friend. Have you taken your potion tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.61,1:39:42.95,*ENG,1147,0,0,0,,You know the man you truly are, Remus! This heart is where you truly live! Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.32,1:39:46.31,*ENG,1148,0,0,0,,This flesh is only flesh!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.46,1:39:49.55,*ENG,1149,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.64,1:40:01.19,*ENG,1150,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.30,1:40:05.24,*ENG,1151,0,0,0,,Remus! Remus!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.45,1:40:13.78,*ENG,1152,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.79,1:40:25.82,*ENG,1153,0,0,0,,- Come on. - Wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.00,1:40:31.09,*ENG,1154,0,0,0,,- Hermione! - Bad idea. Bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.30,1:40:33.50,*ENG,1155,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.61,1:40:39.10,*ENG,1156,0,0,0,,Professor Lupin?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.92,1:40:50.15,*ENG,1157,0,0,0,,Nice doggy. Nice doggy!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.59,1:40:53.11,*ENG,1158,0,0,0,,There you are, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.92,1:41:27.95,*ENG,1159,0,0,0,,Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.79,1:41:31.19,*ENG,1160,0,0,0,,Come back here, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.03,1:42:38.42,*ENG,1161,0,0,0,,Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.23,1:42:42.20,*ENG,1162,0,0,0,,No. Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.07,1:43:26.94,*ENG,1163,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.74,1:45:42.11,*ENG,1164,0,0,0,,Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.05,1:45:45.41,*ENG,1165,0,0,0,,I saw my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.61,1:45:47.17,*ENG,1166,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.38,1:45:48.91,*ENG,1167,0,0,0,,He sent the dementors away.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.08,1:45:50.48,*ENG,1168,0,0,0,,I saw him across the lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.69,1:45:52.31,*ENG,1169,0,0,0,,Harry, they've captured Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.55,1:45:55.39,*ENG,1170,0,0,0,,Any minute the dementors are gonna perform the Kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.56,1:45:58.05,*ENG,1171,0,0,0,,- They're gonna kill him? - No. It's worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.26,1:46:00.09,*ENG,1172,0,0,0,,Much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.26,1:46:02.63,*ENG,1173,0,0,0,,They're going to suck out his soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.33,1:46:05.73,*ENG,1174,0,0,0,,Headmaster, stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.90,1:46:09.30,*ENG,1175,0,0,0,,- They've got the wrong man. - It's true. Sirius is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.47,1:46:11.60,*ENG,1176,0,0,0,,- It's Scabbers who did it. - Scabbers?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.81,1:46:13.21,*ENG,1177,0,0,0,,He's my rat, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.61,1:46:17.41,*ENG,1178,0,0,0,,He's not really a rat. He was a rat. He was my brother Percy's rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.61,1:46:21.28,*ENG,1179,0,0,0,,- But then they gave him an owl... - The point is, we know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.48,1:46:23.97,*ENG,1180,0,0,0,,- Please believe us. - I do, Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.22,1:46:29.62,*ENG,1181,0,0,0,,But the word of three 13-year-old wizards will convince few others.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.73,1:46:35.49,*ENG,1182,0,0,0,,A child's voice, however honest and true...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.66,1:46:39.43,*ENG,1183,0,0,0,,...is meaningless to those who have forgotten how to listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.64,1:46:47.13,*ENG,1184,0,0,0,,Mysterious thing, time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.34,1:46:49.67,*ENG,1185,0,0,0,,Powerful...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.85,1:46:52.75,*ENG,1186,0,0,0,,...and when meddled with, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.32,1:46:57.95,*ENG,1187,0,0,0,,Sirius Black is in the topmost cell of the Dark Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.75,1:47:00.85,*ENG,1188,0,0,0,,You know the laws, Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.02,1:47:02.82,*ENG,1189,0,0,0,,You must not be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.99,1:47:06.65,*ENG,1190,0,0,0,,And you would do well, I feel, to return before this last chime.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.83,1:47:10.36,*ENG,1191,0,0,0,,If not, the consequences are too ghastly to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.90,1:47:12.70,*ENG,1192,0,0,0,,If you succeed tonight...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.90,1:47:15.70,*ENG,1193,0,0,0,,...more than one innocent life may be spared.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.54,1:47:19.77,*ENG,1194,0,0,0,,Three turns should do it, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.65,1:47:26.48,*ENG,1195,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.65,1:47:32.48,*ENG,1196,0,0,0,,When in doubt, I find retracing my steps to be a wise place to begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.65,1:47:34.71,*ENG,1197,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.22,1:47:37.69,*ENG,1198,0,0,0,,What the bloody hell was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.36,1:47:40.69,*ENG,1199,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ron, but seeing as you can't walk...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.69,1:48:11.28,*ENG,1200,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.46,1:48:13.76,*ENG,1201,0,0,0,,- Where's Ron? - 7:30.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.93,1:48:15.79,*ENG,1202,0,0,0,,Where were we at 7:30?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.96,1:48:17.76,*ENG,1203,0,0,0,,I don't know. Going to Hagrid's?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.93,1:48:20.33,*ENG,1204,0,0,0,,Come on. And we can't be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.40,1:48:23.20,*ENG,1205,0,0,0,,Hermione!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.42,1:48:44.09,*ENG,1206,0,0,0,,Hermione! Hermione, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.89,1:48:49.46,*ENG,1207,0,0,0,,Hermione, will you please tell me what it is we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.66,1:48:52.50,*ENG,1208,0,0,0,,You foul, loathsome, evil little cockroach!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.70,1:48:54.00,*ENG,1209,0,0,0,,That's us.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.27,1:48:57.14,*ENG,1210,0,0,0,,Hermione, no! He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.37,1:48:58.77,*ENG,1211,0,0,0,,This is not normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.11,1:49:03.48,*ENG,1212,0,0,0,,This is a Time-Turner, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.65,1:49:05.84,*ENG,1213,0,0,0,,McGonagall gave it to me first term.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.01,1:49:09.38,*ENG,1214,0,0,0,,This is how I've been getting to my lessons all year.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.58,1:49:12.78,*ENG,1215,0,0,0,,- You mean we've gone back in time? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.95,1:49:16.32,*ENG,1216,0,0,0,,Dumbledore obviously wanted us to return to this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.63,1:49:21.79,*ENG,1217,0,0,0,,Clearly, something happened he wants us to change.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.93,1:49:26.26,*ENG,1218,0,0,0,,Good punch.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.43,1:49:27.92,*ENG,1219,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.97,1:49:30.56,*ENG,1220,0,0,0,,Malfoy's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.51,1:49:33.84,*ENG,1221,0,0,0,,- Run. - Not a word to anyone, understood?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.31,1:49:37.37,*ENG,1222,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get that jumped-up mudblood! Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.55,1:49:41.30,*ENG,1223,0,0,0,,- That felt good. - Not good, brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.40,1:49:43.45,*ENG,1224,0,0,0,,Come on. We should be at Hagrid's.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.57,1:50:07.10,*ENG,1225,0,0,0,,Look. Buckbeak's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.58,1:50:10.48,*ENG,1226,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.65,1:50:12.64,*ENG,1227,0,0,0,,Remember what Dumbledore said?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.81,1:50:16.84,*ENG,1228,0,0,0,,If we succeed, more than one innocent life could be spared.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.22,1:50:18.55,*ENG,1229,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.84,1:50:41.90,*ENG,1230,0,0,0,,Here they come. I'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.11,1:50:44.58,*ENG,1231,0,0,0,,Fudge has to see Buckbeak before we steal him.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.78,1:50:47.25,*ENG,1232,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he'll think Hagrid set him free.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.28,1:50:50.68,*ENG,1233,0,0,0,,Scabbers, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.85,1:50:53.62,*ENG,1234,0,0,0,,- Keep a closer eye on your pet. - That's Pettigrew.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.86,1:50:56.76,*ENG,1235,0,0,0,,- Harry, you can't. - He betrayed my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.93,1:50:59.92,*ENG,1236,0,0,0,,- You don't expect me to sit here. - Yes, and you must!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.80,1:51:06.53,*ENG,1237,0,0,0,,Harry, you're in Hagrid's hut now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.70,1:51:09.53,*ENG,1238,0,0,0,,If you go bursting in, you'll think you've gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.70,1:51:12.57,*ENG,1239,0,0,0,,Awful things happen to wizards who meddle with time.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.74,1:51:14.97,*ENG,1240,0,0,0,,We can't be seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.28,1:51:20.01,*ENG,1241,0,0,0,,Fudge is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.92,1:51:23.01,*ENG,1242,0,0,0,,And we aren't leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.15,1:51:26.75,*ENG,1243,0,0,0,,Why aren't we leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.67,1:51:39.22,*ENG,1244,0,0,0,,Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.24,1:51:46.57,*ENG,1245,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.81,1:51:48.14,*ENG,1246,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.00,1:52:11.66,*ENG,1247,0,0,0,,We're coming out the back door. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.08,1:52:31.88,*ENG,1248,0,0,0,,Is that really what my hair looks like from the back?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.96,1:52:35.29,*ENG,1249,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.16,1:52:37.99,*ENG,1250,0,0,0,,I thought I just saw...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.19,1:52:40.86,*ENG,1251,0,0,0,,- Never mind. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.18,1:52:57.47,*ENG,1252,0,0,0,,Okay, go, Harry. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.72,1:53:05.69,*ENG,1253,0,0,0,,Get away. Get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.88,1:53:33.28,*ENG,1254,0,0,0,,Minister, I really think I should sign as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.15,1:53:35.28,*ENG,1255,0,0,0,,Yes, very well. Perhaps it would be...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.52,1:53:39.28,*ENG,1256,0,0,0,,Okay, Buckbeak. Come quickly. Come with us now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.76,1:53:46.45,*ENG,1257,0,0,0,,Keep trying. Come on. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.86,1:53:52.66,*ENG,1258,0,0,0,,Buckbeak. Okay? Quickly. Hurry up. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.50,1:53:56.77,*ENG,1259,0,0,0,,- Your name only. - It's such a very long name...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.17,1:53:58.87,*ENG,1260,0,0,0,,Hurry up now, Buckbeak, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.58,1:54:04.55,*ENG,1261,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on, Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.75,1:54:07.04,*ENG,1262,0,0,0,,Come and get the nice dead ferret.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.68,1:54:14.18,*ENG,1263,0,0,0,,- Come on. It's here. Come on, Beaky. - Here we are, minister. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.39,1:54:16.05,*ENG,1264,0,0,0,,- Now, look there. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.26,1:54:19.62,*ENG,1265,0,0,0,,- Look beyond the rocks. - What am I supposed to see?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.79,1:54:23.29,*ENG,1266,0,0,0,,Professor Dippet had that ling planted when he was headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.46,1:54:26.30,*ENG,1267,0,0,0,,- Oh, yes. Indeed, indeed. - And all the strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.30,1:54:30.10,*ENG,1268,0,0,0,,- Come on, Buckbeak. Come on. - I see no strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.27,1:54:31.43,*ENG,1269,0,0,0,,- Over there. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.64,1:54:33.37,*ENG,1270,0,0,0,,- Over there. - This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.61,1:54:36.27,*ENG,1271,0,0,0,,- Let's get this over, please. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.95,1:54:39.64,*ENG,1272,0,0,0,,But where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.58,1:54:42.78,*ENG,1273,0,0,0,,I saw the beast, just now.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.42,1:54:45.61,*ENG,1274,0,0,0,,- Not a moment ago! - How extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.79,1:54:47.12,*ENG,1275,0,0,0,,Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.32,1:54:51.42,*ENG,1276,0,0,0,,Come now, Dumbledore. Someone's obviously released him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.59,1:54:53.05,*ENG,1277,0,0,0,,- Hagrid? - Buckbeak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.13,1:54:57.36,*ENG,1278,0,0,0,,I don't think the minister's suggesting you had anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.36,1:55:00.43,*ENG,1279,0,0,0,,How could you? You've been with us all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.60,1:55:02.50,*ENG,1280,0,0,0,,- Right. - Well, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.67,1:55:04.14,*ENG,1281,0,0,0,,We must search the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.34,1:55:07.33,*ENG,1282,0,0,0,,Well, search the skies, if you must, minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.54,1:55:12.98,*ENG,1283,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I'd like a nice cup of tea or a large brandy.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.15,1:55:17.14,*ENG,1284,0,0,0,,Oh, executioner, your services are no longer required.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.32,1:55:19.18,*ENG,1285,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.39,1:55:22.69,*ENG,1286,0,0,0,,You'll find no small glasses in this house, professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.50,1:55:34.97,*ENG,1287,0,0,0,,- Come on. - This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.78,1:55:43.54,*ENG,1288,0,0,0,,This way, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.98,1:55:47.71,*ENG,1289,0,0,0,,- Now what? - We save Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.92,1:55:50.41,*ENG,1290,0,0,0,,- How? - No idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.73,1:56:02.09,*ENG,1291,0,0,0,,- Look. It's Lupin. - Immobulus!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.57,1:56:10.50,*ENG,1292,0,0,0,,And Snape's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.74,1:56:18.37,*ENG,1293,0,0,0,,And now we wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.61,1:56:21.41,*ENG,1294,0,0,0,,And now we wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.98,1:56:52.24,*ENG,1295,0,0,0,,- At least someone's enjoying himself. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.05,1:56:56.81,*ENG,1296,0,0,0,,- Hermione? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.99,1:57:01.32,*ENG,1297,0,0,0,,Before, down by the lake, when I was with Sirius...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.49,1:57:03.62,*ENG,1298,0,0,0,,...I did see someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.79,1:57:07.23,*ENG,1299,0,0,0,,That someone made the dementors go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.40,1:57:08.73,*ENG,1300,0,0,0,,With a Patronus.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.90,1:57:10.80,*ENG,1301,0,0,0,,I heard Snape telling Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.97,1:57:12.43,*ENG,1302,0,0,0,,According to him...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.60,1:57:16.00,*ENG,1303,0,0,0,,...only a really powerful wizard could have conjured it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.20,1:57:18.07,*ENG,1304,0,0,0,,It was my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.17,1:57:20.97,*ENG,1305,0,0,0,,My dad conjured the Patronus.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.14,1:57:23.41,*ENG,1306,0,0,0,,- Harry, but your dad's... - Dead. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.81,1:57:27.14,*ENG,1307,0,0,0,,I'm just telling you what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.29,1:57:32.91,*ENG,1308,0,0,0,,Here we come.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.59,1:57:40.96,*ENG,1309,0,0,0,,You see Sirius talking to me there?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.13,1:57:44.06,*ENG,1310,0,0,0,,- He's asking me to come live with him. - That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.23,1:57:47.46,*ENG,1311,0,0,0,,When we free him, I'll never have to go back to the Dursleys'.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.64,1:57:49.26,*ENG,1312,0,0,0,,It'll just be me and him.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.94,1:57:51.87,*ENG,1313,0,0,0,,We could live in the country...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.04,1:57:54.67,*ENG,1314,0,0,0,,...someplace you can see the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.84,1:57:57.68,*ENG,1315,0,0,0,,He'll like that after all those years in Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.71,1:58:00.27,*ENG,1316,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.82,1:58:03.51,*ENG,1317,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.43,1:58:11.95,*ENG,1318,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.51,1:58:33.84,*ENG,1319,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - Saving your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.09,1:58:39.49,*ENG,1320,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.32,1:58:45.35,*ENG,1321,0,0,0,,- Great. Now he's coming for us. - Yeah, I didn't think about that. Run!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.50,2:00:02.23,*ENG,1322,0,0,0,,That was so scary.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.40,2:00:05.34,*ENG,1323,0,0,0,,Poor Professor Lupin's having a really tough night.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.78,2:00:19.91,*ENG,1324,0,0,0,,Sirius. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.97,2:00:38.00,*ENG,1325,0,0,0,,- This is horrible. - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.17,2:00:41.44,*ENG,1326,0,0,0,,My dad will come. He'll conjure the Patronus.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.15,2:00:51.98,*ENG,1327,0,0,0,,Any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.19,2:00:54.21,*ENG,1328,0,0,0,,Right there. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.62,2:00:58.11,*ENG,1329,0,0,0,,Harry, listen to me. No one's coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.29,2:01:00.82,*ENG,1330,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he will. He will come.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.00,2:01:07.40,*ENG,1331,0,0,0,,- Sirius. - You're dying...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.50,2:01:11.30,*ENG,1332,0,0,0,,...both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.41,2:01:15.14,*ENG,1333,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.04,2:01:20.91,*ENG,1334,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.54,2:02:21.06,*ENG,1335,0,0,0,,You were right, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.28,2:02:24.61,*ENG,1336,0,0,0,,It wasn't my dad I saw earlier. It was me!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.78,2:02:27.54,*ENG,1337,0,0,0,,I saw myself conjuring the Patronus before.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.72,2:02:30.08,*ENG,1338,0,0,0,,I knew I could do it this time because...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.25,2:02:31.95,*ENG,1339,0,0,0,,...well, I had already done it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.12,2:02:34.59,*ENG,1340,0,0,0,,- Does that make sense? - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.76,2:02:37.59,*ENG,1341,0,0,0,,But I don't like flying!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.74,2:02:52.07,*ENG,1342,0,0,0,,Bombarda!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.37,2:03:28.17,*ENG,1343,0,0,0,,I'll be forever grateful for this...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.34,2:03:29.67,*ENG,1344,0,0,0,,...to both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.84,2:03:32.78,*ENG,1345,0,0,0,,- I want to go with you. - One day, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.95,2:03:35.85,*ENG,1346,0,0,0,,For some time, my life will be too unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.02,2:03:37.78,*ENG,1347,0,0,0,,And besides...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.69,2:03:41.99,*ENG,1348,0,0,0,,- ...you're meant to be here. - But you're innocent.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.16,2:03:44.28,*ENG,1349,0,0,0,,And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.36,2:03:47.26,*ENG,1350,0,0,0,,And for now, that will do.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.56,2:03:52.12,*ENG,1351,0,0,0,,I expect you're tired of hearing this...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.13,2:03:55.66,*ENG,1352,0,0,0,,...but you look so like your father.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.37,2:03:59.36,*ENG,1353,0,0,0,,Except your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.34,2:04:02.64,*ENG,1354,0,0,0,,- You have... - My mother's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.58,2:04:09.68,*ENG,1355,0,0,0,,It's cruel that I spent so much time with James and Lily, and you so little.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.28,2:04:11.77,*ENG,1356,0,0,0,,But know this:
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.89,2:04:16.05,*ENG,1357,0,0,0,,The ones that love us never really leave us.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.43,2:04:19.39,*ENG,1358,0,0,0,,And you can always find them...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.80,2:04:23.66,*ENG,1359,0,0,0,,...in here.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.04,2:04:36.57,*ENG,1360,0,0,0,,You really are the brightest witch of your age.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.37,2:05:05.00,*ENG,1361,0,0,0,,We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.30,2:05:35.96,*ENG,1362,0,0,0,,- Well? - He's free. We did it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.17,2:05:37.64,*ENG,1363,0,0,0,,Did what?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.87,2:05:39.81,*ENG,1364,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.58,2:05:49.91,*ENG,1365,0,0,0,,How did you get there?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.08,2:05:52.75,*ENG,1366,0,0,0,,I was talking to you there. And now you're there.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.09,2:05:55.68,*ENG,1367,0,0,0,,- What's he talking about, Harry? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.89,2:05:59.42,*ENG,1368,0,0,0,,Honestly, Ron. How can somebody be in two places at once?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.92,2:06:27.41,*ENG,1369,0,0,0,,Hello, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.03,2:06:32.86,*ENG,1370,0,0,0,,I saw you coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.43,2:06:40.13,*ENG,1371,0,0,0,,I've looked worse, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.87,2:06:45.96,*ENG,1372,0,0,0,,- You've been sacked. - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.17,2:06:49.14,*ENG,1373,0,0,0,,No. I resigned, actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.31,2:06:51.07,*ENG,1374,0,0,0,,Resigned? Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.25,2:06:56.55,*ENG,1375,0,0,0,,Well, it seems that somebody let slip the nature of my condition.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.72,2:07:02.21,*ENG,1376,0,0,0,,This time tomorrow, the owls will start arriving and parents will not want...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.39,2:07:05.76,*ENG,1377,0,0,0,,...well, someone like me teaching their children.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.99,2:07:07.89,*ENG,1378,0,0,0,,- But Dumbledore... - He has already...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.06,2:07:09.93,*ENG,1379,0,0,0,,...risked enough on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.10,2:07:13.36,*ENG,1380,0,0,0,,Besides, people like me are...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.00,2:07:17.30,*ENG,1381,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say that I'm used to it by now.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.88,2:07:29.44,*ENG,1382,0,0,0,,Why do you look so miserable, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.62,2:07:31.78,*ENG,1383,0,0,0,,None of it made any difference.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.99,2:07:35.51,*ENG,1384,0,0,0,,- Pettigrew escaped. - Didn't make any difference?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.69,2:07:39.18,*ENG,1385,0,0,0,,It made all the difference in the world. You uncovered the truth.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.36,2:07:41.85,*ENG,1386,0,0,0,,You saved an innocent man from a terrible fate.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.23,2:07:44.72,*ENG,1387,0,0,0,,It made a great deal of difference.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.40,2:07:51.53,*ENG,1388,0,0,0,,If I am proud of anything...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.74,2:07:54.37,*ENG,1389,0,0,0,,...it is of how much you have learned this year.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.58,2:07:57.27,*ENG,1390,0,0,0,,Now, since I am no longer your teacher...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.51,2:08:01.74,*ENG,1391,0,0,0,,...I feel no guilt whatsoever about giving this back to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.65,2:08:05.14,*ENG,1392,0,0,0,,So now I'll say goodbye, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.32,2:08:07.91,*ENG,1393,0,0,0,,I feel sure we'll meet again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.46,2:08:09.79,*ENG,1394,0,0,0,,Until then...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.13,2:08:12.82,*ENG,1395,0,0,0,,...mischief managed.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.56,2:08:17.16,*ENG,1396,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.09,2:08:51.29,*ENG,1397,0,0,0,,Stand back, I said! Or I'll take it upstairs if you don't settle.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.47,2:08:52.86,*ENG,1398,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.70,2:08:55.10,*ENG,1399,0,0,0,,Wherever did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.30,2:08:57.67,*ENG,1400,0,0,0,,Can I have a go, Harry? After you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.84,2:08:59.97,*ENG,1401,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about? - Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.17,2:09:03.47,*ENG,1402,0,0,0,,Let the man through. I didn't mean to open it, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.64,2:09:06.11,*ENG,1403,0,0,0,,It was badly wrapped. They made me do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.31,2:09:07.78,*ENG,1404,0,0,0,,Did not.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.18,2:09:12.68,*ENG,1405,0,0,0,,- It's a Firebolt. - It's the fastest broom in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.85,2:09:14.38,*ENG,1406,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.59,2:09:17.11,*ENG,1407,0,0,0,,- But who sent it? - No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.29,2:09:19.19,*ENG,1408,0,0,0,,This came with it.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.03,2:09:25.90,*ENG,1409,0,0,0,,- Go on, Harry! - Yeah, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.90,2:09:27.70,*ENG,1410,0,0,0,,How fast is it, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.05,2:09:48.68,*ENG,1411,0,0,0,,Lumos.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.86,2:09:51.26,*ENG,1412,0,0,0,,I solemnly swear that I am up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.73,2:09:57.42,*ENG,1413,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.27,2:10:01.76,*ENG,1414,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.00,2:10:05.27,*ENG,1415,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.57,2:10:08.84,*ENG,1416,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.24,2:10:44.37,*ENG,1417,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.75,2:10:47.77,*ENG,1418,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.22,2:10:51.48,*ENG,1419,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.82,2:10:55.05,*ENG,1420,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.42,2:10:58.65,*ENG,1421,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.96,2:11:02.16,*ENG,1422,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.50,2:11:05.56,*ENG,1423,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.93,2:11:09.16,*ENG,1424,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.67,2:11:12.66,*ENG,1425,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.07,2:11:16.17,*ENG,1426,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.51,2:11:19.67,*ENG,1427,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.08,2:11:23.14,*ENG,1428,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.62,2:11:26.95,*ENG,1429,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.29,2:11:30.42,*ENG,1430,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.79,2:11:34.06,*ENG,1431,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:34.43,2:11:37.36,*ENG,1432,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.73,2:11:41.03,*ENG,1433,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.07,2:11:45.88,*ENG,1434,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.90,2:11:59.20,*ENG,1435,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:36.94,*CHS,1,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:41.98,*CHS,2,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.70,*CHS,3,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.91,*CHS,4,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:11.74,*CHS,5,0,0,0,,[咒语] 鼓德冒斯 玛西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:17.85,*CHS,6,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与阿兹卡班囚徒》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:42.77,*CHS,7,0,0,0,,哈利…哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:44.91,*CHS,8,0,0,0,,哈利…快开门
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.12,*CHS,9,0,0,0,,噢.玛姬.见到你真高兴…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:57.66,*CHS,10,0,0,0,,弗农姨夫.请在这张表上签个字
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.16,*CHS,11,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.45,*CHS,12,0,0,0,,没什么.学校里的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.63,0:02:04.29,*CHS,13,0,0,0,,你要是守规矩.我就签
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.66,*CHS,14,0,0,0,,只要玛姬不忘守规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:10.00,*CHS,15,0,0,0,,- 喔…你还住在这儿.是吗？ - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:13.00,*CHS,16,0,0,0,,听听.“当然”.你这没良心的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.21,0:02:15.18,*CHS,17,0,0,0,,我弟弟心肠好收留你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:19.64,*CHS,18,0,0,0,,要是换了我 我就把他送到孤儿院去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:24.18,*CHS,19,0,0,0,,哦.那是我的小达力.是我的宝贝小侄子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:26.15,*CHS,20,0,0,0,,嗯.来亲一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.32,0:02:28.59,*CHS,21,0,0,0,,把玛姬的行李搬上楼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:30.78,*CHS,22,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:37.03,*CHS,23,0,0,0,,来.帮妈妈吃完吧 我的宝贝儿.好乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:41.04,*CHS,24,0,0,0,,- 来杯酒吗？.玛姬 - 就一小杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.14,*CHS,25,0,0,0,,点心棒极了.佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.71,*CHS,26,0,0,0,,再倒一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:50.61,*CHS,27,0,0,0,,我要照顾几条小狗… 吃得也就马虎了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.37,*CHS,28,0,0,0,,再来点.这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:58.44,*CHS,29,0,0,0,,啊.你想尝一小口白兰地吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:03:02.65,*CHS,30,0,0,0,,我的乖乖小宝贝.它的味道棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.96,*CHS,31,0,0,0,,你傻笑什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:07.99,*CHS,32,0,0,0,,你送他去哪儿来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:11.50,*CHS,33,0,0,0,,圣布鲁斯 不可救药的孩子去那个学校正合适
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.66,*CHS,34,0,0,0,,那儿不规矩要被藤条抽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:19.37,*CHS,35,0,0,0,,喔.是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:22.34,*CHS,36,0,0,0,,我都被抽了好几回了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:25.07,*CHS,37,0,0,0,,好极了 我可不爱听那些废话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:28.41,*CHS,38,0,0,0,,说什么别打那些该打的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.68,*CHS,39,0,0,0,,也不要为这不争气的小子太自责.弗农
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:35.79,*CHS,40,0,0,0,,这是遗传的 孽种的缺陷是藏不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:38.12,*CHS,41,0,0,0,,这小子的父亲是干嘛的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:41.29,*CHS,42,0,0,0,,不干嘛.他…他没有工作 被辞退了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:44.29,*CHS,43,0,0,0,,- 一定还是个酒鬼 - 胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:47.02,*CHS,44,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？ - 我爸爸不是酒鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:54.10,*CHS,45,0,0,0,,没关系.别大惊小怪 是我握得太紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:56.14,*CHS,46,0,0,0,,你该上床睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:03:59.51,*CHS,47,0,0,0,,别吵 你…弄干净
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:03.71,*CHS,48,0,0,0,,其实 跟他父亲没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:07.84,*CHS,49,0,0,0,,要怪就怪他母亲 反正狗就是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:12.08,*CHS,50,0,0,0,,要是母狗出了问题 那么生出来的小狗就一定有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:13.96,*CHS,51,0,0,0,,你闭嘴.给我闭嘴…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:20.70,*CHS,52,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:23.00,*CHS,53,0,0,0,,我告诉你们吧.你…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.59,*CHS,54,0,0,0,,弗农
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:51.43,*CHS,55,0,0,0,,弗农…快点想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.87,*CHS,56,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:42.01,*CHS,57,0,0,0,,我抓住你了.玛姬.抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:47.45,*CHS,58,0,0,0,,- 你不能放手 - 滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:50.52,*CHS,59,0,0,0,,- 别放手！ - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:53.52,*CHS,60,0,0,0,,弗农
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.42,*CHS,61,0,0,0,,噢.上帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.39,*CHS,62,0,0,0,,玛姬
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.74,*CHS,63,0,0,0,,玛姬…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:09.54,*CHS,64,0,0,0,,回来…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:13.77,*CHS,65,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:40.21,*CHS,66,0,0,0,,你把她弄回来.快把她弄回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.38,0:06:43.61,*CHS,67,0,0,0,,- 恢复原状 - 不.她这是活该！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:47.17,*CHS,68,0,0,0,,- 闪开.离我远点 - 你在校外不能使魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.37,*CHS,69,0,0,0,,- 是吗？那就试试 - 他们不会让你回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.88,*CHS,70,0,0,0,,你没地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.39,*CHS,71,0,0,0,,我不在乎.哪儿都比这儿好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:32.38,*CHS,72,0,0,0,,欢迎乘坐骑士大巴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:35.92,*CHS,73,0,0,0,,这是应急车 运送陷入困境的魔法师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:41.05,*CHS,74,0,0,0,,我叫斯坦·桑帕克 今晚我将做你的售票员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.27,*CHS,75,0,0,0,,你坐在地上干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.13,*CHS,76,0,0,0,,- 我摔倒了 - 没事干嘛要摔倒？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:52.00,*CHS,77,0,0,0,,- 我又不是故意的 - 那就起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:54.40,*CHS,78,0,0,0,,别在这儿瞎耽误工夫了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:04.54,*CHS,79,0,0,0,,- 你在看什么？ - 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.45,*CHS,80,0,0,0,,那就快上车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.45,*CHS,81,0,0,0,,呃.不不不.我搬行李.你上车
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:16.62,*CHS,82,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:29.31,*CHS,83,0,0,0,,快点.往前.往前.往前…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:47.29,*CHS,84,0,0,0,,- 开车吧.厄恩 - 对.开车吧.厄恩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:49.69,*CHS,85,0,0,0,,这将是一次颠簸的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:03.67,*CHS,86,0,0,0,,- 刚才你说你叫什么名字？ - 我没说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:08.34,*CHS,87,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪儿？ - 破釜酒吧.在伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:11.52,*CHS,88,0,0,0,,听见了吗.厄恩？ 破釜酒吧.在伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:15.02,*CHS,89,0,0,0,,破釜酒吧.若给你豌豆汤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:17.99,*CHS,90,0,0,0,,一定要在它吃掉你之前吃掉它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:23.02,*CHS,91,0,0,0,,- 那些麻瓜…他们看不见我们吗？ - 麻瓜？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:24.93,*CHS,92,0,0,0,,他们什么都看不见.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.66,*CHS,93,0,0,0,,对.不过用叉子猛戳 他们有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:32.50,*CHS,94,0,0,0,,十二点方向有个老太太
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.71,*CHS,95,0,0,0,,十.九.八…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:46.65,*CHS,96,0,0,0,,七.六.五.四…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:49.08,*CHS,97,0,0,0,,三.二点五…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:51.09,*CHS,98,0,0,0,,二.一.零点七…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.25,*CHS,99,0,0,0,,冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.00,*CHS,100,0,0,0,,他是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.60,*CHS,101,0,0,0,,这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:05.07,*CHS,102,0,0,0,,他是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.74,*CHS,103,0,0,0,,他是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.01,0:11:09.37,*CHS,104,0,0,0,,小天狼星布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:13.18,*CHS,105,0,0,0,,你不会… 没听过小天狼星布莱克吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.75,*CHS,106,0,0,0,,他是杀人犯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:19.55,*CHS,107,0,0,0,,因为杀人被关进了阿兹卡班监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.62,*CHS,108,0,0,0,,- 他怎么逃跑的？ - 噢.这的确让人费解
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.79,0:11:25.76,*CHS,109,0,0,0,,他是第一个成功越狱的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.73,0:11:29.36,*CHS,110,0,0,0,,他最最支持的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:31.36,*CHS,111,0,0,0,,神秘人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:33.93,*CHS,112,0,0,0,,你一定听说过他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.69,*CHS,113,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:37.20,*CHS,114,0,0,0,,我听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:42.60,*CHS,115,0,0,0,,十二点方向有两辆双层巴士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.74,*CHS,116,0,0,0,,离我们越来越近了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:47.78,*CHS,117,0,0,0,,就在我们前面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:57.59,*CHS,118,0,0,0,,小心你的头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.43,*CHS,119,0,0,0,,各位.各位？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:06.79,*CHS,120,0,0,0,,干嘛拉长脸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:15.11,*CHS,121,0,0,0,,耶.耶.快到了…快到了…快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:23.88,*CHS,122,0,0,0,,- 破釜酒吧到了 - 下一站.翻倒巷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.88,*CHS,123,0,0,0,,哈利波特先生.我们又见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:33.62,*CHS,124,0,0,0,,- 开车吧.厄恩 - 开车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:58.65,*CHS,125,0,0,0,,十一号房间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.55,*CHS,126,0,0,0,,海德薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:05.56,*CHS,127,0,0,0,,你的猫头鹰真聪明.波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:09.42,*CHS,128,0,0,0,,他比你早五分钟飞到这儿来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:14.96,*CHS,129,0,0,0,,身为魔法部部长.我有责任告诉你 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.17,0:13:18.37,*CHS,130,0,0,0,,今晚早些时候… 有人看见你姨夫的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:22.50,*CHS,131,0,0,0,,在谢菲尔的南边围着一根烟囱打转
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:26.37,*CHS,132,0,0,0,,部里当即派遣逆转偶发事件司前去现场处理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:31.35,*CHS,133,0,0,0,,她已经被恢复原状.那段记忆也被抹去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:36.25,*CHS,134,0,0,0,,那件事.她一点都不会记起. 全都不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:39.02,*CHS,135,0,0,0,,所以圆满解决
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:42.06,*CHS,136,0,0,0,,而且丝毫没有损害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:44.06,*CHS,137,0,0,0,,豌豆汤？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:46.36,*CHS,138,0,0,0,,不用.谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:48.73,*CHS,139,0,0,0,,- 部长先生？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.70,*CHS,140,0,0,0,,- 我不明白 - 不明白？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:54.40,*CHS,141,0,0,0,,我违法了.我是不能在家中使用魔法的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:57.58,*CHS,142,0,0,0,,得了.不会因为有人把姑妈吹成气球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:14:00.30,*CHS,143,0,0,0,,就把他关进阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:08.81,*CHS,144,0,0,0,,话说回来.像你那么离家出走 在目前的情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:11.46,*CHS,145,0,0,0,,是非常非常不负责任的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:15.43,*CHS,146,0,0,0,,- 目前的情况指什么？ - 有个杀人犯越狱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:17.43,*CHS,147,0,0,0,,小天狼星布莱克？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.36,*CHS,148,0,0,0,,他跟我有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:26.50,*CHS,149,0,0,0,,当然没有关系 你很安全.这才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:29.83,*CHS,150,0,0,0,,明天你又将启程回霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.95,*CHS,151,0,0,0,,呃.这些是你的新课本 我自作主张
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:37.11,*CHS,152,0,0,0,,把它们一起带来交给你； 现在.汤姆会带你去房间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.32,*CHS,153,0,0,0,,海德薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:48.49,*CHS,154,0,0,0,,呃.随便说一句.哈利. 你在这儿的时候.最好不要到处…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:51.29,*CHS,155,0,0,0,,乱跑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.87,0:14:55.77,*CHS,156,0,0,0,,喂！到底你要不要开走？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:15.15,*CHS,157,0,0,0,, 《妖怪们的妖怪书》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.54,*CHS,158,0,0,0,,客房服务
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:22.22,*CHS,159,0,0,0,,我一会儿再来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:31.23,*CHS,160,0,0,0,,我警告你,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:35.10,*CHS,161,0,0,0,,让那畜生离斑斑远一点 不然我就把他变成茶壶保暖套
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:37.40,*CHS,162,0,0,0,,他是只猫,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:40.54,*CHS,163,0,0,0,,- 猫天生就这样 - 这叫猫.你管这叫猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:43.23,*CHS,164,0,0,0,,- 我看着就像一头长毛猪 - 真可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:45.94,*CHS,165,0,0,0,,自己的臭耗子像鞋刷还说别人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:48.60,*CHS,166,0,0,0,,没关系.克鲁克山 不用理那坏小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.34,*CHS,167,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:52.85,*CHS,168,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:57.08,*CHS,169,0,0,0,,- 埃及？那儿什么样？ - 有好多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:17:00.62,*CHS,170,0,0,0,,木乃伊、古墓… 斑斑也玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:04.02,*CHS,171,0,0,0,,- 以前埃及人崇拜猫 - 对.还崇拜屎壳郎咧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:07.36,*CHS,172,0,0,0,,- 又在显摆你的剪报了.罗恩 - 我没给人看过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:09.97,*CHS,173,0,0,0,,噢.还说没有人呢.除非你忘了汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:11.57,*CHS,174,0,0,0,,- 早班女佣 - 夜班女佣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.80,*CHS,175,0,0,0,,- 厨师 - 修马桶的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.44,*CHS,176,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 韦斯莱太太
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.61,0:17:17.74,*CHS,177,0,0,0,,- 见到你真高兴 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.24,*CHS,178,0,0,0,,- 需要的都带了吗？ - 带了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.57,*CHS,179,0,0,0,,- 是吗？所有的书… - 都在楼上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:23.15,*CHS,180,0,0,0,,- 所有的衣服？ - 一切都在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:24.58,*CHS,181,0,0,0,,- 好孩子 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.78,*CHS,182,0,0,0,,- 哈里波特 - 韦斯莱先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.95,0:17:30.45,*CHS,183,0,0,0,,- 哈利.能跟你说句话吗？ - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:33.29,*CHS,184,0,0,0,,- 赫敏 - 早.韦斯莱先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:37.09,*CHS,185,0,0,0,,- 期待着新学期？ - 是呀.一定带劲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:44.00,*CHS,186,0,0,0,,哈利.魔法部里有些人… 会强烈反对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.87,*CHS,187,0,0,0,,我把接下来要说的这件事向你透露
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:50.34,*CHS,188,0,0,0,,可是我认为你应该了解真相
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:53.11,*CHS,189,0,0,0,,你现在有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:56.25,*CHS,190,0,0,0,,很大的危险
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:59.38,*CHS,191,0,0,0,,这跟小天狼星布莱克有关吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:02.59,*CHS,192,0,0,0,,布莱克的事你知道多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:06.45,*CHS,193,0,0,0,,- 只知道他越狱了 - 知道为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:09.96,*CHS,194,0,0,0,,十三年前.当你阻止了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:12.00,*CHS,195,0,0,0,,- 伏地魔 - 别提他的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.50,*CHS,196,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:16.57,*CHS,197,0,0,0,,当你阻止了… 神秘人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.33,*CHS,198,0,0,0,,布莱克就失去了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:22.84,*CHS,199,0,0,0,,直到今天. 他仍然是一个忠实的仆人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:25.14,*CHS,200,0,0,0,,所以.在他的眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.31,0:18:28.30,*CHS,201,0,0,0,,你是中间唯一挡道的 阻碍了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:32.21,*CHS,202,0,0,0,,神秘人…卷土重来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.55,*CHS,203,0,0,0,,就因为这个.他才会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:37.28,*CHS,204,0,0,0,,从阿兹卡班逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:39.32,*CHS,205,0,0,0,,来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:42.42,*CHS,206,0,0,0,,然后杀我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:46.03,*CHS,207,0,0,0,,我要你向我发誓.无论你听到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.73,*CHS,208,0,0,0,,你都不会去找布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.50,*CHS,209,0,0,0,,韦斯莱先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:54.63,*CHS,210,0,0,0,,我为什么要去找一个想要杀我的人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:57.17,*CHS,211,0,0,0,,快点！快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:18:59.18,*CHS,212,0,0,0,,罗恩…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:01.97,*CHS,213,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:04.65,*CHS,214,0,0,0,,不要忘了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:07.75,*CHS,215,0,0,0,,我没想把她吹大 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.39,*CHS,216,0,0,0,,- 只是失控了 - 帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:14.15,*CHS,217,0,0,0,,罗恩.这可不好玩 幸好哈利没被开除
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:16.06,*CHS,218,0,0,0,,应该说幸好我没被逮捕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.26,*CHS,219,0,0,0,,我还是觉得帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.20,*CHS,220,0,0,0,,来吧.别处坐满了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:25.44,*CHS,221,0,0,0,,那人是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.61,0:19:28.47,*CHS,222,0,0,0,,- l.J.卢平教授 - 你什么都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:30.74,*CHS,223,0,0,0,,她怎么什么都知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:34.04,*CHS,224,0,0,0,,- 他的箱子上写着呢 - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.35,0:19:37.61,*CHS,225,0,0,0,,- 他真的睡着了吗？ - 应该是吧.怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:41.48,*CHS,226,0,0,0,,跟你们说件事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:58.20,*CHS,227,0,0,0,,先让我们先搞清楚 布莱克从阿兹卡班逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:00.31,*CHS,228,0,0,0,,- 是为了追杀你 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.37,*CHS,229,0,0,0,,他一定会被抓住的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:05.31,*CHS,230,0,0,0,,- 所有人都在找他 - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:08.81,*CHS,231,0,0,0,,只是… 以前没有人能从阿兹卡班逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:12.82,*CHS,232,0,0,0,,- 再说.他是杀人成性的疯子 - 多谢.罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:15.88,*CHS,233,0,0,0,,怎么停了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.69,*CHS,234,0,0,0,,还没到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:25.16,*CHS,235,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:28.03,*CHS,236,0,0,0,,不知道.也许是故障
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.34,*CHS,237,0,0,0,,噢.你踩我脚了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.14,*CHS,238,0,0,0,,外面有东西在动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:51.72,*CHS,239,0,0,0,,我想…有人要上车
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.78,*CHS,240,0,0,0,,活见鬼.怎么回事呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:33.32,*CHS,241,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.26,*CHS,242,0,0,0,,哈利.你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.47,0:22:44.10,*CHS,243,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:47.74,*CHS,244,0,0,0,,给.吃这个.会管用的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:50.33,*CHS,245,0,0,0,,没事儿.是巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.65,0:22:58.71,*CHS,246,0,0,0,,刚…刚才那个是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.89,0:23:02.32,*CHS,247,0,0,0,,是个摄魂怪.阿兹卡班的看守之一
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:05.19,*CHS,248,0,0,0,,他在车厢里找小天狼星布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:08.99,*CHS,249,0,0,0,,我失陪一会儿 得去跟司机说句话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:16.54,*CHS,250,0,0,0,,吃吧.会好些
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.64,*CHS,251,0,0,0,,我怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.81,0:23:25.54,*CHS,252,0,0,0,,你全身僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.71,0:23:28.88,*CHS,253,0,0,0,,我们还以为你癫痫病发作了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.65,0:23:32.41,*CHS,254,0,0,0,,呃…你们是不是也…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:33.92,*CHS,255,0,0,0,,失去…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:37.18,*CHS,256,0,0,0,,- 知觉了？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.36,0:23:39.05,*CHS,257,0,0,0,,可感觉怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:41.06,*CHS,258,0,0,0,,好像再也没了快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:44.52,*CHS,259,0,0,0,,我听见尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:46.10,*CHS,260,0,0,0,,是个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:49.04,*CHS,261,0,0,0,,没有人尖叫.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:16.75,*CHS,262,0,0,0,,（霍格莫德）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.23,0:24:52.13,*CHS,263,0,0,0,,欢迎来霍格沃茨度过新学年
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:54.32,*CHS,264,0,0,0,,我有几句话要说…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:58.87,*CHS,265,0,0,0,,趁大家还没被这美味大餐弄得迷迷糊糊的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.04,0:25:02.34,*CHS,266,0,0,0,,首先.欢迎新来的教授l.J.卢平
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.51,0:25:04.91,*CHS,267,0,0,0,,他欣然同意填补空缺
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.11,0:25:07.58,*CHS,268,0,0,0,,教授黑魔法防御术这门课程
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.75,0:25:10.27,*CHS,269,0,0,0,,祝你好运.教授
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.89,0:25:18.22,*CHS,270,0,0,0,,怪不得他知道该给你吃巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.39,0:25:21.05,*CHS,271,0,0,0,,嘿.波特 听说你昏过去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:24.89,*CHS,272,0,0,0,,- 你是真的昏过去了？ - 你滚开.马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.10,0:25:27.07,*CHS,273,0,0,0,,- 他怎么会知道的？ - 我哪知道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:29.60,*CHS,274,0,0,0,,凯特尔·博恩教授多年来 一直教授保护神奇生物课
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.84,0:25:31.70,*CHS,275,0,0,0,,他已经决定退休
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.91,0:25:35.64,*CHS,276,0,0,0,,以便有更多的时间来照料残留的肢体
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:38.50,*CHS,277,0,0,0,,所幸的是.我荣幸地宣布
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.68,0:25:41.51,*CHS,278,0,0,0,,已有人接替他的职位.而且不是别人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:46.02,*CHS,279,0,0,0,,正是我们的鲁伯·海格
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.30,0:26:00.10,*CHS,280,0,0,0,,最后.有件更为严肃的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:02.79,*CHS,281,0,0,0,,在魔法部的要求下…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.04,0:26:08.20,*CHS,282,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨将由一些来自 阿兹卡班的摄魂怪看守
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.88,0:26:12.28,*CHS,283,0,0,0,,直到小天狼星布莱克被捕的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:16.94,*CHS,284,0,0,0,,摄魂怪将驻守在学校的每一个入口
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:18.78,*CHS,285,0,0,0,,虽然我已得到保证
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:22.62,*CHS,286,0,0,0,,它们的出现不会打乱我们的日常生活
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.79,0:26:24.12,*CHS,287,0,0,0,,但我提醒诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.32,0:26:27.49,*CHS,288,0,0,0,,它们是凶残的生物.不会区分
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.66,0:26:31.10,*CHS,289,0,0,0,,它们要追捕的人和挡它们道的人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.23,0:26:34.86,*CHS,290,0,0,0,,因此我必须警告在座的每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.07,0:26:38.70,*CHS,291,0,0,0,,别让它们找到理由伤害你们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.47,0:26:44.54,*CHS,292,0,0,0,,那些摄魂怪天生就不知道什么是原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:49.98,*CHS,293,0,0,0,,可我们.总能找到快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:53.75,*CHS,294,0,0,0,,甚至在最黑暗的时期
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.99,0:26:58.86,*CHS,295,0,0,0,,只要你们记得…把灯点亮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.90,0:27:12.90,*CHS,296,0,0,0,,[开门咒] 否琼勒米杰
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.74,0:27:18.37,*CHS,297,0,0,0,,嘿.听着.她不让我进去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.58,0:27:21.51,*CHS,298,0,0,0,,- [开门咒] 否琼勒米杰 - 哦…不…等等…等等
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.68,0:27:23.51,*CHS,299,0,0,0,,瞧这个
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.26,0:27:39.22,*CHS,300,0,0,0,,- 了不起.我的歌喉震碎的 - [开门咒] 否琼勒米杰
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.47,0:27:42.99,*CHS,301,0,0,0,,- 那好吧.进来吧 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.04,0:27:47.01,*CHS,302,0,0,0,,天哪.都三年了.她还在吊嗓子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.17,0:27:49.30,*CHS,303,0,0,0,,- 她五音不全 - 的确太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:52.70,*CHS,304,0,0,0,,- 嘿.朋友 - 呃.呃
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.75,0:27:55.11,*CHS,305,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 太真可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:58.24,*CHS,306,0,0,0,,嘿.那是绿的.那是猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:02.72,*CHS,307,0,0,0,,- 什么呀？ - 那他也是猴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.89,0:28:05.08,*CHS,308,0,0,0,,别再给他糖了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.26,0:28:07.89,*CHS,309,0,0,0,,嘿.纳威.尝尝大象
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:16.73,*CHS,310,0,0,0,,- 罗恩.接着 - 我会的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.44,0:28:24.03,*CHS,311,0,0,0,,够厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.98,0:28:27.31,*CHS,312,0,0,0,,- 不…别尝那个 - 嗬.那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:30.44,*CHS,313,0,0,0,,快瞧瞧他的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.09,0:29:16.32,*CHS,314,0,0,0,,欢迎我的孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.53,0:29:21.63,*CHS,315,0,0,0,,在我这儿 你们将探究占卜.几种卓越的法术
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.84,0:29:27.14,*CHS,316,0,0,0,,在我这儿 你们将知道自己是否具备视野
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.54,0:29:32.48,*CHS,317,0,0,0,,我…我是教授特里劳妮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:37.24,*CHS,318,0,0,0,,在这里.我们将一起学习如何预知未来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:41.32,*CHS,319,0,0,0,,这学期.我们的重点是探索麦迪 解读茶叶术
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.49,0:29:45.05,*CHS,320,0,0,0,,现在请和坐在你对面的同学交换茶杯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.56,0:29:46.92,*CHS,321,0,0,0,,看见什么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.13,0:29:52.76,*CHS,322,0,0,0,,真相暗藏着 犹如藏在书中的句子.等人来解读
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:55.40,*CHS,323,0,0,0,,可首先必须开阔思路
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:30:00.10,*CHS,324,0,0,0,,- 首先眼光必须放远 - 简直一派胡言
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.31,0:30:02.24,*CHS,325,0,0,0,,- 你哪儿冒出来的？ - 我？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:05.04,*CHS,326,0,0,0,,- 一直都在 - 我说孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.21,0:30:07.51,*CHS,327,0,0,0,,你奶奶身体好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.18,0:30:09.61,*CHS,328,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.78,0:30:12.58,*CHS,329,0,0,0,,依我看不一定  杯子拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.59,0:30:16.95,*CHS,330,0,0,0,,遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:19.78,*CHS,331,0,0,0,,开阔思路
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.40,0:30:26.73,*CHS,332,0,0,0,,你的光环经过死神 你是不在彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.80,*CHS,333,0,0,0,,- 我想是的 - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:31.23,*CHS,334,0,0,0,,看着杯子.说你看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.44,0:30:33.10,*CHS,335,0,0,0,,好.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.97,0:30:38.38,*CHS,336,0,0,0,,有一个歪十字架 那代表考验和苦难
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.81,0:30:42.44,*CHS,337,0,0,0,,这儿.另外.可能是太阳 那代表快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:43.98,*CHS,338,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.18,0:30:48.21,*CHS,339,0,0,0,,你会受苦 可同时你会很快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.42,0:30:49.75,*CHS,340,0,0,0,,杯子拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.33,0:30:54.23,*CHS,341,0,0,0,,亲爱的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.30,0:30:57.96,*CHS,342,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.67,0:31:02.73,*CHS,343,0,0,0,,你有…不详
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.60,0:31:05.30,*CHS,344,0,0,0,,不强？什么叫不强？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.51,0:31:08.37,*CHS,345,0,0,0,,不是不强.白痴.是不详
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.54,0:31:10.70,*CHS,346,0,0,0,,外形是一条凶恶的大狗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:13.34,*CHS,347,0,0,0,,是我们世界最恶毒的征兆
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.91,0:31:15.57,*CHS,348,0,0,0,,它预示着
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.75,0:31:17.58,*CHS,349,0,0,0,,死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.22,0:31:25.95,*CHS,350,0,0,0,,你们说那个不祥和小天狼星布莱克有关吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.13,0:31:30.03,*CHS,351,0,0,0,,说实话.罗恩.我看… 占卜学实在经不起推敲
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.23,0:31:33.86,*CHS,352,0,0,0,,其实.古代儒尼文 那门课才真有意思呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:37.20,*CHS,353,0,0,0,,古代儒尼文？ 你这学期你要学几门课？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.37,0:31:39.00,*CHS,354,0,0,0,,好几门吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.21,0:31:41.30,*CHS,355,0,0,0,,呃.等等.这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.47,0:31:44.20,*CHS,356,0,0,0,,古代儒尼文和占卜课是同一时间
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.38,0:31:46.37,*CHS,357,0,0,0,,你得同一时间上两门课
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.55,0:31:49.95,*CHS,358,0,0,0,,别傻了 没人能同一时间上两门课
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.12,0:31:54.35,*CHS,359,0,0,0,,开阔你们的思路 用你们的天目看未来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.52,0:31:59.48,*CHS,360,0,0,0,,好了.都过来.都走近些 请不要讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.66,0:32:01.49,*CHS,361,0,0,0,,今天让你们一饱眼福
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.66,0:32:03.65,*CHS,362,0,0,0,,精彩的一课.请跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.94,0:32:18.00,*CHS,363,0,0,0,,好了.同学们.请安静 在哪儿站成一组
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.18,0:32:20.67,*CHS,364,0,0,0,,把书翻到49页
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.85,0:32:22.47,*CHS,365,0,0,0,,可这书怎么打开呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.68,0:32:26.55,*CHS,366,0,0,0,,当然得先把书捋一捋了 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.93,0:32:39.73,*CHS,367,0,0,0,,- 别这么没用.隆巴顿 - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.44,0:32:46.60,*CHS,368,0,0,0,,- 这些书真滑稽 - 噢.是呀.滑稽死了.设计巧妙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.87,0:32:49.34,*CHS,369,0,0,0,,这学校再这样下去就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.54,0:32:53.17,*CHS,370,0,0,0,,我爸要知道邓布利多 让这混蛋教课就热闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:55.44,*CHS,371,0,0,0,,你闭嘴.马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.00,0:33:12.02,*CHS,372,0,0,0,,摄魂怪…摄魂怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.04,0:33:23.10,*CHS,373,0,0,0,,- 别管他 - 你应该捋一捋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:24.74,*CHS,374,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.95,0:33:37.95,*CHS,375,0,0,0,,他是不是很漂亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.12,0:33:40.75,*CHS,376,0,0,0,,来认识一下巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.36,0:33:43.59,*CHS,377,0,0,0,,海格.这是什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.80,0:33:45.82,*CHS,378,0,0,0,,是鹰头马身有翼兽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.00,0:33:49.49,*CHS,379,0,0,0,,现在你们要了解的是 它们非常傲慢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:53.64,*CHS,380,0,0,0,,脾气可不好惹 千万别羞辱鹰头马身兽
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.81,0:33:56.50,*CHS,381,0,0,0,,弄不好会搭上你的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.68,0:34:00.08,*CHS,382,0,0,0,,现在.谁来跟它打个招呼？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.62,0:34:04.67,*CHS,383,0,0,0,,好样的.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:08.89,*CHS,384,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:10.75,*CHS,385,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:14.65,*CHS,386,0,0,0,,你得尊重礼让.这是礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.83,0:34:16.69,*CHS,387,0,0,0,,所以.走上前.向它鞠个躬
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.93,0:34:19.33,*CHS,388,0,0,0,,然后等着.看它是不是还礼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.50,0:34:21.63,*CHS,389,0,0,0,,它还礼.你才能摸它
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:25.00,*CHS,390,0,0,0,,不然的话… 好吧好吧好吧.过会儿再说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.71,0:34:29.70,*CHS,391,0,0,0,,现在向它鞠躬
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.31,0:34:32.97,*CHS,392,0,0,0,,再低些
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.32,0:34:39.98,*CHS,393,0,0,0,,往后退.哈利.退后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.85,0:34:43.34,*CHS,394,0,0,0,,别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.02,0:34:47.02,*CHS,395,0,0,0,,别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:59.66,*CHS,396,0,0,0,,干得好.哈利.干得好 嘿.你个大家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.18,0:35:04.67,*CHS,397,0,0,0,,现在.你可以上去拍拍它
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.88,0:35:06.71,*CHS,398,0,0,0,,去吧.别害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.15,0:35:17.59,*CHS,399,0,0,0,,要轻轻地.慢慢地.慢慢地
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.96,0:35:22.36,*CHS,400,0,0,0,,别那么快.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.50,0:35:30.70,*CHS,401,0,0,0,,慢点.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.94,0:35:34.10,*CHS,402,0,0,0,,轻轻地.我慢慢的让它靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:38.27,*CHS,403,0,0,0,,轻轻的…慢慢的…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.51,0:35:40.27,*CHS,404,0,0,0,,再慢点…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.91,0:35:42.24,*CHS,405,0,0,0,,对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.85,0:35:46.25,*CHS,406,0,0,0,,干得好.干得好.哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.42,0:35:48.41,*CHS,407,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.62,0:35:51.02,*CHS,408,0,0,0,,- 现在它愿意让你骑 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.22,0:35:52.75,*CHS,409,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 嘿！嘿！嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.93,0:35:56.09,*CHS,410,0,0,0,,把你抱上去.坐在翅膀关节的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:36:01.17,*CHS,411,0,0,0,,别拔它的羽毛.它会谢你的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:45.59,*CHS,412,0,0,0,,干得好.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:47.74,*CHS,413,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.94,0:37:49.34,*CHS,414,0,0,0,,噢.得了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.11,0:37:52.41,*CHS,415,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.11,0:37:56.31,*CHS,416,0,0,0,,- 我今天的课怎么样？ - 一级棒.教授
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.72,0:38:03.92,*CHS,417,0,0,0,,你根本就不危险.对吗？ 丑八怪！大怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.16,0:38:05.52,*CHS,418,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.43,0:38:07.89,*CHS,419,0,0,0,,不要.马尔福！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.63,0:38:10.22,*CHS,420,0,0,0,,巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.43,0:38:12.56,*CHS,421,0,0,0,,哇！哇！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.77,0:38:15.53,*CHS,422,0,0,0,,巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.70,0:38:19.00,*CHS,423,0,0,0,,你这笨畜生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.24,0:38:22.30,*CHS,424,0,0,0,,- 咹.它杀了我.它杀了我 - 冷静些.只是皮肉伤
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.54,0:38:23.70,*CHS,425,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.88,0:38:29.08,*CHS,426,0,0,0,,- 必须立刻送他去医院 - 我是老师.我来送
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.15,0:38:35.02,*CHS,427,0,0,0,,- 我…我…会让你后悔的… - 现在下课
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.19,0:38:37.45,*CHS,428,0,0,0,,你和你那该死的野鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.95,0:39:02.97,*CHS,429,0,0,0,,是不是很疼.马尔福？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:07.05,*CHS,430,0,0,0,,时好时坏.不过.我还是命大
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.22,0:39:10.55,*CHS,431,0,0,0,,庞弗雷夫人说再拖上一两分钟 胳膊就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.89,0:39:13.76,*CHS,432,0,0,0,,- 那我就几星期不能做功课了 - 听听这白痴说的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:18.26,*CHS,433,0,0,0,,- 他还真越说越离谱了 - 至少海格没被开除
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:22.19,*CHS,434,0,0,0,,可我听说马尔福的爸爸很凶啊 这事儿还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.44,0:39:24.27,*CHS,435,0,0,0,,- 有人看见他了！看见他了！ - 谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.47,0:39:26.17,*CHS,436,0,0,0,,小天狼星布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.24,0:39:30.17,*CHS,437,0,0,0,,达福镇？离这儿可不远
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.61,0:39:33.24,*CHS,438,0,0,0,,他不会来霍格沃茨吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.41,0:39:35.90,*CHS,439,0,0,0,,- 入口有摄魂怪把守 - 摄魂怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.08,0:39:39.42,*CHS,440,0,0,0,,他们已经让它溜了一次 谁敢保证不会有第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.62,0:39:44.15,*CHS,441,0,0,0,,说得对.他神出鬼没的 抓他就像抓烟雾
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.96,0:39:48.12,*CHS,442,0,0,0,,用你的手抓烟雾
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.25,0:40:16.31,*CHS,443,0,0,0,,是不是很奇妙？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.56,0:40:22.32,*CHS,444,0,0,0,,有哪位同学能猜一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.50,0:40:24.29,*CHS,445,0,0,0,,里面是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.50,0:40:28.49,*CHS,446,0,0,0,,- 是一个博格特？ - 很好.托马斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.30,0:40:32.20,*CHS,447,0,0,0,,那谁能告诉我 博格特长什么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.41,0:40:34.40,*CHS,448,0,0,0,,- 没人知道 - 它几时来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.67,0:40:36.14,*CHS,449,0,0,0,,博格特会变形
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.38,0:40:39.54,*CHS,450,0,0,0,,见到它的人,心里最怕什么 它就会变成什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.78,0:40:44.18,*CHS,451,0,0,0,,- 所以它们是那么的… - 那么的恐怖…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.38,0:40:49.84,*CHS,452,0,0,0,,所幸的是 有一个很简单的咒语就能击退博格特
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.22,0:40:54.99,*CHS,453,0,0,0,,现在来练习 请先别用魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.29,0:40:57.79,*CHS,454,0,0,0,,跟我念.瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.00,0:41:00.09,*CHS,455,0,0,0,,- 瑞地肯尤拉 - 非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:02.83,*CHS,456,0,0,0,,再响亮些.要说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.07,0:41:05.23,*CHS,457,0,0,0,,- 听好.瑞地肯尤拉斯 - 瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.47,0:41:07.53,*CHS,458,0,0,0,,- 听得像溜得快拉屎 - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.77,0:41:11.73,*CHS,459,0,0,0,,我们就先练到这儿吧 要知道单靠咒语是不够的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.94,0:41:15.68,*CHS,460,0,0,0,,真正能把博格特击垮的是… 大笑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.88,0:41:20.28,*CHS,461,0,0,0,,你们得强迫它变成你们认为… 真正可笑的形象
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.45,0:41:24.58,*CHS,462,0,0,0,,我来解释 纳威.请你过来.好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.82,0:41:27.12,*CHS,463,0,0,0,,来吧.别害羞.来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.13,0:41:29.82,*CHS,464,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.30,0:41:33.75,*CHS,465,0,0,0,,哈啰.纳威 你最害怕的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.00,0:41:35.63,*CHS,466,0,0,0,,斯内普教授
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.90,0:41:37.70,*CHS,467,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 斯内普教授
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.90,0:41:41.30,*CHS,468,0,0,0,,斯内普教授？是的.都怕他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.47,0:41:45.93,*CHS,469,0,0,0,,- 你是和奶奶一块儿住的？ - 是的.我也不想博格特变成她的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.45,0:41:48.04,*CHS,470,0,0,0,,不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.88,0:41:51.65,*CHS,471,0,0,0,,现在想想奶奶是怎么穿戴的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.92,0:41:55.11,*CHS,472,0,0,0,,只想她的穿戴.而且要想清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.35,0:41:58.41,*CHS,473,0,0,0,,- 她拿一只红色的手袋 - 不需要说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.59,0:42:02.46,*CHS,474,0,0,0,,你只要你看见.我们就能看 我打开衣柜的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.70,0:42:05.96,*CHS,475,0,0,0,,我会要你这么做…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.47,0:42:09.40,*CHS,476,0,0,0,,想想斯内普教授穿着你奶奶的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.60,0:42:11.30,*CHS,477,0,0,0,,能做到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.90,0:42:14.60,*CHS,478,0,0,0,,开始.魔杖准备
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:18.38,*CHS,479,0,0,0,,一、二、三
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.19,0:42:30.09,*CHS,480,0,0,0,,快想.纳威.快想
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.83,0:42:34.88,*CHS,481,0,0,0,,瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.47,0:42:42.09,*CHS,482,0,0,0,,好极了.纳威.好极了 不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.30,0:42:45.24,*CHS,483,0,0,0,,都往后退.大家排好队
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.44,0:42:52.77,*CHS,484,0,0,0,,排好队
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.95,0:42:56.35,*CHS,485,0,0,0,,我要每个人都想出自己最害怕的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.55,0:42:59.64,*CHS,486,0,0,0,,然后把它变得很可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.85,0:43:01.55,*CHS,487,0,0,0,,下一个.罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.79,0:43:08.32,*CHS,488,0,0,0,,集中思想.面对恐惧.勇敢些
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.84,0:43:21.33,*CHS,489,0,0,0,,魔杖准备
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.11,0:43:23.90,*CHS,490,0,0,0,,瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.08,0:43:25.44,*CHS,491,0,0,0,,好极了.瞧见了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.05,0:43:28.95,*CHS,492,0,0,0,,非常好.非常好太精采了.很好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.45,0:43:35.25,*CHS,493,0,0,0,,这实在是让人乐不可支 帕瓦蒂.快上
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:39.25,*CHS,494,0,0,0,,你看见了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.57,0:43:51.97,*CHS,495,0,0,0,,别慌.千万别慌
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.14,0:43:54.11,*CHS,496,0,0,0,,瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.07,*CHS,497,0,0,0,,下一个.往前走….往前走…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.18,0:44:00.01,*CHS,498,0,0,0,,好极了！好极了！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.03,0:44:16.12,*CHS,499,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.00,0:44:23.80,*CHS,500,0,0,0,,瑞地肯尤拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.31,0:44:35.25,*CHS,501,0,0,0,,嗯.好吧.非常抱歉.今天就练到这儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.41,0:44:37.41,*CHS,502,0,0,0,,都去后面拿回自己的书
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.58,0:44:40.21,*CHS,503,0,0,0,,课就上到这儿.谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.39,0:44:43.41,*CHS,504,0,0,0,,抱歉. 好了.走吧.别玩物丧志
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.42,0:44:50.02,*CHS,505,0,0,0,,现在记住 去霍格莫德村应该是一种荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.30,0:44:53.13,*CHS,506,0,0,0,,如果有谁在学校的表现欠佳.那么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.30,0:44:56.27,*CHS,507,0,0,0,,就不再享受这份特殊的待遇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.70,0:45:00.00,*CHS,508,0,0,0,,座位表上没签字.就不能去那个村
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.17,0:45:01.70,*CHS,509,0,0,0,,这是规定
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.94,0:45:05.10,*CHS,510,0,0,0,,表上签了字的跟我来 没签字的别跟来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.28,0:45:07.77,*CHS,511,0,0,0,,教授.我想.如果你签了字 那我就能去了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.95,0:45:10.44,*CHS,512,0,0,0,,我不能签 只有家长或监护人可以签
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.62,0:45:13.81,*CHS,513,0,0,0,,我都不是.那就不能签
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:20.68,*CHS,514,0,0,0,,对不起.波特.我的决定不会变
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.93,0:45:25.16,*CHS,515,0,0,0,,不能一起去了.回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.98,0:45:41.00,*CHS,516,0,0,0,,教授.我能问个问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.21,0:45:45.08,*CHS,517,0,0,0,,你要问我为什么阻止你 对付那博格特.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.28,0:45:46.68,*CHS,518,0,0,0,,但是.我想当然地认为
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.85,0:45:49.69,*CHS,519,0,0,0,,它会变成伏地魔的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.86,0:45:53.35,*CHS,520,0,0,0,,一开始是想到了…伏地魔 可后来想起
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.59,0:45:56.19,*CHS,521,0,0,0,,那晚在火车上
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.40,0:45:58.89,*CHS,522,0,0,0,,- 遇见摄魂怪 - 我记得
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.10,0:46:02.00,*CHS,523,0,0,0,,这说明你最害怕的.是恐惧本身
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.17,0:46:03.63,*CHS,524,0,0,0,,挺合乎情理
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.84,0:46:05.90,*CHS,525,0,0,0,,在我晕倒前
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.17,0:46:08.14,*CHS,526,0,0,0,,听见了一个声音
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.71,0:46:10.27,*CHS,527,0,0,0,,有个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.74,0:46:12.11,*CHS,528,0,0,0,,在尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.31,0:46:15.54,*CHS,529,0,0,0,,摄魂怪逼我们 想起那些最糟糕的往事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.75,0:46:18.68,*CHS,530,0,0,0,,我们的痛苦成了它们的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.52,0:46:21.71,*CHS,531,0,0,0,,是妈妈在尖叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.89,0:46:24.12,*CHS,532,0,0,0,,被杀的那个晚的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.72,0:46:30.18,*CHS,533,0,0,0,,其实.我第一次见到你的时候就认出了你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.80,0:46:33.63,*CHS,534,0,0,0,,不是看你的疤.而是眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.07,0:46:36.19,*CHS,535,0,0,0,,就像你妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.17,0:46:38.60,*CHS,536,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.94,0:46:41.91,*CHS,537,0,0,0,,咹.是啊.我认识她
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.24,0:46:48.08,*CHS,538,0,0,0,,我遭人冷落时.你妈妈帮助了我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.28,0:46:51.51,*CHS,539,0,0,0,,她不仅是个天赋秉异的女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.68,0:46:55.02,*CHS,540,0,0,0,,还是个极其善良的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.52,0:46:58.58,*CHS,541,0,0,0,,她能发现别人的美 她尤其能看出那些…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.76,0:47:04.92,*CHS,542,0,0,0,,那些连别人自己都还没发现的美
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.40,0:47:09.09,*CHS,543,0,0,0,,而你的父亲詹姆斯却截然不同
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.30,0:47:10.79,*CHS,544,0,0,0,,他…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.34,0:47:14.70,*CHS,545,0,0,0,,他的天赋似乎是招惹麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.94,0:47:22.44,*CHS,546,0,0,0,,这天赋…据说后来遗传给了你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.45,0:47:29.42,*CHS,547,0,0,0,,你实在太像你的父母了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.26,0:47:33.38,*CHS,548,0,0,0,,这总有一天你会明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.83,0:47:41.27,*CHS,549,0,0,0,,蜂蜜公爵糖果店真没说的 可哪家都比不上佐科笑话店
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.47,0:47:43.96,*CHS,550,0,0,0,,这次我没去成尖叫屋.那是全…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:48.20,*CHS,551,0,0,0,,- 鬼屋 - 全英国闹鬼最厉害的 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.61,0:47:51.08,*CHS,552,0,0,0,,出了什么事儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:53.68,*CHS,553,0,0,0,,哼.也许是纳威又把口令忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.85,0:47:56.28,*CHS,554,0,0,0,,- 嘿！ - 咹.你谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.45,0:48:00.75,*CHS,555,0,0,0,,请让我过去 对不起.我是男生会主席
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.35,0:48:03.02,*CHS,556,0,0,0,,往后退.都往后退
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.22,0:48:06.35,*CHS,557,0,0,0,,宿舍要彻底搜查.谁都不准进去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.53,0:48:08.86,*CHS,558,0,0,0,,是胖夫人.她不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.00,0:48:13.43,*CHS,559,0,0,0,,不见最好.她唱歌像杀猪叫
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.60,0:48:15.50,*CHS,560,0,0,0,,- 这不好玩.罗恩 - 大家都镇静！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.54,0:48:22.60,*CHS,561,0,0,0,,- 格兰芬多的同学回公共休息室 - 都安静.校长来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.95,0:48:28.94,*CHS,562,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.11,0:48:31.17,*CHS,563,0,0,0,,闪开.闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.35,0:48:33.25,*CHS,564,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.50,0:48:50.37,*CHS,565,0,0,0,,费尔奇先生.请招集幽灵
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.70,0:48:54.80,*CHS,566,0,0,0,,叫它们搜查城堡里每一幅画.找到胖夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.01,0:48:58.03,*CHS,567,0,0,0,,不需要叫幽灵了.教授
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.88,0:49:01.00,*CHS,568,0,0,0,,胖夫人在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.85,0:49:04.84,*CHS,569,0,0,0,,嘿,嘿,嘿,走路小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.90,0:49:07.08,*CHS,570,0,0,0,,慢一点.我是男生会主席
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.29,0:49:09.69,*CHS,571,0,0,0,,- 都快回来 - 回来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.29,0:49:16.16,*CHS,572,0,0,0,,嘿.这是谁干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.10,0:49:23.09,*CHS,573,0,0,0,,他有一双魔鬼的眼睛 灵魂就像他名字那样黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.07,0:49:27.04,*CHS,574,0,0,0,,是他.校长 大伙说的那个人.他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.24,0:49:29.71,*CHS,575,0,0,0,,就在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.91,0:49:32.07,*CHS,576,0,0,0,,小天狼星布莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.31,0:49:37.41,*CHS,577,0,0,0,,搜查城堡.费尔奇先生.其他人都去礼堂.  好了.都接着走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.48,0:50:10.41,*CHS,578,0,0,0,,我搜寻了天文塔、猫头鹰栖息地 那儿什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.58,0:50:13.14,*CHS,579,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 三楼也没有情况
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.18,0:50:15.29,*CHS,580,0,0,0,,- 非常好 - 我去地窖里查过了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.45,0:50:18.12,*CHS,581,0,0,0,,没发现布莱克 其他地方也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.36,0:50:20.85,*CHS,582,0,0,0,,我想他不会逗留不走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.09,0:50:24.43,*CHS,583,0,0,0,,他真够本事的.你说他
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.60,0:50:26.89,*CHS,584,0,0,0,,单枪匹马进入霍格沃茨城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.10,0:50:29.73,*CHS,585,0,0,0,,- 神不知鬼不觉的 - 的确
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.97,0:50:31.80,*CHS,586,0,0,0,,他怎么进来的.你想过？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.00,0:50:34.97,*CHS,587,0,0,0,,想过不少.可没有一个是可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.21,0:50:36.73,*CHS,588,0,0,0,,您也许还记得
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.91,0:50:39.74,*CHS,589,0,0,0,,新学期开始前.你任命卢平教授时
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.91,0:50:41.97,*CHS,590,0,0,0,,我曾经表示过担忧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:46.24,*CHS,591,0,0,0,,城堡里没有一个教师会帮助小天狼星布莱克潜入
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.42,0:50:48.82,*CHS,592,0,0,0,,我相信城堡是安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.99,0:50:52.62,*CHS,593,0,0,0,,我还是希望能把学生们送回他们各自的学院
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.79,0:50:55.12,*CHS,594,0,0,0,,那么波特呢.该警告他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.33,0:50:57.96,*CHS,595,0,0,0,,也许吧.可现在让他睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.83,0:51:03.53,*CHS,596,0,0,0,,睡梦中我们会进入完全属于自己的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.87,0:51:10.33,*CHS,597,0,0,0,,让他在最深的海洋中畅游 或者在最高的云彩上滑翔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.68,0:51:51.01,*CHS,598,0,0,0,,把书翻到第394页
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.46,0:52:04.02,*CHS,599,0,0,0,,对不起.老师 卢平教授在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.73,0:52:08.19,*CHS,600,0,0,0,,这不该你操心.对吗.波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.37,0:52:12.44,*CHS,601,0,0,0,,原因很简单.你们的教授 目前身体欠佳.无法前来授课
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.44,0:52:17.47,*CHS,602,0,0,0,,把书翻到第394页
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.28,0:52:23.98,*CHS,603,0,0,0,,是狼人？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.28,0:52:27.05,*CHS,604,0,0,0,,可是老师… 我们刚学红帽子和哼皮蓬
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.29,0:52:30.41,*CHS,605,0,0,0,,- 几星期后才学夜间的野兽 - 安静
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.62,0:52:33.79,*CHS,606,0,0,0,,她几时进来的？ 你看见她进来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.43,0:52:37.92,*CHS,607,0,0,0,,现在.你们当中有谁能告诉我 阿尼玛格斯…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.13,0:52:40.60,*CHS,608,0,0,0,,和狼人的区别
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.30,0:52:43.20,*CHS,609,0,0,0,,没人？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.74,0:52:46.64,*CHS,610,0,0,0,,- 真令人失望 - 我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.84,0:52:49.97,*CHS,611,0,0,0,,阿尼玛格斯可以选择变成动物
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.14,0:52:51.67,*CHS,612,0,0,0,,而狼人却没有选择
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.11,0:52:53.81,*CHS,613,0,0,0,,每当月圆之夜他变形时
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.01,0:52:57.88,*CHS,614,0,0,0,,就忘了自己是谁 连最好的朋友他也会杀
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.08,0:53:01.64,*CHS,615,0,0,0,,另外… 狼人只回应他的同类发出的喊声
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.82,0:53:05.59,*CHS,616,0,0,0,,谢谢.马尔福先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.76,0:53:08.09,*CHS,617,0,0,0,,这是你第二次抢着发言了.格兰杰小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.26,0:53:10.25,*CHS,618,0,0,0,,你是缺乏自制呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.43,0:53:13.80,*CHS,619,0,0,0,,还是乐于做一个… 让人厌恶的万事通
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.10,0:53:17.50,*CHS,620,0,0,0,,- 他说得挺有道理 - 格兰芬多扣五分
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.70,0:53:22.30,*CHS,621,0,0,0,,为了惩罚你们的无知 星期一早上每人交一篇文章
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.51,0:53:26.17,*CHS,622,0,0,0,,两卷羊皮纸.内容是狼人 在文章中重点阐述
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.34,0:53:28.94,*CHS,623,0,0,0,,- 如何识别狼人 - 老师.明天有魁地奇
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.05,0:53:33.35,*CHS,624,0,0,0,,那我建议你得格外保重 波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.59,0:53:37.61,*CHS,625,0,0,0,,缺胳膊断腿照样得写文章
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.82,0:53:41.59,*CHS,626,0,0,0,,把书翻到第394页
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.60,0:53:45.09,*CHS,627,0,0,0,,狼人叫Werewolf
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.00,0:53:51.49,*CHS,628,0,0,0,,它由安德鲁斯·萨克逊语中的两个单词 WERE 和 WOLF 组成
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.50,0:53:56.67,*CHS,629,0,0,0,,前者的意思是“男人”后者的意思是“狼”
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.70,0:53:58.64,*CHS,630,0,0,0,, 狼人 有好几种方法可以变成
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.84,0:54:01.84,*CHS,631,0,0,0,,狼人被赐予
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.90,0:54:05.01,*CHS,632,0,0,0,,变形的本领、被一个狼人咬
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.87,0:54:26.50,*CHS,633,0,0,0,,- 加油.哈利… - 加油.哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.26,0:56:29.09,*CHS,634,0,0,0,,恩斯达麦特
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.33,0:56:34.46,*CHS,635,0,0,0,,- 他脸色惨白.是吗？ - 惨白？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.67,0:56:36.93,*CHS,636,0,0,0,,- 还能怎样.一百英尺高空摔下来 - 行了.罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:40.00,*CHS,637,0,0,0,,你从天文塔上摔下来.你会怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.21,0:56:43.23,*CHS,638,0,0,0,,也许会比他平时要好看
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.88,0:56:49.85,*CHS,639,0,0,0,,- 感觉怎么样？ - 好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.05,0:56:52.02,*CHS,640,0,0,0,,你把我们吓坏了.伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.28,0:56:56.78,*CHS,641,0,0,0,,- 怎么样了？ - 你摔下了扫帚
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.05,0:56:59.39,*CHS,642,0,0,0,,是吗？我们比赛.谁赢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.83,0:57:04.52,*CHS,643,0,0,0,,没人怪你.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.80,0:57:08.60,*CHS,644,0,0,0,,摄魂怪不应该进入学校的 邓布利多大发雷霆
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.80,0:57:10.86,*CHS,645,0,0,0,,他一救下了你就赶走了它们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.07,0:57:14.70,*CHS,646,0,0,0,,另外.还有一件事你应该知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.31,0:57:21.58,*CHS,647,0,0,0,,你摔下来时.你的扫帚…被风吹到打人柳那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.60,0:57:23.57,*CHS,648,0,0,0,,结果…它就
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.85,0:57:28.15,*CHS,649,0,0,0,,你的扫帚坏了.真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.45,0:57:30.08,*CHS,650,0,0,0,,就没办法修好它？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.29,0:57:31.65,*CHS,651,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.82,0:57:35.16,*CHS,652,0,0,0,,教授 摄魂怪对我的影响怎么这么大？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.56,0:57:38.65,*CHS,653,0,0,0,,- 要比…对别人大许多 - 听着
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.83,0:57:41.99,*CHS,654,0,0,0,,摄魂怪是最邪恶生物之一 他们吸食每一种
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.20,0:57:46.47,*CHS,655,0,0,0,,美好的情感 每一段快乐的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.04,0:57:51.57,*CHS,656,0,0,0,,直到把人美好的东西都吸光 只剩下最糟的往事
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.81,0:57:56.01,*CHS,657,0,0,0,,你…并不是软弱.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.18,0:58:00.24,*CHS,658,0,0,0,,摄魂怪对你影响最大 是因为你曾经历过真正的恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.45,0:58:03.55,*CHS,659,0,0,0,,你那些同学几乎无法想象
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.02,0:58:06.32,*CHS,660,0,0,0,,你没必要觉得羞耻
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.52,0:58:10.55,*CHS,661,0,0,0,,- 我害怕.教授 - 你要是不害怕那倒是傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.73,0:58:14.22,*CHS,662,0,0,0,,我要学会跟它们斗 你可以教我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.40,0:58:16.39,*CHS,663,0,0,0,,火车上那个就是你赶走的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.60,0:58:18.40,*CHS,664,0,0,0,,那晚只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.67,0:58:23.23,*CHS,665,0,0,0,,- 但你赶走了它 - 我可不是在假扮专家.哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.58,0:58:28.54,*CHS,666,0,0,0,,可照目前的情况来看 摄魂怪对你特别感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.71,0:58:32.38,*CHS,667,0,0,0,,也许我应该教你 不过得过了假期
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:34.45,*CHS,668,0,0,0,,现在.我需要休息
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.01,0:59:05.18,*CHS,669,0,0,0,,准备去霍格莫德 快.同学们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.80,0:59:21.79,*CHS,670,0,0,0,,- 你可以… - 求你放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.80,0:59:24.90,*CHS,671,0,0,0,,- 可是他不够聪明 - 再说我们有更好的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.07,0:59:27.90,*CHS,672,0,0,0,,- 求求你们了.我想去霍格莫德 - 我们知道
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.07,0:59:29.44,*CHS,673,0,0,0,,- 别担心 - 我们会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.61,0:59:32.13,*CHS,674,0,0,0,,- 我知一条捷径 - 只要你安静
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.31,0:59:36.30,*CHS,675,0,0,0,,- 放开我.求你们啦 - 好了.伙计们.不要...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.51,0:59:39.11,*CHS,676,0,0,0,,现在.哈利. 跟大哥们一块玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.52,0:59:42.65,*CHS,677,0,0,0,,你们要干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.92,0:59:45.72,*CHS,678,0,0,0,,- 什么垃圾？ - 他管这叫垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:49.22,*CHS,679,0,0,0,,- 这可是我们成功的秘密 - 还舍不得给你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.43,0:59:52.33,*CHS,680,0,0,0,,可我们认为 你比我们更需要
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.50,0:59:54.23,*CHS,681,0,0,0,,乔治.开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.47,0:59:57.70,*CHS,682,0,0,0,,我郑重宣誓.我会用这来搞怪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.37,1:00:04.93,*CHS,683,0,0,0,,月亮脸、虫尾巴、大脚板、尖头叉子…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.34,1:00:08.31,*CHS,684,0,0,0,,自豪地献上活点地图
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.55,1:00:10.81,*CHS,685,0,0,0,,真得感谢他们
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.35,1:00:18.19,*CHS,686,0,0,0,,等等.这是霍格沃茨 那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.36,1:00:21.09,*CHS,687,0,0,0,,- 哦.不 - 那这个是…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.26,1:00:22.25,*CHS,688,0,0,0,,- 在他书房 - 踱步…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.43,1:00:24.45,*CHS,689,0,0,0,,他老踱步
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.70,1:00:26.49,*CHS,690,0,0,0,,- 这地图能看到… - 每个人…每个人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.70,1:00:28.69,*CHS,691,0,0,0,,- 每个人?在哪？ - 在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.90,1:00:29.99,*CHS,692,0,0,0,,- 每分钟… - 每一天
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:33.17,*CHS,693,0,0,0,,- 太棒了.哪来的？ - 从费尔奇办公室偷来的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.37,1:00:37.17,*CHS,694,0,0,0,,- 一年级时 - 好了.听着.有七条密道能走出城堡
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.34,1:00:38.87,*CHS,695,0,0,0,,我们推荐这一条…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.08,1:00:42.24,*CHS,696,0,0,0,,- 独眼女巫通道 - 直接通往蜜蜂公爵地窖
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.41,1:00:44.24,*CHS,697,0,0,0,,不过得快.费尔奇正过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.42,1:00:47.85,*CHS,698,0,0,0,,喔.哈利.别忘了 完事后.只要敲它一下.并说
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.02,1:00:52.35,*CHS,699,0,0,0,,“恶作剧完毕” 不然谁都能看它
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.15,1:01:39.09,*CHS,701,0,0,0,,味道好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.11,1:01:51.17,*CHS,703,0,0,0,,全英国闹鬼最厉害的鬼屋 这我提过吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.35,1:01:53.04,*CHS,704,0,0,0,,- 两遍了 - 呃
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.75,1:01:56.08,*CHS,705,0,0,0,,想走得更近一些吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.29,1:01:57.98,*CHS,706,0,0,0,,离尖叫屋近些
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.29,1:02:01.16,*CHS,707,0,0,0,,呃…其实我.我在这儿挺好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.33,1:02:03.16,*CHS,708,0,0,0,,噢.瞧瞧.这是谁呀
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.59,1:02:05.82,*CHS,709,0,0,0,,想买套新的梦之屋？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.90,1:02:10.33,*CHS,710,0,0,0,,太大了点吧.小蠢蛋 你家里人是睡一间房？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.60,1:02:13.80,*CHS,711,0,0,0,,- 你闭嘴.马尔福 - 喔.不太友好嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.11,1:02:19.17,*CHS,712,0,0,0,,伙计们.该教教韦斯莱小蠢蛋 怎么尊重长辈的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.38,1:02:22.81,*CHS,713,0,0,0,,- 长辈不会是你吧 - 敢这么跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.98,1:02:24.97,*CHS,714,0,0,0,,你这肮脏的小泥巴种
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.19,1:02:30.71,*CHS,715,0,0,0,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.99,1:02:39.33,*CHS,716,0,0,0,,- 别傻站着.帮我 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.15,1:03:01.41,*CHS,717,0,0,0,,怎么的了.马尔福？滑雪板丢了？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.39,1:03:06.82,*CHS,718,0,0,0,,给我闪开
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.29,1:03:08.88,*CHS,719,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.06,1:03:12.05,*CHS,720,0,0,0,,马尔福！等我！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.87,1:03:17.80,*CHS,721,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.97,1:03:22.00,*CHS,722,0,0,0,,活见鬼啊.哈利 这可不好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.17,1:03:26.41,*CHS,723,0,0,0,,这两个坏蛋 从没跟我提过活点地图
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.64,1:03:30.05,*CHS,724,0,0,0,,哈利不会留着的 他会把地图交给麦格教授
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.28,1:03:34.24,*CHS,725,0,0,0,,- 对吗？ - 喔.当然.连同他的隐形斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.42,1:03:36.91,*CHS,726,0,0,0,,喔.快瞧那个人.是罗丝莫塔女士
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.16,1:03:39.42,*CHS,727,0,0,0,,- 罗恩迷恋她 - 别胡说
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.59,1:03:41.46,*CHS,728,0,0,0,,- 麦格教授 - 康奈利
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.66,1:03:43.02,*CHS,729,0,0,0,,请让我来.部长
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.23,1:03:45.06,*CHS,730,0,0,0,,- 哦.海格！ - 非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.30,1:03:48.20,*CHS,731,0,0,0,,罗丝莫塔.亲爱的.希望你生意兴隆
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.40,1:03:52.30,*CHS,732,0,0,0,,要是你的魔法部不让摄魂怪 每隔一天晚上来搜查.那…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.47,1:03:56.85,*CHS,733,0,0,0,,- 我的生意会比现在好多了 - 我们…有个杀人凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.91,1:04:00.11,*CHS,734,0,0,0,,- 在逃 - 小天狼星布莱克来霍格莫德
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.44,1:04:02.91,*CHS,735,0,0,0,,可他为什么来？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.08,1:04:06.20,*CHS,736,0,0,0,,- 为哈利波特 - 哈利波特？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.72,1:04:13.71,*CHS,737,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.47,1:04:25.90,*CHS,738,0,0,0,,- 嘿.未成年男巫今天不能入内 - 把该死的门关上
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.14,1:04:28.11,*CHS,739,0,0,0,,- 真没礼貌 - 呆头呆脑
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.37,1:04:29.90,*CHS,740,0,0,0,,- 呆头呆脑？ - 好大胆！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.14,1:04:33.30,*CHS,741,0,0,0,,- 你说谁呆头呆脑 - 有逆反的小崽仔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.08,1:04:37.98,*CHS,742,0,0,0,,客人们发现店里有摄魂怪 以后谁还敢来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.15,1:04:42.09,*CHS,743,0,0,0,,邓布利多不希望摄魂怪来干扰. 这我可保证
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.86,1:04:46.65,*CHS,744,0,0,0,,说说.这到底怎么回事儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.82,1:04:51.28,*CHS,745,0,0,0,,好吧.许多年前.当哈利波特的父母 发现自己被追杀时
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.50,1:04:54.12,*CHS,746,0,0,0,,就藏了起来 没多少人知道他们藏哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.37,1:04:58.20,*CHS,747,0,0,0,,不过布莱克知道 他告诉了神秘人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.40,1:05:01.60,*CHS,748,0,0,0,,那天晚上布莱克不光 带神秘人去了波特家
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.81,1:05:05.14,*CHS,749,0,0,0,,还杀他们的一个朋友小矮星彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.38,1:05:07.54,*CHS,750,0,0,0,,- 小矮星彼得？ - 对.就是那个矮胖男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.75,1:05:09.98,*CHS,751,0,0,0,,- 总跟在布莱克的身后 - 噢.想起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.15,1:05:11.98,*CHS,752,0,0,0,,跟詹姆斯和布莱克形影不离
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.15,1:05:14.88,*CHS,753,0,0,0,,- 后来呢？ - 彼得想去警告波特的父母
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.05,1:05:19.25,*CHS,754,0,0,0,,本来可以成功的.可不料撞见了个老朋友 就是布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.46,1:05:23.29,*CHS,755,0,0,0,,布莱克凶狠毒辣 他不光杀死彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.49,1:05:25.66,*CHS,756,0,0,0,,而且毁灭了他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.30,1:05:31.03,*CHS,757,0,0,0,,一根手指.彼得只剩一根手指 没别的了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.24,1:05:33.23,*CHS,758,0,0,0,,是呀.虽然不是布莱克亲手杀的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.23,1:05:37.64,*CHS,759,0,0,0,,- 可正因为他.他们才会死 - 现在他想斩草除根
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.84,1:05:39.68,*CHS,760,0,0,0,,- 这我不相信 - 这还不是最糟的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.88,1:05:44.64,*CHS,761,0,0,0,,- 噢.还有更更糟的？ - 听着.布莱克以前是…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.85,1:05:46.98,*CHS,762,0,0,0,,并且现在依然是…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.42,1:05:49.05,*CHS,763,0,0,0,,哈利波特的教父
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.70,1:05:59.99,*CHS,764,0,0,0,,罗恩.快瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.74,1:06:08.30,*CHS,765,0,0,0,,- 对不起.对不起.让一下.请让一下 - 圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.74,1:06:48.58,*CHS,766,0,0,0,,哈利.怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.08,1:06:53.21,*CHS,767,0,0,0,,他是他们的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.72,1:06:55.95,*CHS,768,0,0,0,,可他出卖了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.75,1:06:58.72,*CHS,769,0,0,0,,算什么朋友！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.96,1:07:02.93,*CHS,770,0,0,0,,我希望他找到我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.56,1:07:05.89,*CHS,771,0,0,0,,他找到我.我跟他拼了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.40,1:07:08.96,*CHS,772,0,0,0,,他找到我.我就杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.25,1:07:24.87,*CHS,773,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.38,1:07:27.01,*CHS,774,0,0,0,,好啊.你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.42,1:07:31.29,*CHS,775,0,0,0,,你真要学吗.哈利？ 这是一种非常高深的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.46,1:07:33.92,*CHS,776,0,0,0,,大大高出普通魔法师的水平
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.09,1:07:35.62,*CHS,777,0,0,0,,真要学
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.19,1:07:38.68,*CHS,778,0,0,0,,好了.一切就绪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.93,1:07:42.30,*CHS,779,0,0,0,,我一会儿要教你念的咒语 叫守护神符咒
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.50,1:07:43.99,*CHS,780,0,0,0,,听说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.00,1:07:49.53,*CHS,781,0,0,0,,守护神是一种正面力量 魔法师若能使用它
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.74,1:07:54.37,*CHS,782,0,0,0,,它就像一块盾牌.使摄魂怪改变目标. 以它为食粮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.55,1:07:58.38,*CHS,783,0,0,0,,为使它起作用 必须回忆一段往事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.55,1:08:02.51,*CHS,784,0,0,0,,而且得是快乐的往事 一段强有力的回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.72,1:08:06.52,*CHS,785,0,0,0,,你能行吗？ 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.73,1:08:09.96,*CHS,786,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.73,1:08:13.63,*CHS,787,0,0,0,,集中思想
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.90,1:08:16.96,*CHS,788,0,0,0,,探索你的过去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.50,1:08:19.37,*CHS,789,0,0,0,,有回忆了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.97,1:08:23.17,*CHS,790,0,0,0,,让它笼罩着你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.84,1:08:25.93,*CHS,791,0,0,0,,让自己沉浸其中
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.24,1:08:31.58,*CHS,792,0,0,0,,然后说出这条咒语 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.02,1:08:34.85,*CHS,793,0,0,0,,- 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.66,1:08:41.99,*CHS,794,0,0,0,,开始吗？ 魔杖准备
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.81,1:09:02.40,*CHS,795,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.18,1:09:06.55,*CHS,796,0,0,0,,伊克斯派克托…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.78,1:09:08.51,*CHS,797,0,0,0,,伊克斯派克托…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.52,1:09:14.58,*CHS,798,0,0,0,,好了.来吧.坐起来 深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.89,1:09:18.69,*CHS,799,0,0,0,,没关系 我没指望你第一次就能成功
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.10,1:09:24.23,*CHS,800,0,0,0,,不然也太神了 来.吃这个.会好些的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:27.97,*CHS,801,0,0,0,,- 好可怕的摄魂怪 - 嗬.不不不….
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.17,1:09:30.90,*CHS,802,0,0,0,,那是一个博格特.博格特
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.08,1:09:34.24,*CHS,803,0,0,0,,真正的.更可怕 比这可怕得多
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.41,1:09:37.04,*CHS,804,0,0,0,,可我很想知道.你在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.21,1:09:40.91,*CHS,805,0,0,0,,- 选了哪一段回忆？ - 第一次骑扫帚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.12,1:09:45.45,*CHS,806,0,0,0,,这还不够好.实在不够好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.33,1:09:57.60,*CHS,807,0,0,0,,还有一段 它不算…快乐…可又
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.57,1:10:01.63,*CHS,808,0,0,0,,很快乐…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.84,1:10:04.36,*CHS,809,0,0,0,,那是我最快乐的记忆
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.58,1:10:08.53,*CHS,810,0,0,0,,- 可又是那么复杂 - 够强烈吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.92,1:10:15.75,*CHS,811,0,0,0,,那我们就试试吧 准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.56,1:10:19.28,*CHS,812,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.37,1:10:32.60,*CHS,813,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:37.77,*CHS,814,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.40,1:11:00.49,*CHS,815,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.50,1:11:05.90,*CHS,816,0,0,0,,干得好.哈利.干得好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.44,1:11:10.53,*CHS,817,0,0,0,,- 我想今天我练够了 - 是啊.坐下.来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.71,1:11:13.14,*CHS,818,0,0,0,,吃这个.挺管用的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.31,1:11:15.07,*CHS,819,0,0,0,,我告诉你吧.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.25,1:11:19.24,*CHS,820,0,0,0,,你的表现已经跟你老爸 不相上下了,这已经…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.42,1:11:21.48,*CHS,821,0,0,0,,很了不起了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.65,1:11:25.65,*CHS,822,0,0,0,,我想的是他
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.82,1:11:27.98,*CHS,823,0,0,0,,和妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.16,1:11:30.39,*CHS,824,0,0,0,,看见他们的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.03,1:11:33.72,*CHS,825,0,0,0,,他们在跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.90,1:11:36.20,*CHS,826,0,0,0,,就说话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.37,1:11:38.70,*CHS,827,0,0,0,,我选了那段回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.30,1:11:42.77,*CHS,828,0,0,0,,无论是真是假
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.24,1:11:45.40,*CHS,829,0,0,0,,都是最美的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.65,1:11:56.95,*CHS,830,0,0,0,,- 天气真好 - 好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.15,1:11:59.12,*CHS,831,0,0,0,,除非你被撕成碎片
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.29,1:12:01.72,*CHS,832,0,0,0,,撕成碎片.你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.89,1:12:05.06,*CHS,833,0,0,0,,- 罗恩把他的耗子给丢了 - 我可没把它丢了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.23,1:12:07.36,*CHS,834,0,0,0,,- 被你的猫吃了 - 净胡扯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.56,1:12:10.90,*CHS,835,0,0,0,,哈利.你也见过 她那只凶残的坏猫总是
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.07,1:12:14.97,*CHS,836,0,0,0,,贼头贼脑的 我的斑斑没了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.14,1:12:17.97,*CHS,837,0,0,0,,也许你该学会怎么照顾好你的宠物
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.18,1:12:19.23,*CHS,838,0,0,0,,- 你的猫把它吃了 - 没吃
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.41,1:12:21.88,*CHS,839,0,0,0,,- 吃了 - 没吃
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.95,1:12:26.58,*CHS,840,0,0,0,,听证会开得怎么样.海格？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.75,1:12:30.05,*CHS,841,0,0,0,,嗯.首先.委员们轮流谈了一下
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.22,1:12:32.88,*CHS,842,0,0,0,,为什么要召开听证会
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.76,1:12:37.42,*CHS,843,0,0,0,,然后我做了陈述.我说巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.59,1:12:40.59,*CHS,844,0,0,0,,是头好动物 总是清洁它的羽毛
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.80,1:12:43.79,*CHS,845,0,0,0,,然后.卢修斯·马尔福发言 结果可想而知
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.00,1:12:47.20,*CHS,846,0,0,0,,他说巴克比克是致命的生物
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.37,1:12:50.36,*CHS,847,0,0,0,,是危险的.它会杀人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.61,1:12:52.40,*CHS,848,0,0,0,,然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.11,1:12:55.81,*CHS,849,0,0,0,,卢修斯要求最严厉的惩罚
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.98,1:13:00.11,*CHS,850,0,0,0,,- 他们不能开除你 - 不.我没被开除
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.22,1:13:05.21,*CHS,851,0,0,0,,巴克比克被判处了死刑
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.08,1:13:37.61,*CHS,852,0,0,0,,有蜘蛛…有…有蜘蛛 蜘蛛要和我跳踢踏舞
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.82,1:13:40.35,*CHS,853,0,0,0,,- 我不想跳踢踏舞 - 那你跟蜘蛛说呀
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.56,1:13:44.52,*CHS,854,0,0,0,,是呀.跟它们说 会说的.明天再说
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.60,1:13:52.00,*CHS,855,0,0,0,,（费尔奇）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.44,1:13:56.77,*CHS,856,0,0,0,,（小矮星彼得）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.68,1:14:04.84,*CHS,857,0,0,0,,- 小矮星彼得？ - 就是那个矮胖男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.02,1:14:08.14,*CHS,858,0,0,0,,- 总跟在布莱克的身后 - 布莱克凶狠毒辣
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.35,1:14:10.82,*CHS,859,0,0,0,,他不光杀死了彼得 而且毁灭了他
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.90,1:14:22.35,*CHS,860,0,0,0,,- 快把灯熄了 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.58,1:14:35.17,*CHS,861,0,0,0,,（哈利波特 小矮星彼得）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.93,1:14:50.69,*CHS,862,0,0,0,,（小矮星彼得）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.27,1:15:04.76,*CHS,863,0,0,0,,（小矮星彼得）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.61,1:15:09.74,*CHS,864,0,0,0,,- 小心点.孩子 - 别吵着我们睡觉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.78,1:15:16.15,*CHS,865,0,0,0,,（斯内普）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.96,1:15:20.55,*CHS,866,0,0,0,,恶作剧完毕.莫克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.76,1:15:24.09,*CHS,867,0,0,0,,波特
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.26,1:15:27.75,*CHS,868,0,0,0,,晚上你在走廊里转悠些什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.97,1:15:28.99,*CHS,869,0,0,0,,我在梦游呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.20,1:15:31.76,*CHS,870,0,0,0,,你跟你的父亲怎么就这么像呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.00,1:15:36.74,*CHS,871,0,0,0,,波特他也是这么目中无人.趾高气扬 在城堡里逛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.94,1:15:41.27,*CHS,872,0,0,0,,我爸爸没有趾高气扬 我也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.01,1:15:44.91,*CHS,873,0,0,0,,要是你不介意 麻烦你把手中的魔杖放下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.65,1:15:50.48,*CHS,874,0,0,0,,把东西拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.16,1:15:54.78,*CHS,875,0,0,0,,快把东西…拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.69,1:15:59.32,*CHS,876,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.50,1:16:02.76,*CHS,877,0,0,0,,- 空白羊皮纸 - 打开.打开
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.37,1:16:12.90,*CHS,878,0,0,0,,现出你的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.81,1:16:18.28,*CHS,879,0,0,0,,你来念
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.72,1:16:26.21,*CHS,880,0,0,0,,月亮脸.虫尾巴.大脚板 尖头叉子四位先生
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.42,1:16:30.52,*CHS,881,0,0,0,,向斯内普先生问候致意 同时…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.83,1:16:32.32,*CHS,882,0,0,0,,念下去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.50,1:16:36.60,*CHS,883,0,0,0,,同时请求他不要伸长他的大鼻子 管别人的闲事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.60,1:16:40.13,*CHS,884,0,0,0,,- 呃.好你个胆大包天的小子 - 教授先生
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.77,1:16:44.47,*CHS,885,0,0,0,,喔…喔.卢平
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.64,1:16:49.34,*CHS,886,0,0,0,,出来散步吗？月光下漫步.是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.71,1:16:53.15,*CHS,887,0,0,0,,哈利.你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.35,1:16:55.82,*CHS,888,0,0,0,,这就得看情况啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.65,1:17:00.38,*CHS,889,0,0,0,,我刚从波特这儿没收了一个 相当奇怪的小玩意
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.56,1:17:04.08,*CHS,890,0,0,0,,你看看吧.卢平 这应该是你的专长
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.26,1:17:09.06,*CHS,891,0,0,0,,- 很显然这上面满是黑魔法… - 嗬.我看这也未必.西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.23,1:17:12.72,*CHS,892,0,0,0,,这只是张特制的羊皮纸 谁要读它的内容
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.80,1:17:16.77,*CHS,893,0,0,0,,它就羞辱谁 我猜这是佐科的产品.然而
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.97,1:17:21.21,*CHS,894,0,0,0,,我应该查一下 它是否还暗藏什么特性
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.38,1:17:24.51,*CHS,895,0,0,0,,正如你说的.这是我的专长 哈利.请跟我过来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.68,1:17:28.01,*CHS,896,0,0,0,,好吗？教授.晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.02,1:17:36.75,*CHS,897,0,0,0,,你聋了吗？快把灯熄啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.87,1:17:43.30,*CHS,898,0,0,0,,进来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.10,1:17:50.27,*CHS,899,0,0,0,,我真是一点都不明白.哈利 这地图怎么会落在你的手里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.51,1:17:54.97,*CHS,900,0,0,0,,可坦白地说 我十分的震惊.你居然没有上交
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.15,1:17:57.81,*CHS,901,0,0,0,,你想过没有这要是落到布莱克的手里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.81,1:18:01.01,*CHS,902,0,0,0,,他就能通过地图找到你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.82,1:18:04.29,*CHS,903,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.29,1:18:09.32,*CHS,904,0,0,0,,你父亲也是个不爱遵守规定的人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.53,1:18:13.83,*CHS,905,0,0,0,,可他和你母亲为了救你 献出了他们的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.74,1:18:23.17,*CHS,907,0,0,0,,却毫无戒备地在城堡里闲逛这么做算报答他们吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.41,1:18:25.57,*CHS,908,0,0,0,,现在我不会再为你掩饰了.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.74,1:18:28.18,*CHS,909,0,0,0,,- 听见了吗？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.35,1:18:32.01,*CHS,910,0,0,0,,我要你立刻回宿舍.呆在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.18,1:18:36.95,*CHS,911,0,0,0,,可别又绕远了 你要绕.我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.63,1:18:46.06,*CHS,912,0,0,0,,教授.其实这地图 并不是每次都准的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.93,1:18:51.89,*CHS,913,0,0,0,,刚才它显示有个人在城堡 可那人已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.30,1:18:55.03,*CHS,914,0,0,0,,是吗？那人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.21,1:18:56.73,*CHS,915,0,0,0,,小矮星彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.38,1:19:01.47,*CHS,916,0,0,0,,这绝对不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.68,1:19:04.34,*CHS,917,0,0,0,,反正我看见了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.18,1:19:08.88,*CHS,918,0,0,0,,晚安.教授
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.39,1:19:16.55,*CHS,919,0,0,0,,开阔你们的思路 眼光必须放远
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.73,1:19:22.17,*CHS,920,0,0,0,,水晶球占卜术的技巧在于 使你的天目变得清晰
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.33,1:19:25.67,*CHS,921,0,0,0,,只有这样.你们才能看见.再试一试
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.20,1:19:28.30,*CHS,922,0,0,0,,好了.这儿有什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.64,1:19:32.80,*CHS,923,0,0,0,,呃.我能试试吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.25,1:19:38.21,*CHS,924,0,0,0,,是…不详.有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.00,1:19:44.30,*CHS,925,0,0,0,,亲爱的 从你踏进我课堂的那一刻起
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.30,1:19:48.42,*CHS,926,0,0,0,,我就感觉你并不具备…卓越的法术
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.63,1:19:52.53,*CHS,927,0,0,0,,占卜所要求的素质 你瞧这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.70,1:19:57.30,*CHS,928,0,0,0,,喔.你虽然年纪小小 可惜你枯萎,就像一个老姑娘
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.43,1:20:00.53,*CHS,929,0,0,0,,你灵魂就像这些书的纸张那么干
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.70,1:20:03.80,*CHS,930,0,0,0,,这些你勤奋苦读的书
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.36,1:20:21.35,*CHS,931,0,0,0,,我说什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.03,1:20:31.02,*CHS,932,0,0,0,,她真的失去理智了 赫敏她以前时常也会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.20,1:20:33.76,*CHS,933,0,0,0,,可现在居然是在大庭广众之下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.97,1:20:36.10,*CHS,934,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.34,1:20:39.21,*CHS,935,0,0,0,,- 这得还回去 - 我才去咧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.54,1:20:42.94,*CHS,936,0,0,0,,- 那好.回头见 - 回头见
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.72,1:21:25.98,*CHS,937,0,0,0,,哈利波特…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.86,1:21:37.13,*CHS,938,0,0,0,,- 特里劳妮教授 - 今晚他会回来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.30,1:21:38.93,*CHS,939,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.14,1:21:43.73,*CHS,940,0,0,0,,布莱克.今晚.那出卖他朋友的人 那沦为杀人犯的人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.94,1:21:45.93,*CHS,941,0,0,0,,将挣脱锁链
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.14,1:21:48.37,*CHS,942,0,0,0,,无辜者的鲜血将流淌
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.55,1:21:54.54,*CHS,943,0,0,0,,那仆人和他的主子将再一次联起手来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.89,1:22:04.16,*CHS,944,0,0,0,,真抱歉.孩子 你说什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.96,1:22:06.76,*CHS,945,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.20,1:22:08.76,*CHS,946,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.35,1:23:05.38,*CHS,947,0,0,0,,他们居然要杀巴克比克 太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.56,1:23:08.30,*CHS,948,0,0,0,,- 现在更糟了 - 告诉你们.我爸爸说我能留着
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.46,1:23:12.62,*CHS,949,0,0,0,,那怪兽的头.我想我会把它 捐给格兰芬多公共休息室
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.83,1:23:15.26,*CHS,950,0,0,0,,噢.一定带劲
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.47,1:23:17.63,*CHS,951,0,0,0,,- 瞧.谁来了 - 哇.来看好戏的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.83,1:23:20.93,*CHS,952,0,0,0,,你…你这个恶心、讨厌、恶毒的小蟑螂
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.10,1:23:22.90,*CHS,953,0,0,0,,赫敏.别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.44,1:23:25.67,*CHS,954,0,0,0,,这么做不值得
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.79,1:23:41.85,*CHS,955,0,0,0,,马尔福.你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.06,1:23:46.26,*CHS,956,0,0,0,,- 好了.我们走…等等我 - 不许跟人何人说.懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.43,1:23:50.89,*CHS,957,0,0,0,,- 感觉真好 - 不光是好.是爽歪了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.29,1:24:14.59,*CHS,958,0,0,0,,喔.你瞧它 它爱风吹过石树的气息
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.76,1:24:17.02,*CHS,959,0,0,0,,我们干脆放了它？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.19,1:24:20.63,*CHS,960,0,0,0,,会怀疑是我放的 会给邓布利多找麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.80,1:24:23.79,*CHS,961,0,0,0,,他一会儿也要来他说要陪我度过…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.00,1:24:25.33,*CHS,962,0,0,0,,他一会儿也要来他说要陪我度过…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.37,1:24:28.36,*CHS,963,0,0,0,,度过这一刻
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.57,1:24:29.87,*CHS,964,0,0,0,,好人啦.邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.91,1:24:32.40,*CHS,965,0,0,0,,他是个大好人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.91,1:24:37.88,*CHS,966,0,0,0,,- 我们也陪你.海格 - 你们可别这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.05,1:24:41.21,*CHS,967,0,0,0,,这幕惨戮不会让你们看到的 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.42,1:24:45.05,*CHS,968,0,0,0,,喝完茶就走吧 呃.临走之前.罗恩…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.50,1:24:54.86,*CHS,969,0,0,0,,斑斑.你还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.03,1:24:58.73,*CHS,970,0,0,0,,- 得看好宠物.罗恩 - 看来现在你该道歉了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.94,1:25:02.70,*CHS,971,0,0,0,,呃对.下次我见到克鲁克山 会赔不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.87,1:25:03.90,*CHS,972,0,0,0,,是向我道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.64,1:25:06.84,*CHS,973,0,0,0,,真要命.怎么回事儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.32,1:25:14.72,*CHS,974,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.65,1:25:17.98,*CHS,975,0,0,0,,噢.天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.46,1:25:22.19,*CHS,976,0,0,0,,不.部长.就在这里边 还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.39,1:25:26.49,*CHS,977,0,0,0,,不早了.天快黑了 你们该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.66,1:25:30.43,*CHS,978,0,0,0,,晚上在城堡外面被人看见 就麻烦了.那是大麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.60,1:25:34.20,*CHS,979,0,0,0,,尤其是你.哈利 马上就来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.61,1:25:38.04,*CHS,980,0,0,0,,快走.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.21,1:25:39.94,*CHS,981,0,0,0,,海格
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.11,1:25:44.05,*CHS,982,0,0,0,,- 没事的.都会好的 - 快走.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.88,1:25:48.68,*CHS,983,0,0,0,,- 那叫石楠.石楠看见了吗？ - 就在那小山
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.85,1:25:51.51,*CHS,984,0,0,0,,- 坡上. - 海格.你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.69,1:25:54.38,*CHS,985,0,0,0,,- 邓布利多教授 - 部长
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.59,1:25:58.43,*CHS,986,0,0,0,,- 部长.快进屋吧.我们喝杯茶 - 不用.海格
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.53,1:26:03.09,*CHS,987,0,0,0,,- 先生们 - 我想喝杯茶
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.30,1:26:06.63,*CHS,988,0,0,0,,好.我们言归正传了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.80,1:26:11.37,*CHS,989,0,0,0,,处置危险生物委员会 现在作出决定.鹰头马兽
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.57,1:26:14.74,*CHS,990,0,0,0,,拒守法令.要成为死囚犯
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.91,1:26:20.41,*CHS,991,0,0,0,,将于今天日落时被处决
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.58,1:26:24.11,*CHS,992,0,0,0,,- 天哪… - 好了.好了.海格.好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.32,1:26:28.72,*CHS,993,0,0,0,,- 好吧.不会有事的 - 行刑手将死囚犯进行斩首处决
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.89,1:26:30.62,*CHS,994,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.79,1:26:32.89,*CHS,995,0,0,0,,我好像看见…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.06,1:26:35.16,*CHS,996,0,0,0,,- 算了.没什么 - 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.30,1:26:42.60,*CHS,997,0,0,0,,巴克比克可没有造成伤人啦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.12,1:27:30.59,*CHS,998,0,0,0,,哦.不
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.50,1:27:43.69,*CHS,999,0,0,0,,他咬我.斑斑！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.30,1:27:46.23,*CHS,1000,0,0,0,,罗恩.罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.20,1:27:50.70,*CHS,1001,0,0,0,,- 罗恩 - 斑斑.回来
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.24,1:27:53.97,*CHS,1002,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.92,1:28:04.22,*CHS,1003,0,0,0,,- 斑斑.你咬我 - 哈利.你应该认识这棵树吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.39,1:28:06.69,*CHS,1004,0,0,0,,这可不妙.罗恩快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.83,1:28:12.35,*CHS,1005,0,0,0,,哈利.赫敏.快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.93,1:28:14.56,*CHS,1006,0,0,0,,那是不详
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.60,1:28:24.60,*CHS,1007,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 罗恩…罗恩…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.84,1:28:26.81,*CHS,1008,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.41,1:28:30.78,*CHS,1009,0,0,0,,- 救我！- 罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.92,1:28:36.18,*CHS,1010,0,0,0,,- 罗恩.罗恩 - 罗恩！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.03,1:28:53.03,*CHS,1011,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.97,1:28:56.40,*CHS,1012,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.41,1:29:02.17,*CHS,1013,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.01,1:29:40.31,*CHS,1014,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.23,1:29:59.20,*CHS,1015,0,0,0,,- 真对不起 - 没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.40,1:30:03.27,*CHS,1016,0,0,0,,- 你说这通往那儿？ - 我已经猜到了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.84,1:30:05.31,*CHS,1017,0,0,0,,但愿我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.03,1:30:28.19,*CHS,1018,0,0,0,,我们在尖叫屋.对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.30,1:30:30.89,*CHS,1019,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.28,1:30:42.68,*CHS,1020,0,0,0,,罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.21,1:30:45.84,*CHS,1021,0,0,0,,- 罗恩.没事就好 - 那狗.它在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.05,1:30:49.28,*CHS,1022,0,0,0,,哈利.他就是那狗.他是阿尼玛格斯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.20,1:31:05.93,*CHS,1023,0,0,0,,想杀哈利.就把我们也杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.10,1:31:07.90,*CHS,1024,0,0,0,,不.今晚只会死一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.10,1:31:10.04,*CHS,1025,0,0,0,,那就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.25,1:31:18.41,*CHS,1026,0,0,0,,你这是要杀我吗.哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.62,1:31:21.45,*CHS,1027,0,0,0,,伊克斯派里阿默斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.19,1:31:29.35,*CHS,1028,0,0,0,,噢.好哇.布莱克 你都成这幅邋遢样了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.56,1:31:32.59,*CHS,1029,0,0,0,,这外表终于配上你内心的疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.20,1:31:36.83,*CHS,1030,0,0,0,,你的内心也同样疯狂 不是吗？雷莫斯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.24,1:31:48.21,*CHS,1031,0,0,0,,- 我找到他了 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.21,1:31:49.74,*CHS,1032,0,0,0,,- 他在这儿 - 这我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.91,1:31:53.11,*CHS,1033,0,0,0,,- 杀了他 - 不.我那么信任你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.55,1:31:57.28,*CHS,1034,0,0,0,,原来…你一直是布莱克的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.99,1:32:01.05,*CHS,1035,0,0,0,,他是个狼人.所以他没法来上课
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.86,1:32:05.56,*CHS,1036,0,0,0,,你知道多久了？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.06,1:32:09.26,*CHS,1037,0,0,0,,- 自从写了斯内普布置的文章 - 好吧 赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.47,1:32:12.40,*CHS,1038,0,0,0,,你这年纪的魔法师数你最聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.60,1:32:15.00,*CHS,1039,0,0,0,,别再说了.雷莫斯.快点去杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.20,1:32:17.76,*CHS,1040,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 我已经等够了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.97,1:32:20.41,*CHS,1041,0,0,0,,等了十二年了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.01,1:32:23.41,*CHS,1042,0,0,0,,在阿兹卡班…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.89,1:32:34.62,*CHS,1043,0,0,0,,那好吧…杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.19,1:32:38.96,*CHS,1044,0,0,0,,可你还得再等上一分钟 他有权知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.13,1:32:40.69,*CHS,1045,0,0,0,,我知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.93,1:32:43.16,*CHS,1046,0,0,0,,你出卖了我的父母
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.33,1:32:46.30,*CHS,1047,0,0,0,,- 是你把他们害死的 - 不.哈利.不是他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.44,1:32:48.34,*CHS,1048,0,0,0,,的确有人出卖你的父母 不过是别人
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.50,1:32:51.96,*CHS,1049,0,0,0,,而且我最近才知道… 那个人其实并没有死
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.21,1:32:55.67,*CHS,1050,0,0,0,,- 那人是谁？ - 彼得.小矮星
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.85,1:32:58.97,*CHS,1051,0,0,0,,他就在屋里.就现在
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.48,1:33:02.45,*CHS,1052,0,0,0,,出来…出来.彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.62,1:33:05.61,*CHS,1053,0,0,0,,- 来吧.快出来玩 - 伊克斯派里阿默斯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.56,1:33:11.00,*CHS,1054,0,0,0,,噢.复仇可真有快感
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.00,1:33:13.49,*CHS,1055,0,0,0,,我如愿以偿.亲手抓住你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.66,1:33:14.10,*CHS,1056,0,0,0,,西弗拉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.20,1:33:19.90,*CHS,1057,0,0,0,,我跟邓布利多说你在帮老朋友进入城堡.现在这就是证据
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.10,1:33:21.40,*CHS,1058,0,0,0,,好极了.斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.60,1:33:25.97,*CHS,1059,0,0,0,,这次.你那敏锐的洞察力又失误了 又得出了错误的结论
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.18,1:33:29.40,*CHS,1060,0,0,0,,我们就不奉陪了 雷莫斯.我还有未了的事情要解决
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.01,1:33:34.97,*CHS,1061,0,0,0,,- 给我个理由 - 让我杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.18,1:33:36.74,*CHS,1062,0,0,0,,- 西弗拉斯.你别傻 - 他是傻瓜.改不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.99,1:33:38.54,*CHS,1063,0,0,0,,- 布莱克.你安静！ - 给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.72,1:33:41.16,*CHS,1064,0,0,0,,好吧.听听你们俩.像老两口在拌嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.32,1:33:43.85,*CHS,1065,0,0,0,,我看你还是去玩过家家.配你的魔药吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.39,1:33:46.88,*CHS,1066,0,0,0,,我完全能杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.36,1:33:53.00,*CHS,1067,0,0,0,,可还是请摄魂怪代劳吧 他们一直盼着…见你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.20,1:33:55.86,*CHS,1068,0,0,0,,你好像有点害怕了？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.07,1:33:59.51,*CHS,1069,0,0,0,,喔.摄魂怪的吻.想想吧 那滋味一定够受的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.71,1:34:05.11,*CHS,1070,0,0,0,,有人说那场面实在是惨不忍睹 可我还是想…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.35,1:34:07.58,*CHS,1071,0,0,0,,西弗拉斯.别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.62,1:34:10.61,*CHS,1072,0,0,0,,你先请
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.06,1:34:16.79,*CHS,1073,0,0,0,,伊克斯派里阿默斯
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.56,1:34:22.12,*CHS,1074,0,0,0,,- 哈利.你干了什么？ - 你攻击了老师！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.37,1:34:24.93,*CHS,1075,0,0,0,,- 告诉我彼得的事 - 以前他跟我们是同学
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.10,1:34:26.76,*CHS,1076,0,0,0,,我们当他是朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.97,1:34:29.90,*CHS,1077,0,0,0,,- 不.彼得死了 是你杀的 - 不.不是他
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.11,1:34:33.27,*CHS,1078,0,0,0,,我以前也以为是他 直到你说起在地图上看见了彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.54,1:34:36.31,*CHS,1079,0,0,0,,- 那地图撒谎 - 那地图从不撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.51,1:34:40.47,*CHS,1080,0,0,0,,彼得还活着.他就在那儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.95,1:34:45.55,*CHS,1081,0,0,0,,- 我？这人疯了… - 不是你.是你的耗子！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.82,1:34:48.95,*CHS,1082,0,0,0,,- 斑斑已经在我家呆了… - 十二年！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.13,1:34:51.62,*CHS,1083,0,0,0,,一只普通耗子能活那么长吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.79,1:34:54.39,*CHS,1084,0,0,0,,- 他缺一个指头.对吗？ - 那又怎么！！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.56,1:34:57.53,*CHS,1085,0,0,0,,- 当时只找到彼得的… - 手指！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.73,1:35:00.96,*CHS,1086,0,0,0,,那懦夫把它割了 让大家以为他死了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.17,1:35:04.14,*CHS,1087,0,0,0,,- 然后他变形.变成了耗子 - 证明！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.78,1:35:09.84,*CHS,1088,0,0,0,,- 快给他.罗恩 - 你要把他怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.05,1:35:11.07,*CHS,1089,0,0,0,,斑斑.把他放了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.28,1:35:14.34,*CHS,1090,0,0,0,,不许碰他 你要干嘛！斑斑
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.84,1:35:38.67,*CHS,1091,0,0,0,,雷莫斯
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.44,1:35:40.91,*CHS,1092,0,0,0,,这…这是布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.11,1:35:43.01,*CHS,1093,0,0,0,,我的老朋友们
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.65,1:35:52.49,*CHS,1094,0,0,0,,哈利…瞧瞧你 你跟你父亲可真像.真像…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.66,1:35:56.99,*CHS,1095,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯.我们曾经是最好的朋友 - 你居然敢跟哈利说话
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.16,1:35:59.79,*CHS,1096,0,0,0,,你居然敢在他面前提起詹姆斯
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.00,1:36:05.19,*CHS,1097,0,0,0,,- 你把詹姆斯和莉莉出卖给了伏地魔.对吗 - 其实我也不想
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.40,1:36:08.20,*CHS,1098,0,0,0,,那黑魔头.天知道他有什么武器
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.40,1:36:11.00,*CHS,1099,0,0,0,,问问你自己吧.你会怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.41,1:36:16.97,*CHS,1100,0,0,0,,- 你会怎么做 - 我宁愿死！我宁愿死也不会出卖我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.18,1:36:21.55,*CHS,1101,0,0,0,,哈利.詹姆斯不会让我死,你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.75,1:36:24.42,*CHS,1102,0,0,0,,他会饶了我 他会饶了我的命
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.92,1:36:32.12,*CHS,1103,0,0,0,,你早该明白.彼得.伏地魔没杀你我们也会杀你.一齐动手
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.33,1:36:34.35,*CHS,1104,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.87,1:36:39.82,*CHS,1105,0,0,0,,- 哈利.这个人他是… - 我知道他是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.00,1:36:41.90,*CHS,1106,0,0,0,,把他带到城堡去
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.10,1:36:47.10,*CHS,1107,0,0,0,,- 保佑你.孩子.保佑你 - 滚开
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.28,1:36:50.68,*CHS,1108,0,0,0,,我们把你带到城堡
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.05,1:36:53.24,*CHS,1109,0,0,0,,然后.让摄魂怪处置你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.19,1:37:00.92,*CHS,1110,0,0,0,,抱歉.咬了你 一定有点疼吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.09,1:37:04.62,*CHS,1111,0,0,0,,一点？一点？ 你差点咬断我的腿
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.79,1:37:06.35,*CHS,1112,0,0,0,,我是想抓那耗子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.53,1:37:10.36,*CHS,1113,0,0,0,,通常我变成狗的时候脾气挺温顺的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.53,1:37:15.80,*CHS,1114,0,0,0,,其实.不只一次詹姆斯建议我 永远变成温顺的狗
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.97,1:37:20.81,*CHS,1115,0,0,0,,狗尾巴我能忍受 可跳蚤.真要命
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.39,1:37:34.88,*CHS,1116,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.90,1:37:42.42,*CHS,1117,0,0,0,,- 你去吧 - 别担心.没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.60,1:37:44.00,*CHS,1118,0,0,0,,我留下
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.80,1:37:46.77,*CHS,1119,0,0,0,,我留下.去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.10,1:37:50.16,*CHS,1120,0,0,0,,- 没事吗？ - 没事.走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.77,1:37:54.77,*CHS,1121,0,0,0,,- 看来一定很疼 - 疼得要命
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.94,1:37:57.47,*CHS,1122,0,0,0,,也许…也许会锯掉
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.98,1:38:00.64,*CHS,1123,0,0,0,,庞弗雷夫人一下子就能治好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.82,1:38:05.01,*CHS,1124,0,0,0,,完了.治不好了.一定会被锯掉
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.29,1:38:08.12,*CHS,1125,0,0,0,,瞧那儿多美呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.96,1:38:12.72,*CHS,1126,0,0,0,,我永远忘不了第一次 踏进城堡的大门
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.43,1:38:16.59,*CHS,1127,0,0,0,,作为自由人.再次走进去 感觉一定好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.73,1:38:21.53,*CHS,1128,0,0,0,,你决定不杀他很宽宏大量
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.37,1:38:24.46,*CHS,1129,0,0,0,,可他真的不配
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.67,1:38:27.84,*CHS,1130,0,0,0,,我爸爸不会希望他的好朋友 变成杀人犯的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.01,1:38:29.50,*CHS,1131,0,0,0,,我爸爸不会希望他的好朋友 变成杀人犯的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.75,1:38:33.44,*CHS,1132,0,0,0,,再说.真相要是活着
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.62,1:38:35.98,*CHS,1133,0,0,0,,你就能自由
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.15,1:38:39.25,*CHS,1134,0,0,0,,求求你了.把我变成虫子也行.就是别交给摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.46,1:38:42.79,*CHS,1135,0,0,0,,罗恩.我是好朋友吧.是好宠物吧 别把我交给摄魂怪.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.96,1:38:45.45,*CHS,1136,0,0,0,,我是你的耗子
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.63,1:38:49.66,*CHS,1137,0,0,0,,- 好姑娘.聪明姑娘.你不会让他们… - 别缠着他们.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.13,1:38:54.03,*CHS,1138,0,0,0,,你是不是知道.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.20,1:38:58.26,*CHS,1139,0,0,0,,你出生的时候 你父母让我做你的教父
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.47,1:39:00.41,*CHS,1140,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.58,1:39:05.64,*CHS,1141,0,0,0,,要是你还想住姨父家 我也能理解
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.81,1:39:08.28,*CHS,1142,0,0,0,,不过你要是想要个不同的家…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.48,1:39:10.98,*CHS,1143,0,0,0,,怎么？跟你一起住？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.29,1:39:15.38,*CHS,1144,0,0,0,,呃.这…这是个想法 你要不愿意.我也理解
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.56,1:39:17.35,*CHS,1145,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.61,1:39:36.27,*CHS,1146,0,0,0,,雷莫斯.我的好朋友 你今晚服过药吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.61,1:39:42.95,*CHS,1147,0,0,0,,你是一个真正的人.雷莫斯 这颗心是你真正的生命.这颗心.这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.32,1:39:46.31,*CHS,1148,0,0,0,,你可是有血有肉的人
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.46,1:39:49.55,*CHS,1149,0,0,0,,伊克斯派里阿默斯
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.64,1:40:01.19,*CHS,1150,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.30,1:40:05.24,*CHS,1151,0,0,0,,雷莫斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.45,1:40:13.78,*CHS,1152,0,0,0,,快跑.快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.79,1:40:25.82,*CHS,1153,0,0,0,,- 走 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.00,1:40:31.09,*CHS,1154,0,0,0,,- 赫敏 - 别过去…别过去…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.30,1:40:33.50,*CHS,1155,0,0,0,,卢平教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.61,1:40:39.10,*CHS,1156,0,0,0,,卢平教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.92,1:40:50.15,*CHS,1157,0,0,0,,好狗狗.好狗狗
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.59,1:40:53.11,*CHS,1158,0,0,0,,你在这儿.波特
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.92,1:41:27.95,*CHS,1159,0,0,0,,布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.79,1:41:31.19,*CHS,1160,0,0,0,,回来.波特
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.03,1:42:38.42,*CHS,1161,0,0,0,,布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.23,1:42:42.20,*CHS,1162,0,0,0,,不.布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.07,1:43:26.94,*CHS,1163,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.74,1:45:42.11,*CHS,1164,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.05,1:45:45.41,*CHS,1165,0,0,0,,我看见爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.61,1:45:47.17,*CHS,1166,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.38,1:45:48.91,*CHS,1167,0,0,0,,他赶走了摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.08,1:45:50.48,*CHS,1168,0,0,0,,他就在湖对面
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.69,1:45:52.31,*CHS,1169,0,0,0,,听着.哈利.他们抓走了布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.55,1:45:55.39,*CHS,1170,0,0,0,,摄魂怪随时会给他一个吻
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.56,1:45:58.05,*CHS,1171,0,0,0,,- 他们要处死他？ - 不.更糟
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.26,1:46:00.09,*CHS,1172,0,0,0,,比死还糟
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.26,1:46:02.63,*CHS,1173,0,0,0,,要吸出他的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.33,1:46:05.73,*CHS,1174,0,0,0,,校长.你必须阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.90,1:46:09.30,*CHS,1175,0,0,0,,- 他们抓错人了 - 是的.校长.布莱克是清白的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.47,1:46:11.60,*CHS,1176,0,0,0,,- 都是斑斑干的 - 斑斑？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.81,1:46:13.21,*CHS,1177,0,0,0,,他是我的耗子
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.61,1:46:17.41,*CHS,1178,0,0,0,,他不是真的耗子 他以前是耗子.我哥哥珀西的耗子
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.61,1:46:21.28,*CHS,1179,0,0,0,,- 可后来他就有了猫头鹰… - 我们知道了真相
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.48,1:46:23.97,*CHS,1180,0,0,0,,- 请相信我们 - 我相信.格兰杰小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.22,1:46:29.62,*CHS,1181,0,0,0,,可三个十三岁小魔法师说的话 其他人很难相信
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.73,1:46:35.49,*CHS,1182,0,0,0,,无论说得多诚实.如果别人不愿听
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.66,1:46:39.43,*CHS,1183,0,0,0,,再怎么说.也都是毫无意义的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.64,1:46:47.13,*CHS,1184,0,0,0,,时间是多么神秘
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.34,1:46:49.67,*CHS,1185,0,0,0,,多么有力
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.85,1:46:52.75,*CHS,1186,0,0,0,,时间被搅乱.就有危险
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.32,1:46:57.95,*CHS,1187,0,0,0,,布莱克被关在黑塔最高的牢房里
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.75,1:47:00.85,*CHS,1188,0,0,0,,你知道规定.赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.02,1:47:02.82,*CHS,1189,0,0,0,,不能让人看见
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.99,1:47:06.65,*CHS,1190,0,0,0,,我看最好在钟敲最后一声之前赶回来
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.83,1:47:10.36,*CHS,1191,0,0,0,,不然的话.这后果将不堪设想
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.90,1:47:12.70,*CHS,1192,0,0,0,,如果今晚成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.90,1:47:15.70,*CHS,1193,0,0,0,,就能拯救不只一条无辜的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.54,1:47:19.77,*CHS,1194,0,0,0,,转三下就可以
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.65,1:47:26.48,*CHS,1195,0,0,0,,喔.我随便说一句
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.65,1:47:32.48,*CHS,1196,0,0,0,,要记住.拿不定主意时 照原路再走一次是明智之举
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.65,1:47:34.71,*CHS,1197,0,0,0,,祝好运
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.22,1:47:37.69,*CHS,1198,0,0,0,,活见鬼.这是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.36,1:47:40.69,*CHS,1199,0,0,0,,对不起.罗恩.你好好养伤吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.69,1:48:11.28,*CHS,1200,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.46,1:48:13.76,*CHS,1201,0,0,0,,- 罗恩呢？ - 七点半
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.93,1:48:15.79,*CHS,1202,0,0,0,,七点半时.我们在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.96,1:48:17.76,*CHS,1203,0,0,0,,正在去海格的小屋吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.93,1:48:20.33,*CHS,1204,0,0,0,,快走.不能被看见
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.40,1:48:23.20,*CHS,1205,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.42,1:48:44.09,*CHS,1206,0,0,0,,赫敏…赫敏.等等
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.89,1:48:49.46,*CHS,1207,0,0,0,,赫敏.拜托.告诉我这是在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.66,1:48:52.50,*CHS,1208,0,0,0,,你这个恶心、讨厌、恶毒的小蟑螂
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.70,1:48:54.00,*CHS,1209,0,0,0,,那是我们耶
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.27,1:48:57.14,*CHS,1210,0,0,0,,赫敏.别这样 这么做不值得
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.37,1:48:58.77,*CHS,1211,0,0,0,,这真是太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.11,1:49:03.48,*CHS,1212,0,0,0,,这是时间转换器.哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.65,1:49:05.84,*CHS,1213,0,0,0,,第一学期.麦格教授给我的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.01,1:49:09.38,*CHS,1214,0,0,0,,所以一学年来.我能同时上几门课
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.58,1:49:12.78,*CHS,1215,0,0,0,,- 我们回到了以前 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.95,1:49:16.32,*CHS,1216,0,0,0,,显然邓布利多就是要我们回到这一刻
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.63,1:49:21.79,*CHS,1217,0,0,0,,他是要我们改变已经发生的事
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.93,1:49:26.26,*CHS,1218,0,0,0,,这一拳很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.43,1:49:27.92,*CHS,1219,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.97,1:49:30.56,*CHS,1220,0,0,0,,马尔福来了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.51,1:49:33.84,*CHS,1221,0,0,0,,- 不许跟人何人说.懂吗？ - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.31,1:49:37.37,*CHS,1222,0,0,0,,我会收拾那狂妄的泥巴种.等着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.55,1:49:41.30,*CHS,1223,0,0,0,,- 感觉真好 - 不光是好.是爽歪了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.40,1:49:43.45,*CHS,1224,0,0,0,,走吧.海格的小屋
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.57,1:50:07.10,*CHS,1225,0,0,0,,快瞧.巴克比克还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.58,1:50:10.48,*CHS,1226,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.65,1:50:12.64,*CHS,1227,0,0,0,,记得邓布利多怎么说的?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.81,1:50:16.84,*CHS,1228,0,0,0,,如果成功了 能拯救不只一条无辜的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.22,1:50:18.55,*CHS,1229,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.84,1:50:41.90,*CHS,1230,0,0,0,,他们来了 得赶快去
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.11,1:50:44.58,*CHS,1231,0,0,0,,让福吉看到巴克比克.我们再偷
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.78,1:50:47.25,*CHS,1232,0,0,0,,不然他会怀疑是海格
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.28,1:50:50.68,*CHS,1233,0,0,0,,斑斑.你还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.85,1:50:53.62,*CHS,1234,0,0,0,,- 得看好宠物… - 那是彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.86,1:50:56.76,*CHS,1235,0,0,0,,- 哈利.不能去 - 那家伙出卖了我父母.你要我
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.93,1:50:59.92,*CHS,1236,0,0,0,,- 在这儿干坐着？ - 是的.必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.80,1:51:06.53,*CHS,1237,0,0,0,,哈利.当时你在海格的小屋
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.70,1:51:09.53,*CHS,1238,0,0,0,,现在闯进去 你会以为自己疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.70,1:51:12.57,*CHS,1239,0,0,0,,胡乱改变过去.下场会很惨的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.74,1:51:14.97,*CHS,1240,0,0,0,,不能让人看见
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.28,1:51:20.01,*CHS,1241,0,0,0,,福吉来了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.92,1:51:23.01,*CHS,1242,0,0,0,,当时该走了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.15,1:51:26.75,*CHS,1243,0,0,0,,当时为什么不走？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.67,1:51:39.22,*CHS,1244,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.24,1:51:46.57,*CHS,1245,0,0,0,,那很疼
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.81,1:51:48.14,*CHS,1246,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.00,1:52:11.66,*CHS,1247,0,0,0,,我们从后门出来了.走
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.08,1:52:31.88,*CHS,1248,0,0,0,,我的头发从后面看真是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.96,1:52:35.29,*CHS,1249,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.16,1:52:37.99,*CHS,1250,0,0,0,,我好像看见…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.19,1:52:40.86,*CHS,1251,0,0,0,,- 算了.没事儿 - 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.18,1:52:57.47,*CHS,1252,0,0,0,,好.走.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.72,1:53:05.69,*CHS,1253,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.88,1:53:33.28,*CHS,1254,0,0,0,,呃.部长.我想我用不着签名了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.15,1:53:35.28,*CHS,1255,0,0,0,,怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.52,1:53:39.28,*CHS,1256,0,0,0,,好了.巴克比克.快来我们快点走.快走
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.76,1:53:46.45,*CHS,1257,0,0,0,,快点.快拉.快点
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.86,1:53:52.66,*CHS,1258,0,0,0,,快点.快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.50,1:53:56.77,*CHS,1259,0,0,0,,- 名字签在横线上 - 我的名字很长
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.17,1:53:58.87,*CHS,1260,0,0,0,,快点.巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.58,1:54:04.55,*CHS,1261,0,0,0,,快点.巴克比克
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.75,1:54:07.04,*CHS,1262,0,0,0,,快过来.很好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.68,1:54:14.18,*CHS,1263,0,0,0,,- 这儿.快点.巴克比克 - 这儿.部长.跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.39,1:54:16.05,*CHS,1264,0,0,0,,- 瞧那儿.看见吗？ - 哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.26,1:54:19.62,*CHS,1265,0,0,0,,- 瞧岩石后面 - 你这是要我看什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.79,1:54:23.29,*CHS,1266,0,0,0,,利皮教授做校长那会儿 种了那株石楠
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.46,1:54:26.30,*CHS,1267,0,0,0,,- 哦.是的…没错.没错 - 还有那些草莓
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.30,1:54:30.10,*CHS,1268,0,0,0,,- 快点.巴克比克.快点 - 我没见到草莓
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.27,1:54:31.43,*CHS,1269,0,0,0,,- 就在那儿 - 哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.64,1:54:33.37,*CHS,1270,0,0,0,,- 就在那儿 - 瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.61,1:54:36.27,*CHS,1271,0,0,0,,- 好的.先把正事干完吧 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.95,1:54:39.64,*CHS,1272,0,0,0,,它哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.58,1:54:42.78,*CHS,1273,0,0,0,,我刚才还看见它呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.42,1:54:45.61,*CHS,1274,0,0,0,,- 一会儿就不见了 - 实在是奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.79,1:54:47.12,*CHS,1275,0,0,0,,巴克比克？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.32,1:54:51.42,*CHS,1276,0,0,0,,糟糕.邓布利多 是有人把它放了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.59,1:54:53.05,*CHS,1277,0,0,0,,- 海格？ - 我发誓.不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.13,1:54:57.36,*CHS,1278,0,0,0,,我想部长并没说这事跟你有关
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.36,1:55:00.43,*CHS,1279,0,0,0,,是你呢 你一直跟我们在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.60,1:55:02.50,*CHS,1280,0,0,0,,- 对啊 - 那好.那好
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.67,1:55:04.14,*CHS,1281,0,0,0,,得搜查整个场地
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.34,1:55:07.33,*CHS,1282,0,0,0,,有必要的话搜一下天空吧.部长
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.54,1:55:12.98,*CHS,1283,0,0,0,,现在,我想品一杯好茶或者一大杯白兰地
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.15,1:55:17.14,*CHS,1284,0,0,0,,喔.行刑手 这儿不再需要你服务了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.32,1:55:19.18,*CHS,1285,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.39,1:55:22.69,*CHS,1286,0,0,0,,我屋子里可没有小杯子,教授
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.50,1:55:34.97,*CHS,1287,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 这边
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.78,1:55:43.54,*CHS,1288,0,0,0,,快来
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.98,1:55:47.71,*CHS,1289,0,0,0,,- 现在呢？ - 救布莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.92,1:55:50.41,*CHS,1290,0,0,0,,- 怎么救？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.73,1:56:02.09,*CHS,1291,0,0,0,,- 里劳克拉斯！ - 瞧.是卢平
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.57,1:56:10.50,*CHS,1292,0,0,0,,接着是斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.74,1:56:18.37,*CHS,1293,0,0,0,,现在我们等着
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.61,1:56:21.41,*CHS,1294,0,0,0,,现在我们等着
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.98,1:56:52.24,*CHS,1295,0,0,0,,- 至少有人乐在其中 - 是呀
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.05,1:56:56.81,*CHS,1296,0,0,0,,- 赫敏？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.99,1:57:01.32,*CHS,1297,0,0,0,,先前…在湖边跟布莱克一起时
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.49,1:57:03.62,*CHS,1298,0,0,0,,我是看到一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.79,1:57:07.23,*CHS,1299,0,0,0,,正是那个人赶走了摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.40,1:57:08.73,*CHS,1300,0,0,0,,用守护神符咒
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.90,1:57:10.80,*CHS,1301,0,0,0,,斯内普、邓布利多说过
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.97,1:57:12.43,*CHS,1302,0,0,0,,听他们的意思…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.60,1:57:16.00,*CHS,1303,0,0,0,,只有真正强大的魔法师才能施那个咒
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.20,1:57:18.07,*CHS,1304,0,0,0,,那是我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.17,1:57:20.97,*CHS,1305,0,0,0,,那个施魔咒的是我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.14,1:57:23.41,*CHS,1306,0,0,0,,- 可你爸爸已经… - 死了.我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.81,1:57:27.14,*CHS,1307,0,0,0,,可我的确看见了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.29,1:57:32.91,*CHS,1308,0,0,0,,我们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.59,1:57:40.96,*CHS,1309,0,0,0,,看见布莱克跟我说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.13,1:57:44.06,*CHS,1310,0,0,0,,- 他是要我跟他一起住 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.23,1:57:47.46,*CHS,1311,0,0,0,,等放了他.我就不用再回德思礼家了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.64,1:57:49.26,*CHS,1312,0,0,0,,只有我和他
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.94,1:57:51.87,*CHS,1313,0,0,0,,可以住在乡村
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.04,1:57:54.67,*CHS,1314,0,0,0,,可以看辽阔的天空
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.84,1:57:57.68,*CHS,1315,0,0,0,,被关了这么多年 他渴望自由
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.71,1:58:00.27,*CHS,1316,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.82,1:58:03.51,*CHS,1317,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.43,1:58:11.95,*CHS,1318,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.51,1:58:33.84,*CHS,1319,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？ - 救你的命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.09,1:58:39.49,*CHS,1320,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.32,1:58:45.35,*CHS,1321,0,0,0,,- 他冲我们来了 - 这我没料到.跑
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.50,2:00:02.23,*CHS,1322,0,0,0,,真是太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.40,2:00:05.34,*CHS,1323,0,0,0,,可怜的卢平一晚上真够呛
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.78,2:00:19.91,*CHS,1324,0,0,0,,布莱克.快走
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.97,2:00:38.00,*CHS,1325,0,0,0,,- 这可真恐怖 - 别担心
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.17,2:00:41.44,*CHS,1326,0,0,0,,我爸爸会来的.他会施守护神咒
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.15,2:00:51.98,*CHS,1327,0,0,0,,他就要来了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.19,2:00:54.21,*CHS,1328,0,0,0,,就在那儿.你会看见的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.62,2:00:58.11,*CHS,1329,0,0,0,,哈利.听我说.没人会来
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.29,2:01:00.82,*CHS,1330,0,0,0,,别担心.他会来的.一定会来
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.00,2:01:07.40,*CHS,1331,0,0,0,,- 布莱克 - 你快死了…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.50,2:01:11.30,*CHS,1332,0,0,0,,布莱克也是
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.41,2:01:15.14,*CHS,1333,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.04,2:01:20.91,*CHS,1334,0,0,0,,[守护神咒] 伊克斯派克托 派丘能姆
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.54,2:02:21.06,*CHS,1335,0,0,0,,你说得没对.赫敏
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.28,2:02:24.61,*CHS,1336,0,0,0,,先前看到的不是我爸爸.是我
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.78,2:02:27.54,*CHS,1337,0,0,0,,我在使守护神咒.这次我知道
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.72,2:02:30.08,*CHS,1338,0,0,0,,我能行.是因为…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.25,2:02:31.95,*CHS,1339,0,0,0,,我成功过
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.12,2:02:34.59,*CHS,1340,0,0,0,,- 这说得通吗？ - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.76,2:02:37.59,*CHS,1341,0,0,0,,我不喜欢飞
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.74,2:02:52.07,*CHS,1342,0,0,0,,冻德巴道
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.37,2:03:28.17,*CHS,1343,0,0,0,,救命之恩.永生难忘
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.34,2:03:29.67,*CHS,1344,0,0,0,,感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.84,2:03:32.78,*CHS,1345,0,0,0,,- 我想跟你走 - 以后吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.95,2:03:35.85,*CHS,1346,0,0,0,,接下来这段时间我会漂泊不定
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.02,2:03:37.78,*CHS,1347,0,0,0,,再说…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.69,2:03:41.99,*CHS,1348,0,0,0,,- 你该留在这儿 - 可…你是清白的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.16,2:03:44.28,*CHS,1349,0,0,0,,这一点你知道…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.36,2:03:47.26,*CHS,1350,0,0,0,,你知道就足够啦
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.56,2:03:52.12,*CHS,1351,0,0,0,,有句话你得听腻味了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.13,2:03:55.66,*CHS,1352,0,0,0,,你长得可真像你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.37,2:03:59.36,*CHS,1353,0,0,0,,除了你的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.34,2:04:02.64,*CHS,1354,0,0,0,,- 你的… - 眼睛像我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.58,2:04:09.68,*CHS,1355,0,0,0,,这挺惨酷.我跟你父母相处了 那么久,你却没这个福
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.28,2:04:11.77,*CHS,1356,0,0,0,,但你记住
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.89,2:04:16.05,*CHS,1357,0,0,0,,爱我们的人永远不会离开我们
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.43,2:04:19.39,*CHS,1358,0,0,0,,永远能找到的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.80,2:04:23.66,*CHS,1359,0,0,0,,在这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.04,2:04:36.57,*CHS,1360,0,0,0,,你这年龄的女魔法师里.你最聪明
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.37,2:05:05.00,*CHS,1361,0,0,0,,我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.30,2:05:35.96,*CHS,1362,0,0,0,,- 怎么？ - 他自由了.我们做到了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.17,2:05:37.64,*CHS,1363,0,0,0,,做到什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.87,2:05:39.81,*CHS,1364,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.58,2:05:49.91,*CHS,1365,0,0,0,,怎么蹦那儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.08,2:05:52.75,*CHS,1366,0,0,0,,说话的时候在这儿 可现在在那儿？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.09,2:05:55.68,*CHS,1367,0,0,0,,- 他在说什么啊？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.89,2:05:59.42,*CHS,1368,0,0,0,,一个人怎么可能同时在两个地方呢
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.92,2:06:27.41,*CHS,1369,0,0,0,,你好.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.03,2:06:32.86,*CHS,1370,0,0,0,,我看见你来了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.43,2:06:40.13,*CHS,1371,0,0,0,,我这样子还不算是最糟的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.87,2:06:45.96,*CHS,1372,0,0,0,,- 你被开除了？ - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.17,2:06:49.14,*CHS,1373,0,0,0,,不.其实我…辞职
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.31,2:06:51.07,*CHS,1374,0,0,0,,辞职？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.25,2:06:56.55,*CHS,1375,0,0,0,,有人说漏了嘴 无意中把我的情况抖了出去
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.72,2:07:02.21,*CHS,1376,0,0,0,,明天这时候.猫头鹰们就要捎信来了 家长们不会想要…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.39,2:07:05.76,*CHS,1377,0,0,0,,我这样的人.教他们的孩子
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.99,2:07:07.89,*CHS,1378,0,0,0,,- 可邓布利多… - 邓布利多为我担的风险
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.06,2:07:09.93,*CHS,1379,0,0,0,,已经够多了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.10,2:07:13.36,*CHS,1380,0,0,0,,再说.像我这样的人…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.00,2:07:17.30,*CHS,1381,0,0,0,,算了.反正我都已经习以为常了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.88,2:07:29.44,*CHS,1382,0,0,0,,干嘛哭丧着脸.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.62,2:07:31.78,*CHS,1383,0,0,0,,一切都是徒劳
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.99,2:07:35.51,*CHS,1384,0,0,0,,- 彼得逃走了 - 一切都是徒劳？我看是扭转
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.69,2:07:39.18,*CHS,1385,0,0,0,,乾坤了.你帮忙揭露 了真相.拯救了一个
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.36,2:07:41.85,*CHS,1386,0,0,0,,清白的人免遭厄运
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.23,2:07:44.72,*CHS,1387,0,0,0,,怎么能说是徒劳呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.40,2:07:51.53,*CHS,1388,0,0,0,,让我觉得骄傲的是
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.74,2:07:54.37,*CHS,1389,0,0,0,,这学年你学会了很多
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.58,2:07:57.27,*CHS,1390,0,0,0,,既然我不再是你的老师了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.51,2:08:01.74,*CHS,1391,0,0,0,,那我可以无所顾忌地把这还给你
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.65,2:08:05.14,*CHS,1392,0,0,0,,现在该说再见了.哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.32,2:08:07.91,*CHS,1393,0,0,0,,我们一定会后会有期
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.46,2:08:09.79,*CHS,1394,0,0,0,,不过现在…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.13,2:08:12.82,*CHS,1395,0,0,0,,恶作剧完毕
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.56,2:08:17.16,*CHS,1396,0,0,0,,（活点地图）
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.09,2:08:51.29,*CHS,1397,0,0,0,,不许乱摸 不乖些.我就拿楼上去
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.47,2:08:52.86,*CHS,1398,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.70,2:08:55.10,*CHS,1399,0,0,0,,这里是从哪弄来的？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.30,2:08:57.67,*CHS,1400,0,0,0,,我能骑吗.哈利？ 等你骑过之后
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.84,2:08:59.97,*CHS,1401,0,0,0,,- 你们在说什么呀？ - 都安静
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.17,2:09:03.47,*CHS,1402,0,0,0,,给老大让路 我…我其实没想打开的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.64,2:09:06.11,*CHS,1403,0,0,0,,可它包得很不好 他们叫我打开的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.31,2:09:07.78,*CHS,1404,0,0,0,,别胡说
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.18,2:09:12.68,*CHS,1405,0,0,0,,- 这是火努箭 - 最快的飞天扫帚
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.85,2:09:14.38,*CHS,1406,0,0,0,,给我的？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.59,2:09:17.11,*CHS,1407,0,0,0,,- 谁送的？ - 没人知道
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.29,2:09:19.19,*CHS,1408,0,0,0,,还有这个
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.03,2:09:25.90,*CHS,1409,0,0,0,,- 骑上去让我们看看 - 这下我们一定能赢魁地奇杯
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.90,2:09:27.70,*CHS,1410,0,0,0,,它能飞多快.哈利？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.05,2:09:48.68,*CHS,1411,0,0,0,,鼓德尤莫斯
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.86,2:09:51.26,*CHS,1412,0,0,0,,我郑重宣誓.我会用这个来搞怪
